window.FWN_MADAMS_IDENTITIES_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_MADAMS_IDENTITIES_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3301,"title":"Chapter 3301: I Arranged A Few Experts to Come","paragraphs":["Chapter 3301: I Arranged A Few Experts to Come","Editor: Atlas Studios","She first went to the hospital to see Nie Qixing.","Then, she went to the private hospital where Master Cheng was hospitalized.","The lines of the black car were smooth. It was obvious that it was a luxury car.","The car slowly stopped under the shadows of the trees outside. After the chauffeur parked the car, he slowly turned around and carefully said, “Empress, we’re here.”","Nie Qingru rubbed her swollen forehead, slowly opened her eyes, and looked out the window expressionlessly. “Let’s stay here for now.”","The chauffeur did not dare to make a sound and obediently looked to the front.","Nie Qingru picked up her cell phone and found the number she had yet to save. She paused for half a second before dialing.","The chauffeur waited for an hour in boredom.","He did not understand what the Empress was waiting for. After a long time, he saw a figure walk out of the private hospital, getting closer and closer.","He quickly recognized who it was.","Qiao Nian!","The chauffeur revealed a surprised expression, but he didn’t dare to turn around or make a sound. He was shocked that the Empress, with her status, would actually wait by the roadside for so long.","And the other party had the guts to dawdle for nearly an hour before coming out.","...","The chauffeur saw the girl walking out of the hospital. Of course, Nie Qingru also saw Qiao Nian.","She opened the car door and got out. She sized up the slowly approaching girl and could not help but mock, “You’re quite busy. I have to wait outside to see you.”","“Oh.” The girl stopped and pulled down her baseball cap, looking at her arrogantly. “You should be glad that I’m still willing to come out and see you.”","“You!”","Nie Qingru’s temples throbbed wildly again.","She suppressed her disgust and finally did not forget the purpose of her special visit. She asked in a condescending tone, “How is Master Cheng?”","“...”","Qiao Nian suppressed her emotions and took a lighter from her pocket to play with.","She rubbed her fingers against the lighter and suddenly raised her head. She licked her lower lip and smiled at Nie Qingru. She was quite frivolous and arrogant. “What’s wrong? A weasel paying New Year’s greetings to a chicken?”","Nie Qingru quickly understood the sarcasm. She could no longer hide her anger and shouted in a low voice, “Qiao Nian!”","The girl did not take her seriously. She only dug her ears. Everything was obvious.","It meant, ‘Why are you shouting? I’m not deaf yet.’","Nie Qingru couldn’t accept this kind of careless and reckless behavior.","No matter what, Ji Qing was as sensible and obedient as possible in front of her back then. She rarely caused trouble for her, let alone contradict her like Qiao Nian.","Nie Qingru couldn’t accept her attitude and blurted out, “Where’s your upbringing?”","Unexpectedly, the girl suddenly looked up at her.","Her gaze was cold and heavy.","Nie Qingru was at a loss for words. She didn’t know why she stopped teaching her a lesson. She felt that if she continued, Qiao Nian would turn around and leave.","However, she had other motives for coming here today. It was not to quarrel with her.","Nie Qingru could only suppress her burning anger and forcefully calm down. “I’ve arranged for a few experts to come over. They’re all top-notch doctors in the surgical field. They’ll be here later. You can let them take a look at Master Cheng.”","It was just two sentences, but she spoke with great difficulty, as if this was beneath her."]},{"number":3302,"title":"Chapter 3302: Not Lacking Money and Connections","paragraphs":["Chapter 3302: Not Lacking Money and Connections","Editor: Atlas Studios","Nie Qingru did not forget to emphasize, “Don’t worry, I won’t go so far as to tamper with the doctors. They’ll seriously treat Master Cheng...”","The lighter in Qiao Nian’s hand clicked open, and a dark blue flame came to life. She did not even look up, and her tone was light as if she was talking to a stranger. “What’s the condition?”","“...”","Nie Qingru’s suppressed anger almost flared up again. “Do I need a condition to help you? Don’t forget, I’m your...”","Before she could say “grandmother”...","The girl put on the lighter cap and gave her a sidelong glance. Her gaze was half-smiling, as if she was looking at an idiot. “I won’t ask a third time. What’s the condition?”","What kind of attitude is this!","Nie Qingru’s chest was stuffed, and her lips trembled. However, she knew Qiao Nian was serious, so she stopped pretending to be loving.","She simply said, “Delete the photo on Instagram. Also, tell the Privy Council that you created it.”","She had left a few photos behind when she was young and burned the few she had.","She never expected Ji Qing to leave one behind and even hide it.","When she saw the token left behind by Ji Qing under the photo, her eyelids twitched.","The news had just spread that a woman had been secretly hidden during the weapons exhibition.","Then, Qiao Nian sent these photos to the Privy Council.","Forget about the woman’s photo.","But her photo...","Nie Qingru felt a headache when she thought of the Privy Council’s attitude. There was only one solution now: refuse to admit it.","In addition, she would ask the person who sent the photo to take the blame and say the photo was a composite.","This way, there might be room for negotiation.","Qiao Nian did not say anything and just asked, “Did you see the signature on the photo?”","Nie Qingru frowned subconsciously and said impatiently, “I’m not discussing this with you now. None of this is important. What’s important is that I want you to delete the Instagram post...”","“Ah!”","The girl suddenly chuckled and interrupted her.","Nie Qingru narrowed her eyes threateningly as if saying, “What tricks are you up to again?”","Unexpectedly, after Qiao Nian chuckled, her expression became surly, and she looked at her aggressively. “You want to push the blame on her?”","“Qiao Nian!” Nie Qingru’s expression changed slightly and she warned her coldly not to spout nonsense.","However, Qiao Nian was not the kind of person who would care about that. She directly exposed her hypocrisy and said openly, “To protect Nie Qixing, you wanted to blame her for the dirty things he did. Then, the two of you would leave unscathed.”","She gave Nie Qingru a thumbs up and said mockingly, “You’re really something! You even want to make full use of a dead person.”","She wasn’t afraid of not being able to sleep at night!","Nie Qingru’s expression could no longer be described as bad. Her eyes shot her a warning. No one dared to speak like this to her.","If possible, she wished she could pinch this evil creature to death on the spot!","Qiao Nian did not want to argue with her. It was just that when she heard her swaggering words, she could not help but retort.","“Money, I have some.","“I don’t lack connections either.","“As for the doctors...” At this point, she paused for half a second and sized up Nie Qingru with her half-closed eyes for a moment, then coldly said, “You might not even be able to summon the people I have called.”"]},{"number":3303,"title":"Chapter 3303: Elder Xue Is Considering?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3303: Elder Xue Is Considering?","Editor: Atlas Studios","She was talking about Zhong Yiliu and Mr. Huang.","If Master Cheng needed it, she could immediately get Slim Waist Control to prepare a plane to pick up these two masters. She did not lack Nie Qingru’s ‘kindness’.","“What are you trying to say?” Nie Qingru could tell she was trying to hide something, and her expression worsened.","Other people were afraid of her, but Qiao Nian was not. She only looked at her casually and said concisely, “I won’t delete the photo, and don’t even think about the Privy Council. I just want to see your choice. The path is right in front of you. Didn’t you choose power and status without hesitation back then? You can make the same choice right now. After all, crushing Nie Qixing to death should be as easy as killing an ant for the Empress of the reclusive families! There’s no need for you to hesitate.”","Nie Qingru felt as if she had been slapped when she brought up what had happened back then.","Her face turned green and white. The way she looked at her could no longer be described as disgust. It was as if she had seen the shadow of another person through Qiao Nian.","She gritted her teeth in hatred and wished she could skin the other party alive.","“I’m your grandmother!”","She watched as the girl turned to leave.","Nie Qingru reminded her loudly, “I’m your grandmother, and Nie Qixing is your elder! Do you still have any humanity left? It’s fine if you don’t have any upbringing, but don’t you even have a conscience?”","The girl paused for half a second before walking away without looking back.","It was as if she shouldn’t have paused for even half a second and should have just walked away.","Nie Qingru looked at her back. The anger in her heart became more and more suffocating, and it was so suffocating that she could not recover for a long time.","10 minutes later.","The chauffeur took a call and saw that she was still not moving. He could only carefully walk to her side and softly say, “Empress, Shadow is looking for you.”","Nie Qingru finally reacted. She glared at the direction the girl left in, turned around, returned to the car, and slammed the door shut.","Then, she ordered the chauffeur with a sharp gaze, “Go back!”","* * *","She meant to go back to the hospital where Nie Qixing was hospitalized.","Before making a final decision, to ensure Nie Qixing’s safety, she asked Shadow to stay there to prevent the Privy Council from making a decision behind her back.","The black car slowly drove into the hospital’s detached building.","Shadow had been waiting there for a while.","Upon seeing the car, he quickly jogged over and opened the door for her.","The person in the car got out. It was obvious that she was in a bad mood.","Shadow could only lower his head and call out respectfully, “Empress.”","“Why are you looking for me?” Nie Qingru was not in the mood to even acknowledge him. As she walked in, she asked him directly.","Shadow followed behind her. “Elder Xue from the Privy Council just came to see Young Master Qi. I stopped him and persuaded him to leave. But he said that he would come back later. I’m afraid he will do something drastic when you’re not around.”","Nie Qingru stopped in her tracks and turned to look at him. Her distraught was obvious. “Why did he come?”","“Elder Xue asked... have you thought it through?”","“...”","The conservatives had been on her side recently.","She had almost forgotten that the old man prioritized the reclusive families over her, the Empress.","Now that such a thing had happened, it was inevitable he would force her to make a quick decision.","Nie Qingru only felt that the anger in her chest was getting more and more suffocating. She had never been forced to this extent by anyone."]},{"number":3304,"title":"Chapter 3304: Nie Qixing Fell In Love With His Biological Sister","paragraphs":["Chapter 3304: Nie Qixing Fell In Love With His Biological Sister","Editor: Atlas Studios","Seeing that she did not look too good, Shadow raised his head slightly and asked, “Empress, what did Qiao Nian say? If she’s willing to cooperate, there’s still room for negotiation...”","He knew that Qiao Nian had posted an old photo of the Empress on Instagram.","It had just been rumored that Young Master Qi was hiding a woman during the weapons exhibition.","At this juncture, Qiao Nian’s photo was almost fatal!","Once the Privy Council saw the old photo of the Empress that Miss Ji Qing had saved, they would immediately realize that the woman that Young Master Qi was hiding was not like Miss Ji Qing at all, but like the Empress when she was young!","Although the Empress and Miss Ji Qing were mother and daughter...","However, there was still a slight difference between them.","For example, when she was young, the Empress was even more domineering and cold. Her temperament kept people a thousand miles away.","She was a typical cold beauty.","As for Miss Ji Qing, she was gentler and more scholarly.","Rather than saying that the woman Young Master Qi was hiding was 30% similar to Miss Ji Qing, it would be more accurate to say that she was 80% similar to the young Empress!","In other words... Young Master Qi had inappropriate thoughts about the Empress.","Shadow had a headache when he thought of this.","He stole a glance at the person walking in front of him.","After all, he was a grown adult and knew what was going on.","Even if the Empress maintained herself well and had always lived a pampered life, with very few things she needed to do herself... time still left an indelible mark on her face. The fine lines at the corners of her eyes and brows that could not be hidden were all traces of time.","However, she and Qiao Nian were similar people.","Their aura was too strong.","People easily overlooked their age at first glance and subconsciously submitted to their aura. He did not know when Young Master Qi had developed abnormal feelings for the Empress.","However, the insurmountable age difference between the Empress and Young Master Qi was undeniable.","They were biological siblings!","Same parents!","This was also why everyone had such a big reaction when they realized the secret in the photo. The Privy Council even forced the Empress to make a quick decision.","The Empress was the symbol of the reclusive families.","They would not allow such a stain to exist on her.","Therefore, it would be fine if Qiao Nian cooperated. They could still deny it and claim that the person Young Master Qi liked was the dead Ji Qing.","If Qiao Nian did not cooperate...","Then the Empress would have to deal with Young Master Qi to protect the reclusive families and her reputation.","And the best way to cover up such an ugly matter was to make that person with inappropriate intentions... completely disappear from this world!","This time, Qiao Nian played them like monkeys step by step. Her methods were so sharp that she did not look like she was only 20 years old. It was too terrifying.","No wonder the Empress often said she was too much like Old Master Ji back then.","However, Shadow still had some illusions. “You’re her grandmother, and you even went to look for her. You’re even willing to find doctors for Master Cheng. She probably won’t hold on to it... She’s really after Young Master Qi’s life.”","At this moment, Nie Qingru finally spoke, “... Of course she won’t take Qixing’s life.”","“That’s good.” Shadow heaved a sigh of relief.","Right on the heels of that, Nie Qingru continued in a suppressed cold tone, “What she wants is for me to do it myself.”","Shadow’s pupils trembled, and his heart turned cold. A bucket of ice water splashed down, and he subconsciously asked, “Then, Empress, you...”","He wanted to know what the Empress would choose.","Young Master Qi was still...","Nie Qingru’s brows furrowed fiercely, and her expression was terrifyingly dark. She did not answer his question directly. Instead, she said, “Let’s go and see him first.”","Shadow knew she was talking about Nie Qixing, but his heart skipped a beat.","The Empress wouldn’t...","However, Nie Qingru had already walked forward.","He could only follow closely behind."]},{"number":3305,"title":"Chapter 3305: I Don’t Believe That I Can Only Be Led by an Asian Girl","paragraphs":["Chapter 3305: I Don’t Believe That I Can Only Be Led by an Asian Girl","Editor: Atlas Studios","Nie Qingru stopped outside the ward and did not walk in.","Shadow stood behind her for a while. Seeing she did not move, he asked carefully, “Empress, aren’t you going in?”","The only reply he got was a deathly silence.","Nie Qingru stood at the door. Through the glass, she saw a portion of the ward. Nie Qixing was lying quietly on the bed as if dead.","She stood at the door for a while.","Then, under Shadow’s gaze, she turned around and walked out.","“Empress.”","Shadow’s heart beat faster and he called out to her.","Nie Qingru did not even turn around. Ignoring him, she said in a cold and solemn tone, “I don’t believe that I can only be led by the nose by an Asian girl!”","She had to think of another way.","* * *","In the next two days, Qiao Nian did not get any more news related to Nie Qingru and the Privy Council.","However, after being suppressed by Nie Qingru, her Instagram post gained popularity again, and more and more people discussed it.","Qin Si had been online all this time and roughly knew what Qiao Nian wanted to do.","Two days had passed, and there was no new news from Nie Qingru or the reclusive families. He was a little anxious for Qiao Nian.","While Qiao Nian and Ye Wangchuan were coming to the hospital...","He pulled Qiao Nian aside and asked with a serious expression, “Sister Qiao, about the photo...”","The girl was still wearing a baseball cap nonchalantly.","She casually leaned against the wall and raised the brim of her cap with her cold white hand, revealing her clear eyes. She glanced at him and knew what he wanted to ask her.","“No hurry.”","“Uh...” Qin Si did not understand. How could he not be anxious?!","Qiao Nian, on the other hand, was calm. Her fingers touched the silver lighter in her pocket and slowly rubbed it. The corners of her lips curled up into a rather dry smile. “She’s the Empress of the reclusive families, after all. She has to drag it out for a few days.”","She had never looked down on Nie Qingru.","Nie Qingru could become the symbol of the reclusive families and surpass others. She more or less had some tricks up her sleeve, so she would not be easily forced into a dead end.","However, there was almost no solution to Nie Qixing’s matter.","No matter how much Nie Qingru struggled, she still had to face reality in the end.","Choose Nie Qixing?","Or choose herself!","Qin Si looked at her suspiciously, but seeing that Qiao Nian did not want to go deeper, he did not ask further.","At this moment, Gu San ran out and said excitedly, “Master Cheng is awake!”","Everyone in the corridor, including Bo Zheng and Luo Qing, trembled and quickly walked toward the ward.","Qiao Nian and Qin Si also went to Master Cheng’s ward.","...","Master Cheng was seriously injured this time and only woke up after a few days.","Equipped with a ventilator and an intravenous drip on the back of his hand, although he was ‘awake’, he was actually just opening his eyes.","His eyes were still filled with confusion.","However, the moment he saw Qiao Nian and Ye Wangchuan enter the ward, Master Cheng’s gaze finally focused and he spoke.","“Lug...”","“What did you say?”","Master Cheng’s lips were dry and cracked. He tried his best to speak, but his words were vague and could not be heard clearly.","Luo Qing was so anxious that he was sweating. He turned to the others and asked, “What is Master Cheng saying? I don’t understand a single word!”"]},{"number":3306,"title":"Chapter 3306: Still Dreaming","paragraphs":["Chapter 3306: Still Dreaming","Editor: Atlas Studios","Bo Zheng did not hear him clearly and stood by the bed with a frown.","Qiao Nian heard it clearly. With a thought, she guessed what the old man was talking about.","The person beside her was faster. He sat in front of the bed, held the old man’s hand, and said in a low voice, “You didn’t lose your luggage. The data is also intact.”","Master Cheng relaxed and his body was no longer tense. He looked at Ye Wangchuan and Qiao Nian with difficulty and moved his lips.","This time, she could roughly tell what he was saying.","—Thank you.","From the moment Master Cheng was suddenly stabbed to the moment he fell into a semi-conscious state until now, he did not care if he lived or died.","All he cared about was the computer data in his luggage.","He had spent half his life on this research, afraid they would fall into the hands of people outside Beijing.","Everything else, even his own life, was not as important as what he protected!","Qiao Nian recalled that he was still thinking about his luggage and data when he was half-conscious. Her chest felt stuffy.","Clenching her fists and lowering her eyes, she restrained the hostility in her eyes and said gently, “Don’t worry, I’ll definitely give you an explanation.”","Nie Qixing and the reclusive families always felt that they were better and different from the rest, that they could casually decide everyone else’s life and death.","This time, it was the other way around.","How could they remain calm when their lives were being decided by others?","**","Nie Qingru had not rested well for the past two days.","She would wake up in less than an hour after closing her eyes. The migraine became even more serious.","After two days, there was no progress at all.","Even she could not help but feel frustrated and depressed.","“Empress.” Shadow walked in and saw her rubbing her temples. He asked worriedly, “Is your illness acting up again?”","Nie Qingru did not seem to mind. She raised her hand and looked at him, asking, “What did the archbishop say? Is his attitude still the same?”","Shadow himself had not slept for two days. He did not dare to look into her eyes. He half-knelt in front of her and lowered his head in shame. “I was useless.”","That sly old fox!","Nie Qingru’s migraine worsened.","She did not have the time to be angry. She combed her hair and asked, “Where’s Elder Xue?”","“He came to you several times, urging you to make a decision...” Shadow’s voice was dry and difficult.","Even Nie Qingru’s breathing was amplified infinitely. The corners of her mouth twitched in frustration and coldness. “Heh, they really can’t wait.”","Shadow knew he shouldn’t say it, but the situation had reached a dead end.","“Empress, why don’t you plead with her again?”","“...”","Who?she?was went without saying.","Nie Qingru’s eyelids twitched as she stared at him.","Shadow’s back tensed up like a stringed bow. He continued under pressure, “This is the only way to save Young Master Qi! Unless she’s willing to let go...”","As long as Qiao Nian was willing to relent, they could still push the blame on the dead Miss Ji Qing.","Young Master Qi would still have a chance of survival.","Of course, Shadow did not think he was doing the right thing. It was just that he had watched Young Master Qi grow up and had an extraordinary relationship with him.","Furthermore, Miss Ji Qing had been dead for so long.","Reputation was not that important to a dead person.","At least it was not as important as Young Master Qi’s life.","Shadow pleaded hoarsely, “You’re her grandmother. As long as you tell her nicely, she will understand...”"]},{"number":3307,"title":"Chapter 3307: They’re Thinking Too Much. Sister Nian Has Already Blacklisted Her","paragraphs":["Chapter 3307: They’re Thinking Too Much. Sister Nian Has Already Blacklisted Her","Editor: Atlas Studios","Nie Qingru thought of that arrogant face and those eyes that were exactly the same as that person’s. She hated them so much that she did not even want to look at them.","But now, she had to bow down to Qiao Nian.","Nie Qingru clenched her fists and did not say anything for a long time.","Shadow’s eyes reddened, and his emotions fluctuated greatly. “Empress, you watched Young Master Qi grow up and raised him as your successor. He’s your younger brother and half your son. Even if Young Master Qi did something wrong, you can teach him a lesson or beat him up later... But if you don’t save him this time, he... has no way out!”","Nie Qingru closed her eyes. “Give me my cell phone.”","“You mean...” Shadow was overjoyed. He quickly found the phone on the coffee table and handed it over. “Empress.”","Nie Qingru took the cell phone and pursed her lips into a straight line. In the end, she still found the number she had contacted two days ago and called after a long hesitation.","She had been thinking about what to say to make Qiao Nian relent...","However, before she could figure it out, a mechanical female voice sounded.","“I’m sorry, the number you’re calling is unavailable.”","What was this?","Nie Qingru’s first reaction was shock, but then she immediately understood she had been blacklisted.","Her face quickly darkened, and her eyes were fierce. She suddenly stood up and threw her cell phone to the ground. “She wants to anger me to death!”","For someone like her, not to mention Master Cheng, even if someone from the Nie Family died, they might not be able to cause a ripple in her heart.","Not to mention that Master Cheng was not dead yet.","She couldn’t figure out why Qiao Nian wanted Nie Qixing to pay with his life for going after Master Cheng.","“One is an unimportant outsider, and the other is her blood-related elder. She’s quite vicious. She’ll only be satisfied if she angers me to death.”","Even though she was so angry that she was trembling, Qiao Nian dragged her down. There was nothing she could do...","At this moment, her cell phone vibrated.","Shadow picked it up and gave it to her.","Nie Qingru originally thought it was Qiao Nian and was a little shocked. Upon seeing the number, her heart sank.","However, she still had to answer it.","“There’s only one day left in the three days promised by the Privy Council. Empress, please make a decision as soon as possible.”","The person on the other end seemed to know what she was thinking.","Before she spoke, he reminded her again, “The Privy Council has already questioned your decision these few times. Someone mentioned abolishing the monarchy system.","“If you can’t protect the reclusive families’ reputation, then the Empress’s existence won’t be meaningful anymore.”","The Empress was the reclusive families’ symbol.","However, if she was tainted by that kind of scandal, then Nie Qingru’s existence as the Empress would become meaningless.","The Privy Council couldn’t override the Empress.","However, the Privy Council could vote to abolish the system in which the Empress existed!","Nie Qingru understood what he meant.","The other party was clearly telling her that between herself and Nie Qixing, she could only choose one. She had to make a choice as soon as possible and not drag it out any longer.","However, that was her younger brother whom she had raised for 30 years.","Her biological brother.","Nie Qingru’s throat rolled as if she had returned to the days when she could not make decisions. She was also led by the nose like this.","“I understand.”","**","The next day.","Nie Qingru went to Nie Qixing’s hospital.","She didn’t enter the ward the previous times.","But she did this time.","For three whole days, no one came to Nie Qixing’s ward except for the doctors and nurses."]},{"number":3308,"title":"Chapter 3308: Nie Qingru Has Made a Decision","paragraphs":["Chapter 3308: Nie Qingru Has Made a Decision","Editor: Atlas Studios","He himself did not know what was going on outside.","There wasn’t a single part of his body that did not hurt, but none of this was as painful as the disappointed look Nie Qingru gave him at the hotel that day.","“The dressing has been changed. The patient has to rest more.”","The doctor gave him a few instructions.","Nie Qixing ignored him. He didn’t even spare a glance, as if the doctors and nurses were not worth his attention.","The doctor was used to his arrogance. He dutifully explained what he needed to do and tidied up the things with the nurse before leaving.","He bumped into someone standing at the door.","The doctor was stunned for a moment before calling out, “Madam Nie.”","Nie Qingru asked, “How is he?”","The doctor knew that she had a powerful background. As for who she was, he did not know and did not want to ask. He said politely, “The patient’s health is improving, but his leg...”","“Tell me.”","“His leg had been injured to begin with and has never recovered. Logically speaking, if he recovers well, there’s still a possibility that he can walk in the future.","“But he hadn’t recovered yet and he got injured again, causing his leg injury to become more serious. I don’t know when he’ll recover. Even if he can... he won’t recover much.”","Nie Qingru had long known that Nie Qixing’s leg would be permanently disabled.","Experts had said that even the most optimistic outcome after rehabilitation would be a slight limp.","The meaning behind the doctor’s words was clear. No matter how Nie Qixing recovered in the future, he would suffer from a severe disability. In the future, he might be like Lu Zhi, unable to leave the wheelchair for the rest of his life.","Her successor... could have a slight limp.","But if Nie Qixing was completely disabled...","Nie Qingru rubbed the space between her eyebrows and waved for the doctor to leave. “I understand.”","The doctor and nurse wheeled the cart away.","Shadow could guess what she was thinking. His heartbeat was fast as he opened his mouth and said, “Young Master Qi is still young. If these doctors can’t do it, we just have to find better ones.”","This time, Nie Qingru did not reply. She just silently pushed the door and walked into the ward.","**","“Get out.” Nie Qixing lay on the hospital bed, thinking that the doctor had come back. He scolded with a cold face.","Then, he heard Shadow’s voice. “Young Master Qi, the Empress is here to see you.”","Nie Qixing’s originally lifeless eyes quickly focused. When he saw the person in front of his bed clearly, he forced himself to sit up. “Sister... you...”","Shadow couldn’t bear to see him like this and went forward to support him.","“Young Master Qi, be careful.”","“Mm.”","Nie Qixing had been looking at Nie Qingru the whole time. He did not even look at him.","He did not seem to expect Nie Qingru to come. For a moment, he did not know what to say. He thought before saying, “The Privy Council didn’t make things difficult for you, right?”","Not knowing what to think, Nie Qingru walked over and tucked him in, then indifferently said, “No.”","Nie Qixing could smell her fragrance. The heavy sandalwood fragrance should belong to an old woman, but it gave him endless fantasies.","He had been by Nie Qingru’s side since he could remember. At first, he thought he was her son, but later on, he realized he was her younger brother.","Her blood-related younger brother at that.","But he had a twisted fantasy that he could not extricate himself from.","“What’s with that woman?” Nie Qingru suddenly asked after straightening up.","Nie Qixing’s eyes narrowed. He looked up and saw the traces of time that could not be hidden on her face. His eyes flickered. “Just... an ordinary woman.”"]},{"number":3309,"title":"Chapter 3309: Go Away, I Want to Talk to the Empress Alone","paragraphs":["Chapter 3309: Go Away, I Want to Talk to the Empress Alone","Editor: Atlas Studios","He had grown up by Nie Qingru’s side. He had an indescribable sense of dependence on his biological sister.","However, the age difference was still there. He couldn’t accept the appearance of someone of this age.","As time passed, he accidentally discovered a photo of Nie Qingru when she was young.","He hid the photo and subconsciously began to search for prey based on that appearance.","This was his biggest secret.","Almost no one knew.","He wouldn’t let anyone know either.","Once that woman was discovered, his secret would be exposed.","That was why he couldn’t hand that woman to his sister.","Because once Uncle Ning and his sister saw that person, they would discover his dirty thoughts.","“For an ordinary woman, you would rather be hospitalized than come clean with me?” Nie Qingru’s voice was emotionless and flat. “I told you before that as my future successor, you can’t tolerate any stains on yourself. Any stain can be a death warrant!”","Nie Qixing still did not understand the seriousness of the matter and thought that Nie Qingru was just teaching him a lesson.","He said dejectedly, “I’m sorry, Sis.”","Nie Qingru looked at him with a secretive gaze and did not reply for a while.","Thinking she was still angry, Nie Qixing took a deep breath and apologized. “I promise I won’t make the same mistake again.","“You’re not in good health. Don’t hurt your health because of me.”","The last sentence was his heartfelt concern.","Nie Qingru frowned slightly and looked at him deeply. After a long time, she bent down and patted his shoulder.","“Forget it.”","Ever since Nie Qixing provoked Qiao Nian recently, he had been unlucky.","It had been a long time since Nie Qingru treated him so kindly. It was as if he had returned to the past. He called out softly, “Sister, are you... not angry with me anymore?”","Nie Qingru quickly retracted her hand. She was expressionless, but she gave him a rare gentle look. “Rest early.”","Nie Qixing’s nervousness also eased. He nodded and smiled at her. “You too.”","Nie Qingru’s sharp gaze paused on his face for a second before she turned around and left the ward without looking back.","Shadow did not follow her immediately. Instead, as if he sensed something, he looked back at the person on the bed who knew nothing with a heavy gaze.","“Young Master Qi...”","“Mm?”","Nie Qixing was in a good mood after receiving Nie Qingru’s ‘forgiveness’. His tone became much lighter. “What’s the matter, Uncle Ning?”","Shadow looked at him and how he did not know anything. His lips were extremely heavy, and his throat felt like it was stuffed with cotton. He could not open his mouth no matter what.","His eyes gradually turned red.","Nie Qixing found it strange and was about to ask him, “Uncle Ning, you...”","Nie Qingru’s cold but domineering voice came from outside. “Shadow, what are you still doing inside?”","Shadow shivered and looked outside.","He knew he could not stay any longer, and he also could not reveal anything to Nie Qixing. After a short hesitation, he walked out of the ward with heavy steps.","...","Outside the hospital.","Shadow did not know what he felt as he left the hospital and approached the parking lot.","He watched as the chauffeur opened the door for the elegant person.","Nie Qingru was about to get into the car.","He pinched his palm and could not help but say to the chauffeur, “Go away. I want to talk to the Empress alone.”"]},{"number":3310,"title":"Chapter 3310: Are You Really Planning...","paragraphs":["Chapter 3310: Are You Really Planning...","Editor: Atlas Studios","The chauffeur was surprised.","However, as Nie Qingru’s right-hand man, Shadow’s words carried a lot of weight.","The chauffeur only thought about it for a moment before saying respectfully, “Alright, I won’t go far. The Empress and Lord Shadow can call me back anytime.”","Shadow watched the chauffeur walk away to a corner where he could not hear them. Then he turned back and looked at his master, whom he had followed for decades.","His facial muscles twitched violently. For the first time, he had doubts.","Before he could speak, Nie Qingru broke the silence. “Pfft, you’re really bold now. You don’t take me seriously anymore.”","Shadow felt a chill on his back and immediately knelt on one knee. “Please forgive me, Empress. I was just in a hurry and did not mean to disobey you.”","“Tell me.” Nie Qingru did not argue with him. She sat in the car but did not close the door. She looked at him sharply. “What do you want to tell me?”","Shadow suddenly raised his head and looked into her cold eyes. He did not know why the words were wrapped around his heart and he could not open his mouth.","Nie Qingru waited for a few seconds, but before he could speak, her cold smile disappeared. “My patience is limited. If you don’t want to tell me, get the chauffeur to return.”","Veins bulged on Shadow’s forehead. He clenched and unclenched his hands, then clenched them again. Finally, he mustered his courage and looked into her eyes. “Empress, have you decided?”","Nie Qingru’s expression, which had already faded, turned completely cold. She looked at him with killing intent. “Who are you to ask what I want to do?”","“But you watched Young Master Qi grow up. He’s like a son to you. Are you really willing to sacrifice him?” Shadow asked with agitation.","He wasn’t a fool.","Having followed Nie Qingru for decades, he knew his master’s every word and action too well.","If the Empress had taught Young Master Qi a harsh lesson in the ward just now, there would still be room for negotiation. At the very least, the Empress would still be willing to protect Young Master Qi.","However, the Empress was so gentle that it did not make sense. She even patted Young Master Qi’s shoulder gently before leaving...","Perhaps in Young Master Qi’s eyes, this was a sign of intimacy.","However, Shadow knew very well how Ji Qing died back then.","Before Ji Qing died, the Empress also showed the same attitude.","She was as strict as usual. Instead, she was as gentle as an ordinary mother.","And yet...","“Empress, I know that Young Master Qi has caused you a lot of trouble this time, but if you insist on saving Young Master Qi’s life, the Privy Council might not dare to...” Shadow spoke quickly and anxiously. There was a thin layer of sweat on the tip of his nose. It was unknown if he was anxious or frightened.","However, before he could finish speaking...","Nie Qingru cut him off. “Enough!”","Shadow raised his head and looked at her in a daze. “Are you really planning to...”","Nie Qingru looked at him sharply. “You know better than anyone how much I’ve sacrificed and compromised to get to where I am today.”","Shadow lowered his head and said weakly, “I know, but...”","But that was Young Master Qi!","It was the child he had watched grow up.","He really could not bear it.","“I know what you want to say, but I can’t ruin my life’s work for him!” Nie Qingru closed her eyes heavily, and something surged up from her chest.","She did not feel any better than Shadow.","But now, she only had this path left.","“I’ve nurtured him since he was born. I’ve given him the best education and hired the best teachers. I didn’t even push him into the open for the first 30 years so that he could have a quiet environment. I secretly cleared the obstacles in his path...”"]},{"number":3311,"title":"Chapter 3311: Nie Qingru: So What?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3311: Nie Qingru: So What?","Editor: Atlas Studios","“According to my plan, he should enter the Privy Council next year. Then, I’ll make public his identity and steadily advance step by step until he can take over my position.”","That was her plan.","However, she did not expect that someone would appear halfway through and wreck it.","How could Nie Qingru not be angry?","“As you can see, his eye and leg cannot recover. Even if I spare no effort to protect him, he won’t be able to take my position. He won’t even be able to hold the position of head of the Nie family.”","Of course, that was not the point.","Nie Qingru didn’t say the most important reason she made such a quick decision.","If she forcibly protected Nie Qixing, she would lose her position as the Empress of the reclusive families. Even if she remained in the position in the future, her power would be divided and she would become just a figurehead.","How could she tolerate leaving the center of power and becoming a dispensable mascot?!","This was the reason why she made up her mind.","The Privy Council had already given her an ultimatum. Elder Xue, who had finally stood on her side, had urged her again and again. She had to express her stance!","Shadow’s eyes were bloodshot. He still had a last bit of hope. Looking at the person who looked down at him as if she had no feelings, he said in a low voice, “But that’s Young Master Qi. You watched him grow up. He’s your blood-related younger brother. He’s like half your son.”","He thought that Nie Qingru would at least be moved, but when he looked at her face, he saw no change in the graceful woman’s expression.","On the contrary, Nie Qingru looked back at him with a calm and almost heartless gaze. Their eyes met, and he heard her cold answer.","“So what.”","Shadow felt that his breathing stopped at this moment.","—So what!","**","The next day.","Qiao Nian woke up in the morning and took a shower. As she wiped the water off her hair with a towel, she noticed her phone screen on the table lit up from the corner of her eye.","In no hurry to read the message, she casually rubbed the water droplets on the ends of her hair and threw the towel on the coffee table.","At this moment, there was a knock on the door.","“Knock knock.”","It was a very polite knock.","For the past two days, her room had almost become a check-in point. People entered her room from morning to night. The others refused to return to their rooms and insisted on staying with her.","Qiao Nian pinched the area between her eyebrows. Thinking about it gave her a headache, but she still casually said, “Come in.”","Remembering this was a hotel, she went to open the door and saw a handsome man standing outside.","Ye Wangchuan saw that she was only wearing a bathrobe and realized she had just showered. She looked lazy and eye-catching. His eyes darkened and he blocked the view from outside imperceptibly. “Shall we go in first?”","Qiao Nian did not overthink about it and let him in.","Ye Wangchuan stood at the entrance, in a hurry to enter. Instead, he stood at the door, took his phone from his pocket, and lowered his eyes to send a message.","After a while, Qin Si received a WeChat message.","[Y: If you don’t wish to go to Continent F to accompany Mo Dong, don’t knock on Room 3306’s door today.]","Qin Si had been playing games the entire night.","Having been woken up by the notification, he grabbed his cell phone and took a look.","At first, he thought he was seeing things.","Damn, Master Wang sent him a message so early in the morning?","A little more awake now, he sat up and saw the warning on WeChat, not reacting for a long time.","Until the cell phone vibrated again with a new message.","[Y: Master Cheng is transferring to another hospital today. Go over early. Get the others to go with you.]"]},{"number":3312,"title":"Chapter 3312: An Accident at Nie Qixing’s Hospital","paragraphs":["Chapter 3312: An Accident at Nie Qixing’s Hospital","Editor: Atlas Studios","“Master Wang... have you gone crazy this early in the morning?” Qin Si was sure he had not seen wrongly. It was Ye Wangchuan’s WeChat account.","He muttered and replied.","Then, he got out of bed and yawned on his way to the bathroom.","Before he went in, he glanced at the time on the wall clock.","9:15 A.M.","Tsk!","So early.","Master Wang was really f*cking poisonous!","* * *","At the same time, Qiao Nian walked to the fridge and took out two bottles of Coke. She placed her bottle on the table and turned around to find a certain someone still standing at the entrance, playing with his cell phone.","She raised her eyebrows and asked in a hoarse voice, “Do you want a Coke?”","Ye Wangchuan’s eyebrows moved slightly, and his cell phone vibrated.","He looked down and saw Qin Si’s reply.","[Qin Si: Aren’t you going to invite Sister Qiao?]","His slender fingers looked even more beautiful under the light as he replied quickly and concisely.","[Y: I’ll be with her.]","After replying to the message, he looked up and grabbed the coke the girl handed him, still emitting cold air—she must have just taken it out of the fridge.","He took it and grabbed the bottle Qiao Nian had placed on the table. Then, he put it back down and said, “Don’t drink iced Coke on an empty stomach.”","He took a bottle of water, unscrewed the cap, and handed it to her. “Drink this.”","Qiao Nian was used to being alone and free. She watched as he confiscated her Coke and exchanged it for a bottle of plain water.","She only raised her eyebrows and didn’t say anything as she took it and gulped down a mouthful of water. Then, she leaned lazily against the sofa, her eyes dark as if she knew something. “Nie Qingru has made her choice?”","Ye Wangchuan did not want to tell her this early in the morning, but he still had to let her know.","He said, “There was a fire in a hospital this morning. The fire wasn’t huge, so it was quickly controlled.","“Unfortunately, the device in a patient’s room overheated and exploded. The huge shock caused the patient to die on the spot.”","Qiao Nian clenched the plastic bottle tightly and sneered. “So she’ll still make the same choice.”","Nie Qixing was the same as Ji Qing.","To Nie Qingru, they were not even comparable to the satisfaction brought by power.","However, this wasn’t the answer she wanted.","She couldn’t tell what she was feeling, but she was definitely annoyed. Qiao Nian frowned and lowered her eyelashes. “What about the Privy Council?”","“Basically everyone’s gone over.”","Qiao Nian pursed her lips. “No wonder she can sit firmly on the throne of Empress of the reclusive families.”","Ye Wangchuan could tell she was frustrated. He patted her hand gently and did not say anything. He just comforted her silently.","Qiao Nian was originally frustrated. But upon looking up at him, for some reason, her heart calmed down.","She smirked coldly, her dark eyes devoid of emotions. “I wonder if Nie Qixing was as shocked as Ji Qing in the end.","“She probably didn’t expect the person closest to her would attack her without hesitation for power.”","Ye Wangchuan knew she was referring to Ji Qing.","Nie Qixing deserved to die.","Everything he had done had always been on the verge of courting death. It was just that Qiao Nian had always given him a chance.","Until he almost killed Master Cheng."]},{"number":3313,"title":"Chapter 3313: Master Wang: You Are You, They Are Them","paragraphs":["Chapter 3313: Master Wang: You Are You, They Are Them","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian lowered her dark eyelashes to hide her arrogant and unrestrained eyes. She chuckled and spread out her hands. She was quite dry and cold. “But it’s not important anymore.”","Ye Wangchuan suddenly stood and walked over. He lowered his head slightly and said to the girl, “Give me your hand.”","What?","Qiao Nian looked up and met his bottomless eyes.","She paused for half a second before slowly opening her fair palm. Her expression was lazy, but she clearly trusted Ye Wangchuan 100%.","Ye Wangchuan’s eyes moved slightly. He slowly took out something and placed it in her palm. Then, he said in a low and mellow voice, “Don’t worry about what they think. You are you, and they are them.”","Qiao Nian felt something light in her palm. She looked over and saw a candy.","Candy?","Did he think she was a child?","She raised her eyebrows and slowly retracted her hand. Looking at the candy carefully, she realized it was an orange candy.","“Master Cheng’s life is no longer in danger. Qin Si and the others have gone to transfer him to another hospital. Are we going later?”","Ye Wangchuan changed the topic. He did not want her mood to continue being affected by the Nie family’s mess.","Qiao Nian tore the candy wrapper and popped the orange candy into her mouth. As she bit into the sweet and sour candy, her frustration immediately disappeared.","“We are. What time?”","“11 o’clock.”","This time, they booked a transfer at 10 o’clock. Most of the medical staff from Beijing were arriving around 10 o’clock by plane. They would be ready by 11 o’clock.","Ye Wangchuan spoke casually, completely forgetting that he had just dragged Qin Si out of bed not long ago. It seemed to be only nine o’clock.","Qiao Nian bit into the candy and looked at the clock on the wall.","9:20.","There was still an hour and a half to go.","**","At the same time, in a remote alley in Continent M.","A man in black had just settled the seriously injured person when his cell phone rang.","For safety’s sake, he hid them in a low-lying slum. The dilapidated hotel cost just dozens of yuan for a night.","The small room smelled of damp and dark mold. The sound of running could be heard on the roof. It was so shabby that one could not rest comfortably.","At this moment, his cell phone’s ringtone became exceptionally loud.","Shadow did not answer immediately. Instead, he looked at the caller ID and said to the person curled up on the floor, “Young Master Qi, I will find an opportunity to visit you tonight.”","The person curled up on the wooden floor seemed to have lost his vitality. His eyes were empty and he did not move. It was unknown if he heard him or not.","The cell phone was still ringing.","Shadow didn’t have time to care if Nie Qixing had heard him or not. He hurriedly turned to leave. “Rest well.”","Suddenly, a hand grabbed his pants.","Then, Nie Qixing called out hoarsely, “Uncle Ning.”","Shadow stopped in his tracks. He was anxious but did not have the heart to shake him off. “I’m really in a hurry. I’ll come and see you later...”","Before he could finish his sentence, Nie Qixing asked with a weak voice, “Who wants me dead?”","Shadow stiffened, and his Adam’s apple bobbed. He was speechless for a long time.","Nie Qixing saw his reaction and let go of his pants. He muttered in a daze, “It’s Qiao Nian, right? She’s always disliked me. She’s finally going to attack me this time.”","It had to be her...","But... Shadow’s reaction told him that it was not Qiao Nian.","Instead..."]},{"number":3314,"title":"Chapter 3314: Didn’t You Say You Were on the Way to the Privy Council?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3314: Didn’t You Say You Were on the Way to the Privy Council?","Editor: Atlas Studios","Nie Qixing pictured the person.","He didn’t dare think about it, and he didn’t want to.","“Is it Qiao Nian?” He curled his fingers and tried to control his emotions as he looked up at Shadow and waited for an answer.","Shadow sighed silently and patted his shoulder. “Yes, it’s her.”","Nie Qixing’s heart trembled, and his expression turned ugly. Then, he smiled. “I knew it was Qiao Nian.”","The phone rang for more than 10 seconds before the other party gave up.","At this moment, Shadow’s phone rang again, as if the other party wanted him to answer immediately.","Shadow knew he couldn’t delay any longer, so he hurriedly pulled Nie Qixing’s hand away and said, “Remember not to run around. I’ll come and find you when I have time.”","Nie Qixing closed his eyes.","Shadow didn’t know if Nie Qixing did not have the strength to answer or if he just didn’t want to speak.","Shadow did not have the energy to find out what he was thinking and turned around. “I’m leaving.”","...","This hotel was really too dilapidated. Even the alley was inconspicuous.","Shadow hurried out of the hotel, took out a stack of money, and threw it to the lady boss at the bar counter. “Take care of the tenant up there.”","“Ah.” The lady boss’s eyes lit up when she saw the money. As she counted it, she said with a smile, “Don’t worry, don’t worry.”","Shadow strode out of the hotel and accepted the call as he quickly walked to the alley’s entrance. “... Empress, what’s the matter?”","There were basically no surveillance cameras nearby. The few surveillance cameras around were at the intersection.","For the sake of caution, he did not drive the car in. Instead, he placed it by a green belt not far from away.","The tone of the person on the other end of the call was emotionless. “Where are you?”","Shadow felt uneasy, and his heart beat fast. “I’m...”","He had never lied to Nie Qingru before, but this time, he had no choice but to do so.","Shadow took a deep breath and tried to sound normal. “I’m on my way to the Privy Council.”","To prevent his lie from being exposed, he even quickened his pace...","At this moment, a woman’s cold voice came from the other end of the call. “Raise your head and look to the left!”","Shadow subconsciously followed the order and looked up to the left. What he saw was Nie Qingru’s usual car. The black vehicle was parked quietly less than 500 meters away from him.","The chauffeur was standing outside and looking in his direction.","Empress?!","At the same time, the back door opened.","The person sitting inside was holding her cell phone. Her cold gaze passed through the alley and landed steadily on him as if she had been waiting there for a long time.","Shadow’s back was instantly drenched in cold sweat, and his legs were like lead, unable to move.","Nie Qingru coldly asked, “What are you still standing there for?”","Shadow seemed to have woken up and hurried to her side.","...","The 500-meter distance was shortened in the blink of an eye. Shadow walked to the front of the luxury car. His lips were pale, and he knelt on one knee without a word.","“Empress.”","Nie Qingru glanced at him indifferently. “Didn’t you say you were on the way to the Privy Council? This path doesn’t seem to lead to the Privy Council, though?”","Shadow lowered his head and said nothing.","“Are you mute?”","Nie Qingru’s eyelids drooped slightly. There was no expression on her well-maintained face. She only lowered her eyelids and looked down at the person kneeling at her feet.","“You’re getting bolder.”"]},{"number":3315,"title":"Chapter 3315: Nie Qixing Is Completely Gone","paragraphs":["Chapter 3315: Nie Qixing Is Completely Gone","Editor: Atlas Studios","“Your Majesty...”","Shadow lowered his head in shame.","Nie Qingru did not want to argue with him. She raised her hand and made a downward gesture.","The chauffeur understood what she meant and walked towards the alley where Shadow came from. It was obvious that he had brought something with him.","Shadow looked at him as he brushed past. He suddenly raised his head with red eyes and begged the woman in the car, “Empress, please let Young Master Qi go!”","Nie Qingru was unmoved. It was as if Nie Qixing could no longer stir up any ripples in her heart. “I’ve already discussed this with you. It’s not that I won’t let him off, but it’s meaningless for him to continue living. A cripple can’t inherit my position!","“Even if I protect him, he will just become a burden in the future.","“I can’t have a weak spot like him by my side. Otherwise... you should know better than me the consequences.”","Of course, Shadow understood how hard it was for her to attain her current position. So many people wanted to pull her down from her pedestal.","And yet...","That was Young Master Qi!","Was the Empress not sad at all?","Nie Qingru glanced at him as if she could read his mind and lightly said, “If I were stuck in these feelings, I wouldn’t have come this far.”","“Empress...” Shadow wanted to beg her again.","Nie Qingru cut him off mercilessly. “He could have easily ‘left’ without knowing anything, but you insisted on doing unnecessary things behind my back. Now that he’s suffering one more time, it’s also the result of your soft heart!”","Shadow’s face turned pale and his lips trembled. He lowered his head, not knowing how to face her. After a long time, he asked, “When did the Empress start to suspect me?”","A trace of pity flashed across Nie Qingru’s eyes, and she indifferently said, “You’ve been with me for decades, and I’ve never doubted you.”","“Then why are you here?” Shadow asked the question he wanted to ask the most.","Nie Qingru showed a scornful expression, condescending and contemptuous. “I suspect foolish feelings!”","She had never suspected that Shadow would betray her.","However, she also knew that no matter how capable a person was, they would still be influenced by their feelings and do irrational things.","From the beginning, Shadow had been thinking of ways to beg her to let Nie Qixing go, but at the last moment, he calmly accepted her idea of causing an ‘accident’.","From that moment on, she became alert.","Reality proved her right.","Shadow had indeed created a good show behind her back.","“If it was in the past, I would have tacitly approved of your actions. It’s just that you’ve forgotten that we’ve used this trick once before. This time, the archbishop will definitely check it carefully...”","Nie Qingru seemed to be talking about someone else. “I can’t break my promise to the Privy Council again.”","She couldn’t let those old fellows from the Privy Council have something on her, so Nie Qixing had to die this time!","Shadow opened his mouth and looked at her, but he couldn’t say anything in the end.","At this moment, the chauffeur slowly walked out of the alley.","Shadow’s eyelids twitched when he saw the bright red color on his hand. He heard the other party say respectfully to Nie Qingru, “Empress, it’s done.”","Only then did Nie Qingru close her eyes. An expression of exhaustion and pity flashed on her face before she instructed the chauffeur, “Call Elder Xue and ask them over.”"]},{"number":3316,"title":"Chapter 3316: How Dare You Question Sister Nian","paragraphs":["Chapter 3316: How Dare You Question Sister Nian","Editor: Atlas Studios","“Okay.”","The chauffeur walked away to contact the Privy Council.","Shadow felt a chill run down the top of his head. His back was already drenched. The cold wind blew through his bones.","He couldn’t blame the Empress. However, he couldn’t accept this outcome.","After a long time, he finally said with red eyes, “Empress, Young Master Qi is only 30 years old.”","Nie Qixing was only in his thirties, the most dazzling period in one’s life. He still had a long way to go... But he was already dead.","Nie Qingru’s slightly cold eyes lost their focus for a moment as if she was thinking of another person who had passed away earlier.","She leaned back on the leather chair and relaxed. Her tone was cold and sinister as she said, “If you want to hate someone, hate the person who forced me to make this choice.”","If Qiao Nian had not pressed on, she wouldn’t have been forced to sacrifice Qixing.","After all, he was the younger brother she had raised. If not for this matter, she would be willing to feed him even if he became a cripple in the future.","However, things had reached an irreversible stage.","She couldn’t destroy the entire game for a useless chess piece.","Nie Qingru rested her hand on the edge of her seat and tapped it with her finger. After pondering for a moment, she thought of something and said, “Go and inform the Nie clan.”","Shadow looked at her in confusion.","Nie Qingru could still smile at this moment. The corners of her mouth curled into a sneer. “Didn’t my good father and brother always want Qixing to lose his inheritance? Now, they’ve gotten what they wanted. However, I don’t think they’ll be happy...”","The Nie clan still hoped that Nie Qixing would be able to keep her in check.","On one hand, they did not want Nie Qixing to inherit the Nie Family, but on the other hand, they hoped that Nie Qixing would become the emotional link between her and the family.","Now, he was gone.","Her brother and father would definitely be disappointed and angry. They would definitely investigate what had happened.","Qiao Nian ruined their wishful thinking. With her father’s personality, he probably would not let it go so easily.","At this moment, the chauffeur returned.","“Empress, the people from the Privy Council will be here soon.”","“Mm.”","The sneer on Nie Qingru’s lips faded. Then, as if she had thought of something, she picked up her phone and typed a message.","**","At the entrance of the private hospital where Master Cheng was staying.","A low-key Mercedes-Benz parked in the parking lot.","Ye Wangchuan took off his seatbelt and said to the girl beside him, “We’re here.”","Qiao Nian had been playing with her phone along the way. Hearing what he said, she looked out the window and was about to put down her cell phone.","At this moment, a text message came in.","It was Continent M’s number again.","She took a look before casually blacklisting it.","Previously, she had blocked Nie Qingru’s number. The other party must have discovered it and changed her number.","The message just contained a question posed in a high and mighty tone: [Are you satisfied?]","Qiao Nian had no intention of replying to such a stupid message.","She had given her two options.","In the end, Nie Qingru chose power.","Now she used such a resentful tone to ask if she was satisfied. It was quite boring.","Ye Wangchuan had already gotten out and walked to her side to open the door for her.","Qiao Nian put away her cell phone, unbuckled her seatbelt, and got out.","Bo Zheng happened to call at this moment.","Ye Wangchuan looked at the hospital before rejecting the call. Then, he said to Qiao Nian, “The doctor is probably here. Let’s go.”","“Oh.”","Qiao Nian had no objections and entered the hospital with him."]},{"number":3317,"title":"Chapter 3317: Discussing Sister Nian","paragraphs":["Chapter 3317: Discussing Sister Nian","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qin Si, Bo Zheng, and the others were already there, chatting about matters related to Qiao Nian.","“I heard there was a fire in the hospital yesterday. Someone unfortunately died in the fire.” Bo Zheng suddenly mentioned it.","Luo Qing casually said, “Captain, since when did you care about what happens in Continent M?”","Bo Zheng pursed his lips and his eyes flickered. He did not answer this question directly.","Instead, their words attracted the others’ attention.","Qin Si was someone who couldn’t stay idle. He pricked up his ears at the mention of the fire. He immediately glanced at him, clearly puzzled. “Uncle Bo, is there anything wrong with that fire?”","Bo Zheng looked at him calmly. “There’s nothing wrong. I asked an acquaintance and heard that it was already determined to be an accident.”","“Then...” Qin Si didn’t think he was a boring person who would pay attention to these unrelated accidents.","Gu San and the others also looked at Bo Zheng. They felt that he had something important to say.","Sure enough.","Bo Zheng didn’t beat around the bush. His mature and handsome face was calm and steady as he said, “There’s nothing special about the fire, but the person who unfortunately died in the fire is quite worth thinking about.”","Qin Si frowned and opened his mouth to ask who it was.","Bo Zheng scanned the others and leaned against the wall. His thin lips pursed. “Nie Qixing.”","“Gosh!” Qin Si was flabbergasted. “You mean?that?Nie Qixing...”","Bo Zheng took a cigarette box from his pocket, poured one out, and bit it. He was about to take a lighter when he heard this and looked at him indifferently. “He’s dead.”","Qin Si was stunned.","Nie Qixing was dead?","Not only was Qin Si dumbfounded, but so were Gu San and the others.","Luo Qing and the others from the Ninth Branch couldn’t keep up. They looked at each other and saw the shocked expressions in each other’s eyes.","Nie Qixing was the successor that Nie Qingru had publicly said she thought highly of.","This time, they had come to Continent M to see the tip of the iceberg of the legendary reclusive families and knew the deeper power behind them.","Just like that, such an ‘accident’ happened.","This was a little unreasonable!","Luo Qing frowned. His first reaction was to ask anxiously, “What’s the reclusive families’ reaction? They...”","Bo Zheng took out a lighter, lowered his head, and lit a cigarette. He leaned against the side and took a puff. The light smoke enveloped his broad eyebrows.","He looked straight at Gu San and asked, “Young Master Ye hasn’t asked you to do anything recently?”","Everyone’s eyes went to Gu San.","Gu San was at a loss. He was stunned. Then, he shook his head and replied firmly, “No, Master Wang has been quiet in the hotel recently. He hasn’t gone anywhere.”","Qin Si retracted his gaze and immediately understood what Bo Zheng meant. He was stunned. “You mean that Nie Qixing’s death is related to Master Wang and Sister Qiao?”","He remembered that the two of them had mentioned some photos before.","It was just a photo. It wouldn’t kill Nie Qixing, right?","Besides, Sister Qiao and Master Wang had stayed in the hotel for the past few days. How could they kill Nie Qixing like this? This was too...","He shivered and suddenly felt cold. He hugged his arms and rubbed them, feeling numb. “This is too awesome.”","Bo Zheng held the cigarette between two fingers. It was different from what he was paying attention to. His tall body leaned against the wall and he said meaningfully, “I think, based on their reactions, the attack on Master Cheng should have something to do with Nie Qixing!”"]},{"number":3318,"title":"Chapter 3318: Someone’s Shocked","paragraphs":["Chapter 3318: Someone’s Shocked","Editor: Atlas Studios","Bo Zheng wasn’t familiar with Qiao Nian.","They had only interacted a few times.","He wasn’t sure about Qiao Nian’s personality.","However, he knew Ye Wangchuan.","His nephew and Ye Wangchuan had grown up together, so Bo Jingxing often mentioned Young Master Ye.","Ye Wangchuan was famous in Beijing for being someone to avoid provoking.","However, Ye Wangchuan wasn’t the kind of person who would torture someone for no reason.","If he attacked someone, it only meant that that person deserved it.","For example, this time... Nie Qixing suddenly died.","He felt that it had something to do with Master Cheng’s attack.","Everyone in the corridor was silent. Most importantly, no one connected the two matters because Qiao Nian never mentioned finding the culprit behind Master Cheng’s attack.","Compared to Qin Si and the others, Bo Zheng knew more about the reclusive families.","Most of the people from the Ninth Branch didn’t know much about this. Jiang Tianzhi asked the person beside him in a low voice, “Do you know what this reclusive family they’re talking about is about?”","Yu Wenhao’s face was a little pale. He lowered his head absent-mindedly. “I’m not very sure. I’ve only heard others mention it once or twice.”","“Oh.” Jiang Tianzhi couldn’t be bothered to ask about things he did not understand. He retracted his gaze and continued listening to Qin Si and the others.","After hearing Bo Zheng’s analysis, Qin Si also felt it might be related to Qiao Nian.","He chatted with Bo Zheng for a while.","Only Yu Wenhao’s expression was getting worse.","He remembered provoking Qiao Nian before and making her unhappy more than once. After that, he had been neglected by his teacher... It should be related to Qiao Nian.","Nie Qixing had accidentally died in a hospital fire after provoking Qiao Nian. What about him? He had also accidentally provoked that girl. Wouldn’t he end up the same?!","At this thought...","In addition to faint regret, Yu Wenhao’s heart was in turmoil. He couldn’t calm down for a long time.","He looked at everyone discussing how unfortunate Nie Qixing’s death was. As if seeing his future self, he suddenly lost the mood to listen and hurriedly said to Jiang Tianzhi, “I’m going to the washroom.”","“The doctor will be here soon,” Jiang Tianzhi reminded him.","Yu Wenhao’s expression was ugly. He did not even turn his head. “I’ll be right back.”","Jiang Tianzhi looked at his back as he left in a hurry. A trace of strangeness flashed across his eyes, but he did not take it to heart and did not bother with him.","...","Yu Wenhao’s footsteps slowed down after he left the corridor.","He did not want to go to the washroom, but since he had already said so, he could only go now.","The restroom was at the end of the corridor.","He had to pass by the elevator.","He was just walking past when the elevator doors opened.","Yu Wenhao’s pupils constricted slightly when he saw the girl walking out, and he blurted out, “Q-Qiao Nian.”","The girl in the baseball cap stopped in her tracks upon hearing her name. She raised the brim of her cap and looked at him with her ink-black eyes.","Recognizing him, Qiao Nian put one hand in her pocket and calmly asked, “The doctor isn’t here yet?”","Yu Wenhao recalled the gossip he had just heard and suddenly returned to his senses. His gaze became complicated and guarded when he looked at the girl again, and he took half a step back before saying, “Uh, um, n-not yet.”","Qiao Nian sized him up. She did not want to waste time and walked past him. “Thank you.”","Yu Wenhao watched as she walked towards Master Cheng’s ward. He stared at her for a full three seconds before retracting his gaze. Then, he immediately felt a sharp gaze landing on him."]},{"number":3319,"title":"Chapter 3319: What a Coincidence, I’m Poor Too","paragraphs":["Chapter 3319: What a Coincidence, I’m Poor Too","Editor: Atlas Studios","He followed his sixth sense and immediately met a pair of deep eyes filled with scrutiny.","Ye Wangchuan had yet to leave.","A thin layer of sweat immediately appeared on Yu Wenhao’s back. Afraid that his uncomfortable reaction would be discovered, he avoided eye contact and hurriedly said, “I’m going to the washroom.”","Ye Wangchuan had always been noble and lazy. He was never aggressive.","He looked at Yu Wenhao’s fleeing back with a hint of interest.","However, he did not chase after him for clarification. Instead, he watched as Yu Wenhao’s figure disappeared around the corner. Then, he followed the girl.","...","“Master Wang!” Qin Si was talking to Qiao Nian when he saw Ye Wangchuan. After calling out to him, he walked over and patted the man’s shoulder. “We were talking about you.”","Ye Wangchuan glanced at his hand and looked away lazily. “What did you say about me?”","“We said you...” Qin Si almost let it slip.","Fortunately, he stopped himself in time. Stealing a glance at Qiao Nian, who was about to enter the ward, he changed his words. “You... haven’t become official even after being with Sister Qiao for so long.”","Qiao Nian had already stepped into the ward, but she still heard him. She slowly turned around and gave Qin Si a look.","Qin Si touched his neck awkwardly, but he was the one who said it. No matter what, he had to smooth things over. He met Qiao Nian’s gaze and coughed dryly. “Um, didn’t you say Master Wang was in an internship before? The three-month internship has passed, but you guys didn’t say anything about becoming official. So, is Master Wang still an intern? Ahem, I’m just curious~”","Ye Wangchuan raised his eyebrows and replied with a faint smile, “You’re quite curious.”","Qin Si did not dare to look at him. He despised himself for even thinking of using this topic to divert attention.","He dug a hole for himself.","Just as he was thinking of a reasonable way to smooth things over, Master Wang asked in a lazy and hoarse tone, “So, Goddess Qiao, am I officially promoted to boyfriend status?”","Qiao Nian’s temples twitched and she looked at him speechlessly. “Whatever you think.”","Ye Wangchuan knew how to climb up the ladder. He smiled slightly in front of everyone and swallowed. “Why don’t we treat you to a meal another day?”","“...”","“The officialization banquet!”","“...”","His eyes were filled with affection and his tone was half-teasing, with a hint of flirtatiousness. “After all, I’m a freeloader. Goddess Qiao wouldn’t mind treating us, right?”","Gosh...","Qin Si had seen shameless people before, but not someone so shameless. His face turned green after being stuffed with displays of affection.","But he was the one who brought it up.","Now that he was stuffed with it, he could only swallow it.","Qiao Nian also looked at him with a shocked and speechless expression. She looked at him expressionlessly for a second before retracting her gaze. Then, she impatiently pressed down the brim of her cap and casually said, “Poor!”","Ye Wangchuan probably provoked her on purpose. He smiled and said in the same lazy tone as her, “What a coincidence. I’m poor too.”","Qin Si’s and Gu San’s expressions changed as they watched the two big bosses pretend to be poor under their noses.","Each of them could say more than the other.","Master Wang and Sister Qiao were poor?","Hehe, she was a big boss who could earn endless money by selling medicine.","As for the other one... the Ye family alone was enough for Master Wang to create trouble for eight lifetimes, not to mention his other profitable businesses.","Qin Si was not only depressed but also heartbroken."]},{"number":3320,"title":"Chapter 3320: Even the Reclusive Families Have to Give Them an Explanation","paragraphs":["Chapter 3320: Even the Reclusive Families Have to Give Them an Explanation","Editor: Atlas Studios","Afraid he would have a myocardial infarction if he continued listening, he hurriedly urged the girl to enter the ward. “Sister Qiao, go in and take a look at Master Cheng.”","Qiao Nian wasn’t the kind of person who was talkative in front of many people. She didn’t know how to answer, so Qin Si found an excuse for her. She nodded and entered the ward.","Qin Si watched the girl enter the ward before turning around and saying speechlessly, “Master Wang, how can you say that you’re poor? You haven’t been poor the entire time I’ve known you.”","When he said that he was poor, he did not even blink.","Ye Wangchuan ignored him and approached Bo Zheng to ask where the doctor was.","Bo Zheng said he would be there soon.","Then, Ye Wangchuan walked aside to make a call.","* * *","Beijing.","Ye Maoshan jumped up the moment he accepted the call. “Young brat, you finally remembered to call me back! I thought you didn’t remember me anymore.”","“I was busy...”","Ye Maoshan got angry. “When have you not been busy? You’ve never stayed at home for more than a few days!”","That’s what he said, but he still couldn’t bear to continue reprimanding him. He composed himself and asked, “How’s Master Cheng’s situation?”","“His life is not in danger anymore. He’ll be back in Beijing soon.” Ye Wangchuan was as calm as ever.","Ye Maoshan’s anxious heart calmed down a little. He rubbed his eyebrows and walked to the garden. Then, he lowered his voice and asked, “Have you found out who was behind it?”","He thought Ye Wangchuan must have found the culprit.","Unexpectedly, the person on the other end of the cell phone only calmly said, “I don’t know, but I can roughly guess who it is.”","Just a guess?","Ye Maoshan was a little disappointed. He thought they would be able to teach the other party a lesson after finding the mastermind. At the very least, Master Cheng wouldn’t have to suffer in vain.","However, he did not say anything. “Then come back early. I’ll get someone to investigate this matter. We’ll definitely find evidence.”","“We haven’t found the person who stabbed him yet. There’s no need to investigate the person behind the scenes.” Ye Wangchuan did not mention Nie Qixing. After all, this involved Nie Qingru.","Nie Qingru was Qiao Nian’s blood-related grandmother.","This matter was too complicated.","Moreover, since Qiao Nian did not intend to acknowledge Nie Qingru, there was no need to tell Old Master Ye and the others about this relationship.","Ye Maoshan originally wanted to ask him why he did not investigate the mastermind, but then he thought of the reclusive families making things difficult for them.","He roughly guessed that the reclusive families were involved.","He was silent for a moment before changing the topic. “By the way, will you and Nian Nian return with Master Cheng?”","“We might be half a day late. We’ll see.” Ye Wangchuan gave him an approximate time, but he didn’t say anything definite.","Ye Maoshan knew he couldn’t control him. He also guessed they would be late because of Master Cheng’s matter, so he didn’t say much. “Be careful and protect Nian Nian.”","“Okay.”","This time, Ye Wangchuan agreed very quickly.","“I’ll talk to you when I get back.”","Ye Maoshan snorted. He was angry, but he still doted on him. “I’ll get your aunt to pick you up at the airport.”","Ye Wangchuan consented before hanging up.","Ye Maoshan put down the phone. After some thought, he called Wei Mingxuan and asked him out. “Do you have time? Let’s meet and talk about Master Cheng.”","It was unknown what Wei Mingxuan said, but after Ye Maoshan put down his phone, his expression was much more serious.","Master Cheng was from the Ninth Branch.","No matter what, it was impossible for Beijing not to do anything after Master Cheng was so blatantly attacked in Continent M.","They weren’t wouldn’t accept this bullying.","Even the reclusive families had to give them a reasonable explanation this time!"]},{"number":3321,"title":"Chapter 3321: Nie Qingru Wants to Suppress Beijing","paragraphs":["Chapter 3321: Nie Qingru Wants to Suppress Beijing","Editor: Atlas Studios","Privy Council.","The parliament hall was silent.","Nie Qingru sat at the head of the table, tapping her knuckles on the table.","Tap, tap, tap.","Again and again.","The sound was not loud, but everyone’s hearts were pounding.","Quentin sat on her left, wrapped in red robes; the wide robe enveloped his broad figure.","His eyes shone brightly. “Empress, isn’t your decision too hasty?”","This was also the opinion of most in the parliament hall.","Everyone’s eyes were focused on Nie Qingru.","After all, a minute ago, Nie Qingru had publicly proposed suppressing all of Beijing’s resources.","This was no small matter.","Quentin was also stating the facts. “If you insist on doing this, it will easily anger Beijing. Don’t forget that we also need Beijing’s rare earth resources!”","Nie Qingru moved slightly and looked up at him.","Her tone was as cold as the winter frost. “You mean I should personally apologize to Beijing and ask for their forgiveness?”","“Of course, that’s not what I meant.” Quentin did not directly face her sharpness but tried his best to convince her. “I just feel there’s no need to fall out with Beijing.”","Nie Qingru narrowed her eyes at him and took a deep breath before saying in an unfriendly tone, “Archbishop, you have to understand that I’m not the one who wants to fall out with Beijing. They’re the ones who want to fall out with me!","“I’m the Empress of the reclusive families, representing all of the reclusive families. The matter has already happened, and I’ve already given an explanation. But they still want me to express my stance. Why? Are our reclusive families so easy to bully?”","She scanned the crowd and sneered. “Or is there no one left in our reclusive families?!”","Nie Qingru rarely threw a fit.","No one in the parliament hall dared to breathe loudly.","Quentin subconsciously frowned and was about to speak.","Nie Qingru dragged the chair and interrupted him. “Since I’ve already given you a satisfactory explanation for the weapons exhibition, I’ll still be the Empress of the reclusive families.”","Her eyes got cold. “Archbishop, don’t forget that the reclusive families’ royal power is paramount. Even the Privy Council has no right to interfere with my decisions!”","She was right.","According to the reclusive families’ rules, Nie Qingru had the right to decide whether to target Beijing or not.","However, everyone present, including Quentin, knew that targeting Beijing was indirectly targeting that person—Qiao Nian.","Nie Qingru wasn’t suppressing Beijing, but Qiao Nian.","However, the two sides had already gotten into an ugly fight.","It wasn’t beneficial to the reclusive families if they continued to cause trouble.","Nie Qingru didn’t let them speak. She waved her hand and turned to leave. “It’s decided!”","Shadow followed quietly behind her.","Throughout the entire process, he did not even look at the others in the parliament hall.","Nie Qingru left.","Many in the parliament hall also stood up and left.","Quentin’s expression was not good as he leaned against his seat.","Jacob walked over as he was pinching the bridge of his nose. He asked worriedly, “Archbishop, are you alright?”","“Mm.”","Quentin looked up and from the corner of his eye, he saw the old man in green walking past him out of the council hall.","He hesitated for a moment before calling out to him. “Elder Xue, shall we stay for a chat?”","* * *","10 minutes later.","Most of the people in the council hall had left.","Quentin looked at the old man in green who had always been on Qiao Nian’s side. “What do you think of the Empress’s plan to suppress Beijing?”"]},{"number":3322,"title":"Chapter 3322: Sister Nian Is Getting Revenge","paragraphs":["Chapter 3322: Sister Nian Is Getting Revenge","Editor: Atlas Studios","Elder Xue’s eyelids twitched. He raised his eyelids and did not beat around the bush. “I think what the Empress said makes sense.”","Jacob brought them cups of coffee. He gently put them down and stood obediently in the corner.","The middle-aged man did not expect his stance to change so drastically. Reaching for the coffee, his hand stopped midair and he looked at him strangely.","“When did you become so close to the Empress?”","The Conservatives and the Empress had never been on good terms.","His seemingly random words were actually asking about Elder Xue’s current position.","“You don’t have to test me.” Facing his insistence, Elder Xue looked magnanimous. “I’m only loyal to the reclusive families.","“The Empress was too powerful in the past. In order to prevent her from turning the reclusive families into her personal weapon, I definitely had to suppress her. Didn’t the archbishop also have such thoughts, which was why he founded the neutral faction and did not associate with anyone?”","The middle-aged man narrowed his eyes dangerously, but he did not retort. “Elder Xue is on the Empress’ side now because...?”","“Qiao Nian is too strong.” Elder Xue did not hide his worry. He looked into his eyes and said bluntly, “With her personality, if she takes over the reclusive families in the future, it will undoubtedly be a disaster for us. I don’t think she can inherit the position of Empress. Since she can’t take over the reclusive families or become one of us in the future, it’s better to nip her in the bud while she’s still young. Just like... what we did in the past!”","—Those who are not my kind will not be left alive!","This was the rule of the reclusive families.","He did not deny that he had thought highly of Qiao Nian before. He even intended to help her rise to the top and take a few more steps up in the Privy Council.","However, when he saw with his own eyes that Qiao Nian could go against the reclusive families to investigate Ji Qing’s death and almost destroy their reputation several times, this thought quietly changed.","Qiao Nian was indeed talented.","Back then, Ji Qing was also talented. Why did the Privy Council not choose to leave her alive in the end? The reason was very simple—Ji Qing was unwilling to work for the reclusive families.","A genius refused to submit and even made enemies of them. The only outcome awaiting her was destruction.","Ji Qing was like this.","Qiao Nian was the same.","The archbishop instantly understood his thoughts and was silent for a long time. He did not express his stance as Elder Xue thought. Instead, he paused and gave an ambiguous answer. “I understand.”","Elder Xue could tell he was still unwilling to stand on his side, so he did not say anything. He looked at him with his shrewd eyes and said, “Archbishop, we can’t let Qiao Nian continue!”","Quentin looked at him.","Elder Xue did not avoid his gaze. Instead, he stared straight at him. His determined and fierce gaze showed that he had made up his mind.","Fortunately, Jacob received a call and rushed over. He handed the phone to the middle-aged man and said in a low voice, “It’s a call from the independent continent.”","Quentin’s gaze softened as he reached out for the cell phone. He looked away and returned to his usual coldness. “I still have something on, so I won’t keep Elder Xue.”","**","Zhou Zheng was the most afraid over Nie Qixing’s ‘accident’.","He couldn’t figure out if it was Qiao Nian or the reclusive families behind Nie Qingru.","Ever since he separated from Nie Qixing that day, he had been hiding, afraid that someone would find him."]},{"number":3323,"title":"Chapter 3323: You Know This Person Too","paragraphs":["Chapter 3323: You Know This Person Too","Editor: Atlas Studios","He had been on tenterhooks for so long that he was about to have a mental breakdown.","After several consecutive days of insomnia, he still came out of his room in the evening. He put on a mask and hat and went downstairs to the nearby supermarket to buy instant noodles.","Zhou Zheng was staying in an express hotel this entire time.","The hotel was next to the most prosperous commercial street. It was a quiet place amid chaos. However, the surrounding environment was ordinary, and the buildings were messy.","It was completely different from the star-rated hotel he had stayed in before.","This place was relatively safe, and it was close to the hotel he had stayed in previously. He could observe the situation and run if he realized something was wrong.","Zhou Zheng went into the convenience store, took two bowls of instant noodles, paid, and turned to leave.","When he left the convenience store, he saw a familiar figure standing by the roadside.","The man had eye-catching bird feathers for hair. The colorful colors contrasted sharply with his sloppy outfit, making him unforgettable at first sight.","Zhou Zheng felt he looked familiar, so he subconsciously stopped and frowned at the man by the roadside.","At this moment.","The strange man started walking towards him.","Zhou Zheng was shocked and instinctively wanted to run.","However, before he could do so, someone grabbed his shoulder. He met the man’s half-smiling eyes and forced himself to remain calm. “Who are you? Do we know each other?”","“Tsk!” Slim Waist Control smacked his lips and reminded him impolitely, “You don’t know me, but I know you. I f*cking ate a bowl of instant noodles by the roadside and you had to get the hotel security officers to chase me for three streets, remember?”","“You are...” Zhou Zheng suddenly remembered and his eyes widened in shock. “The beggar from that day?”","Beggar...","Squatting on the roadside and eating instant noodles made him a beggar?","Was he mental?!","Slim Waist Control was so angry that he laughed. Then, he expressionlessly said, “Our boss wants to see you.”","Zhou Zheng’s heart skipped a beat. He had a bad premonition and wanted to run, but the beggar who grabbed his shoulder, looking thin and weak, had a strong grip and he could not break free.","Seeing that he couldn’t break free, Zhou Zheng paled and thought for a moment before asking, “Who’s your boss?”","Slim Waist Control still remembered that he ordered the security officers to chase after him. Thus, he was not polite as he pulled him towards the car parked by the roadside. “You’ll know when you get there!”","**","At the same time.","The atmosphere in Nie Qingru’s villa was low.","The servants did not dare to breathe loudly. They tried their best to breathe gently, afraid that they would accidentally attract trouble.","Even so, they could still feel the coldness emanating from Nie Qingru.","Someone came in from outside.","Nie Qingru did not even bat an eyelid. “How is it?”","Shadow lowered his head respectfully. “Zhou Zheng has been taken away.”","Nie Qingru paused and placed the teacup on the coffee table. Then, she straightened her back and looked at him sharply. “Oh? Who is it?”","Needless to say, it was not difficult to guess the answer to this question.","Shadow said, “Someone from the illegal district’s Red Alliance.","“You should have an impression of him. He’s one of the Red Alliance’s main members, Slim Waist Control.","“He appeared in Continent M ten days ago. It’s just that the Red Alliance is good at hacking and creating fake identities for themselves, so we only discovered him now.”","The truth was that if Slim Waist Control had not been in charge of looking for Zhou Zheng this time, they would probably not have discovered that he was in Continent M.","This was the Red Alliance.","Nie Qingru’s cheek muscles twitched. Her expression was dark as she lowered his eyes and said, “Since he’s from the Red Alliance, it must be her.”"]},{"number":3324,"title":"Chapter 3324: I Want to Gain Hatred for Sister Nian","paragraphs":["Chapter 3324: I Want to Gain Hatred for Sister Nian","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian was Sun of the Red Alliance. It wasn’t a secret in their circle.","Shadow looked over and saw that she did not speak.","Silence was the best answer.","Nie Qingru held her forehead with her hand and thought for a moment. Thinking of something, she said to him, “The Zhou family doesn’t know yet, right?”","“...I don’t think so.” Of course, the Zhou family wouldn’t know!","Nie Qingru raised her cold and stern eyebrows, sneered, and ordered, “Then tell the Zhou family, lest no one collects his corpse after he dies.”","She didn’t mind making an enemy for Qiao Nian.","“...Yes.”","* * *","Country M.","Zhou family.","After Zhou Zheng’s parents received a mysterious call, they immediately called their son.","As expected, they couldn’t get to him.","They couldn’t reach Zhou Zheng at all.","After a short period of panic, they received another mysterious call. The person on the phone reminded them that Zhou Zheng was in the hands of a girl called Qiao Nian.","The Zhou family had some connections in Country M and had a wide range of businesses. Otherwise, they wouldn’t have come into contact with Nie Qixing.","Mr. Zhou quickly found out about Beijing and information about Qiao Nian that he could find.","“She’s from Beijing, lived in Rao City before she was 18. She was only brought to the Jiang Family in Beijing two years ago...”","They couldn’t find much.","Although Mr. Zhou did not understand why Qiao Nian would kidnap his son, the current situation did not allow him to mull over it. He immediately used all the family’s connections to contact Beijing.","...","In the private hospital where Master Cheng was staying.","Master Cheng had already been transferred to the private plane by the Beijing doctors. The plane had taken off an hour ago and returned to Beijing.","Qiao Nian stayed in the hospital to take Master Cheng’s medical information for the past few days. She planned to bring it back to Beijing and hand it to the doctor Old Master Ye and the others found for Master Cheng.","Coming out of the attending doctor’s office, she bumped into the people from the Ninth Branch.","“Miss Qiao, when can we go back?” Jiang Tianzhi always spoke what was on his mind. He was not scheming and did not beat around the bush.","Since Master Cheng had already left, they were also in a hurry to return.","After all, the weapons exhibition was over. There was no point in them staying here anymore.","Moreover, everyone was worried about Master Cheng’s health. Of course, they would be more at ease if they returned to Beijing and took turns taking care of him in the hospital.","Yu Wenhao was inconspicuous in the crowd, but from time to time, he sized up Qiao Nian with a fearful and suspicious gaze.","Every time he saw Qiao Nian now, he thought of what happened to Nie Qixing. When he thought of himself, the uneasiness intensified.","But no one noticed him.","Qiao Nian did not notice that Yu Wenhao’s expression was off.","The girl pulled down her baseball cap, put away the documents, and said, “Soon.”","Jiang Tianzhi didn’t know how long was “soon” and was about to ask for clarification.","Qiao Nian seemed to know what he wanted to ask. She stuck one hand in her pocket and looked at him. “I’m looking for someone. We’ll leave after I find him and ask him some questions.”","Jiang Tianzhi was confused. “Miss Qiao, who are you looking for?”","Before Qiao Nian could answer him, Ye Wangchuan walked over from the end of the corridor. He walked past Jiang Tianzhi and the others toward the girl and grabbed the documents she was holding. He lowered his eyes and said, “Slim Waist Control is back.”","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows. She did not expect him to be so fast.","Not in the mood to waste time with Jiang Tianzhi and the others, she said to Ye Wangchuan, “Let’s go see him.”","They left side by side, leaving Jiang Tianzhi and the others behind..."]},{"number":3325,"title":"Chapter 3325: Would You Believe Me If I Said I Brought You to the Neurology Department?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3325: Would You Believe Me If I Said I Brought You to the Neurology Department?","Editor: Atlas Studios","At Master Cheng’s ward.","“Who are you?”","“Let me go.”","“I said get out of the way!”","Zhou Zheng wanted to rush out. Unfortunately, he was stopped by the bodyguards at the door every time.","His cell phone had been confiscated. When he smelled the hospital’s disinfectant, he thought of Nie Qixing. His heart beat uneasily, and he only wanted to leave this place as soon as possible.","“What do you want? Why did you bring me to the hospital?” Zhou Zheng pinched his palm and tried to calm down. “Just because of the instant noodles? I can compensate you. Ten bowls? No, I’ll compensate you as much as you want.”","Slim Waist Control was originally leaning against the door and playing games on his phone. When he heard him talking non-stop in his ear and saying that he wanted to compensate...","He looked up with a smile and spoke with an unpleasant tone. “Do I look like someone who can’t afford instant noodles?!”","Zhou Zheng looked at him as if he wanted to say something but hesitated. His expression was one of confusion.","“You’d better shut up!” Slim Waist Control couldn’t smile anymore. He really wanted to slap him to death before Qiao Nian came.","Zhou Zheng gritted his teeth. “Why did you bring me here?”","“Would you believe me if I said I brought you to the neurology department?” Slim Waist Control asked angrily. Then, he said, “I already told you my boss wants to see you. You started shouting here. Is your brain damaged or are you deaf?”","Seeing that his attitude was not good, Zhou Zheng did not dare to provoke him even though he was angry himself.","He was only quiet for a few minutes.","Slim Waist Control had yet to begin another game when Zhou Zheng spoke again, “Who’s your boss? Why does she want to see me? Is she...”","The equipment hadn’t been removed from the ward.","In addition to the strong smell of disinfectant, the equipment beeped from time to time.","The noise was torture to Zhou Zheng, who was already feeling guilty.","Slim Waist Control dug his ears. “What?”","Zhou Zheng felt guilty and did not dare to look into his eyes. “It’s nothing.”","He thought of Nie Qixing and what he had instructed him to do...","Slim Waist Control couldn’t be bothered with him and focused on his game.","Zhou Zheng looked at the two burly men guarding the door and knew he couldn’t escape. He walked back to the ward in a daze.","The hospital bed had been emptied and was covered with white sheets and bedding.","He had a guilty conscience and did not dare to approach the bed. Hence, he went to a chair in the corner and sat down.","Her heart was in turmoil as he tried to guess who wanted to see him this time.","Could it be someone from the reclusive families?","As soon as this thought appeared, Zhou Zheng denied it himself.","He had been by Nie Qixing’s side for half a year and had seen the reclusive families’ methods. Those people were used to being high and mighty and wouldn’t be so polite to those who were not one of them.","Zhou Zheng’s eyelids twitched.","If not the reclusive families, then who was it?","Just as he was drenched in cold sweat, there was finally movement at the door.","He heard the ‘beggar’ call out, “Boss.”","Zhou Zheng quickly raised his head and looked over nervously—","The ‘beggar’ wasn’t playing with his phone anymore. His attitude changed and he became as obedient as a primary school student talking to his teacher.","Zhou Zheng saw a handsome young man standing beside the beggar. He looked younger than Nie Qixing."]},{"number":3326,"title":"Chapter 3326: I Tried to Persuade Young Master Qi, But He Didn’t Listen","paragraphs":["Chapter 3326: I Tried to Persuade Young Master Qi, But He Didn’t Listen","Editor: Atlas Studios","He looked familiar.","However, Zhou Zheng couldn’t remember where he had seen this person before.","As he was distracted, Slim Waist Control made way for the young man. He turned around and pouted in his direction. Then, he said to the person before him, “Over there.”","At this moment, he saw the person who was blocked by him before. He blurted out, “Q-Qiao Nian?”","He gasped in surprise.","His eyes were fixed on the girl about to enter the ward. He didn’t expect that the person who found him first and brought him here was... Qiao Nian.","Zhou Zheng looked at the girl walking over and panicked for no reason. Not daring to remain sitting anymore, he stood up and subconsciously took a step back.","“You’re his boss?”","That was not the point.","Zhou Zheng grasped the main point and tried to control his emotions. He swallowed his saliva and tried not to look nervous.","“Why did you bring me here?","“I have no enmity with you people. Did you find the wrong person?”","“Tsk.”","The girl stopped in front of him and stood still. Her eyes were filled with disdain as she clicked her tongue. Then, she dragged a chair over and sat down.","Lazily resting her arm on the back of the chair, she raised her head slightly, revealing the exquisite face and dark eyes under the cap’s brim.","“Where were you on the day of Master Cheng’s accident?”","BOOM!","Zhou Zheng’s head was about to explode.","His face paled and his expression was terrible. His shoulders trembled and his eyes shook. However, he played dumb. “I don’t understand.”","He was probably too guilty.","Not waiting for the girl to ask, he anxiously distanced himself from the situation.","“Young Master Qi and I are indeed friends, but I didn’t participate in Master Cheng’s matters. If you don’t believe me, you can ask Young Master Qi.”","“Nie Qixing is already dead. Don’t you know?” Qiao Nian raised the corners of her eyes.","Zhou Zheng’s reaction was a little unnatural. He didn’t dare to look into her eyes. He stood there uneasily and pretended to be stupid. “Young Master Qi is dead? How is that possible?”","Qiao Nian couldn’t be bothered to waste her breath on him. She exposed him mercilessly. “If you didn’t know, why have you been hiding for the past few days? Weren’t you afraid that Nie Qingru would settle scores with you?”","She even knew about this?!","How did she know?","Zhou Zheng suddenly raised his head, his eyebrows twitching wildly.","Sticky sweat formed on his palm, and he did not know what to say.","Qiao Nian looked at him sharply and said concisely, “So, where were you on the day of Master Cheng’s accident?”","“I...” Zhou Zheng’s throat was dry and itchy.","During this period, he had been hiding at the hotel and could not sleep well at night. He didn’t dare to recall what had happened that day.","Now, the matter that he had tried his best to forget was forcefully placed in front of him in such a way.","Zhou Zheng was drenched in cold sweat, but he couldn’t say anything to quibble.","He had a feeling that the other party had already guessed everything!","He looked at the girl one step away, then at Ye Wangchuan, Slim Waist Control, and the others behind him. He listened to the beeping of the equipment in the ward.","His psychological defense finally collapsed.","Zhou Zheng’s shoulders trembled violently as he covered his face and said in a muffled tone, “I tried to persuade Young Master Qi! I kept telling him not to go after you, but he refused to listen! He insisted on forcing me to work for him.”","He regretted it.","When he received that mysterious call a few days ago, he regretted it to death.","If he had known, he wouldn’t have taken the risk to cling to the reclusive families. If he had not helped Nie Qixing, he wouldn’t have fallen into this state."]},{"number":3327,"title":"Chapter 3327: Sister Nian: Did You Think I Would Say That?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3327: Sister Nian: Did You Think I Would Say That?","Editor: Atlas Studios","“Back then, he insisted that I attack Master Cheng. He even insisted that I go alone. He said it would be easily discovered if I hired someone.","“I rejected him and tried to persuade him. I couldn’t afford to offend him! You know he has the reclusive families’ backing. I had no choice.”","Qiao Nian calmly said, “So you stabbed Master Cheng when Luo Qing wasn’t around?”","Zhou Zheng looked up with red eyes and clenched his fists. After a few seconds, he lowered his head in resignation and answered, “Yes.”","Ever since Nie Qixing asked him to leave the hotel that day, he did not dare to show his face again, afraid that what he did would be exposed.","Later, he heard that Nie Qixing had died in an accident at the hospital.","His fear reached its peak.","Zhou Zheng was finally relieved after speaking. However, the relief was shrouded in fear, and he couldn’t feel much comfort in his heart.","“Where’s the woman who was with Nie Qixing? Where did you hide her?” Qiao Nian suddenly asked.","Zhou Zheng’s facial muscles trembled. He was stunned for a moment before his expression turned disdainful, mocking, and resentful. “She ran away a long time ago!","“I told her that Young Master Qi was in danger and that the people from the reclusive families were looking for her. Then, she followed me obediently before suddenly running away when I wasn’t paying attention.”","She ran away?","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows and looked at Ye Wangchuan. They could see something in each other’s eyes.","Logically speaking, these things had nothing to do with that person. Why did she run?","Zhou Zheng was indignant. “I originally wanted to look for her, but... you know my situation. If it weren’t for the fact that I didn’t dare to be too high-profile, I would have captured her long ago.”","Now, he didn’t know where that woman was hiding.","At the end of the day, it was still that woman who caused the trouble.","If he still had that woman when the reclusive families found him, he could always push her out. In the end, that woman was even more ruthless and cunning than him and ran away quickly.","“You now know that I was the one who harmed Master Cheng. What do you plan to do with me?” Zhou Zheng didn’t take it to heart about the woman running away. He was more concerned about his situation.","“You’ve spent so much effort to find me. You definitely won’t let me off easily...” He sounded certain, but, in fact, he still had a trace of hope in his heart.","He felt that since he had said so much, Qiao Nian might be soft-hearted and let him off.","After all, he had been forced from the beginning to the end. He had not wanted to hurt Master Cheng subjectively. Besides, Master Cheng wasn’t dead. Qiao Nian wouldn’t be too calculative with him, right?","“This has nothing much to do with you...” The girl’s voice was composed and casual.","Zhou Zheng’s heart pounded. His eyes suddenly widened, and the corners of his mouth were about to curl up.","Then, the corners of the girl’s mouth curled up. Her expression was unrestrained as she leaned lazily against the back of the chair, tapped her fingers on the armrest, and looked at him with narrow eyes. “Did you think I would say that?”","Zhou Zheng’s heart immediately dropped. He fell from heaven to hell, and his face paled. “You...”","Qiao Nian was playing with him!","Unable to remain calm, he clenched his fists and growled in fear, “You’d better not do anything rash.”","He couldn’t afford to offend the reclusive families.","However, the Zhou family also knew many people in Beijing.","If Qiao Nian touched him...","Before Zhou Zheng could threaten her, Ye Wangchuan stared at him coldly, as if he was looking at trash."]},{"number":3328,"title":"Chapter 3328: Sister Nian Is Straightforward","paragraphs":["Chapter 3328: Sister Nian Is Straightforward","Editor: Atlas Studios","“Why do you care about him? I’m just teasing him,” Qiao Nian said slowly, blinking.","Zhou Zheng felt humiliated, and his neck turned red.","However, before he could speak, Ye Wangchuan lightly said, “Bring him back to Beijing and deal with him as you see fit.”","The legal procedures would be quite troublesome in Continent M. They would also need to go through extradition procedures.","However, if he was brought back to their country, whether it was Continent M or the Zhou family, they would have to follow the domestic legal procedures. Zhou Zheng would be charged with intentionally causing harm this time.","He could be sentenced to 20 to 30 years in prison.","Qiao Nian did not want to deal with him in private, so she immediately lowered her eyes and lightly replied, “Okay~”","**","They had delayed going back for half a day just to catch the person who stabbed Master Cheng.","Qiao Nian had been investigating the day before yesterday.","She didn’t check the surveillance cameras at that time.","After all, Nie Qixing did not target Master Cheng out of nowhere. He must have planned it carefully. In addition, Nie Qingru helped clean up the mess behind him.","It was quite difficult for her to check the surveillance footage.","Therefore, she had never thought of getting evidence at all. Instead, she started investigating the people around Nie Qixing.","Nie Qixing came to Continent M without anyone.","Nie Qingru arranged for people to stay by his side, partly to protect and partly to monitor the surveillance cameras.","If Nie Qixing wanted to attack Master Cheng, he definitely couldn’t use these people. Therefore, it was very simple to find out who that person was.","Excluding these people, there was only one person left—Zhou Zheng.","After leaving the ward, Qiao Nian handed a concealed recording pen to Luo Qing. “We’ve found the culprit who stabbed Master Cheng. This is his confession.”","Luo Qing exclaimed and instinctively reached out to take the recording pen from the girl. Returning to his senses, he chased after the girl in a daze. “Miss Qiao, how did you find this person?”","This was too fast.","He thought he would have to return to Beijing and discuss with Elder Ye and the rest before joining forces with the police here to investigate slowly. In his estimation, it would take at least a year and a half.","Unexpectedly, Qiao Nian had already captured the culprit.","“I didn’t find him.”","What?","Qiao Nian didn’t explain. She looked at the time and said, “Let’s get ready. It’s almost time to go back.”","The matter here was already settled.","It was time for them to return to Beijing.","“Alright.” Luo Qing did not delay and quickly turned around. “I’ll inform the others.”","Qiao Nian watched him leave before turning to the man who had been silently following. “Why didn’t you tell Luo Qing that your men were watching him?”","A smile appeared in Ye Wangchuan’s eyes. “He doesn’t know about Bright Gate.”","Qiao Nian’s hair fell disobediently at her brow bone, blocking her eyes. She did not seem to notice it.","Ye Wangchuan gently tucked her hair behind her ear with his slender fingers before saying, “Only you know about Bright Gate and Dark Fort.”","Old Master Ye didn’t know much about his influence outside, but Ye Wangchuan never hid anything from Qiao Nian. He always revealed it to her directly.","Qiao Nian felt a little hot where his fingertips touched her. She lowered her eyes and paused for a second before pulling down her baseball cap. However, she still felt flustered and looked up at him. “You... are seducing me with your beauty?”","She posed it as a question, but her tone was affirmative.","That tone was of annoyance, but it gave off an... indescribable feeling."]},{"number":3329,"title":"Chapter 3329: Sister Nian, I’ll Be Responsible","paragraphs":["Chapter 3329: Sister Nian, I’ll Be Responsible","Editor: Atlas Studios","Ye Wangchuan didn’t expect her to suddenly say that. It was rare for him to be stunned. Then, he shamelessly admitted it. “Yes.”","He seemed to have stars in his eyes as he looked at her with a faint smile. “So, Goddess Qiao, did I succeed?”","“...”","Qiao Nian stared at his eyes for a few seconds. Her eyelids twitched and she was about to look away.","Ye Wangchuan suddenly grabbed her slender wrist. His five fingers were tightly clasped, and his extremely long eyelashes covered his eyes, making them look even more dazzling.","“Goddess Qiao wants to run?”","“Ahem!”","Qiao Nian suspected that he was poisonous. She coughed dryly and did not break free from his hand. Instead, she faced him. “Then what do you want?”","Ye Wangchuan was stunned for a second, clearly not expecting this question. He momentarily couldn’t think of an answer.","What did he want?","He had never thought about this.","Qiao Nian looked at him steadily for a while but did not hear his voice. After thinking for a while, her fair face was a little unrestrained, but her expression was quite serious. “Don’t worry, I’ll take responsibility.”","—I’ll take responsibility!","Ye Wangchuan smiled and brushed her eyebrows. “Are you saying I’m afraid that you won’t take responsibility?”","Qiao Nian glanced at him.","She did not want to say it at first.","However, seeing how he was pretending to be so romantic, she couldn’t help but say, “No? I thought you were quite eager.”","Ye Wangchuan was standing opposite her. Hearing this, he gently touched his chin. His eyes were half-lowered, reflecting the girl’s face.","“There’s no use in me being eager.”","Qiao Nian looked at his handsome face and subconsciously pinched her between her eyebrows, feeling an incoming headache. “... I have to settle the independent continent’s matters first.”","She had yet to find out how Ji Qing died back then.","The last experiment on the USB drive had yet to be successfully replicated.","Just these things alone would take three to five months. She was definitely not in the mood to discuss these things in the short term.","Ye Wangchuan seemed to know what she was going to say. He pinched her slightly cold fingertips and returned to his usual lazy and casual self. “I said I would wait for you to turn 21.”","Qiao Nian looked up.","He had just admitted his eagerness.","Ye Wangchuan could tell what she was thinking. He pinched the girl’s fingertips and wrapped his hand around hers to warm it up. His voice was low and mellow. “It’s been almost two years since my internship. It’s normal for Big Bro to be anxious.”","Qiao Nian subconsciously tried to pull the brim of her cap when he called himself “Big Bro.” However, she realized that he was still holding her hand.","Her fingertips felt less cold than before with his palm’s warmth.","Qiao Nian knew he was deliberately mentioning her past in Rao City. In order not to let Jiang Li discover her identity, she had once called him “Brother”.","However, even though she knew he was teasing her on purpose, Qiao Nian still took a deep breath and narrowed her dark eyes at him.","Ye Wangchuan’s lips curled up slightly.","Suddenly, he was pushed against the wall by the girl. Then, a slightly cold breath approached, and the fragrance of soap that only belonged to Qiao Nian filled the air. As he was distracted, he was bitten on the lips.","Qiao Nian took a bite and let go. Then, she smiled like him, looked at him, and said, “Brother won’t be angry, right?”","She emphasized ‘Brother’.","She was simply arrogant.","Ye Wangchuan’s eyes darkened. He was about to pull her back.","Suddenly, hurried footsteps approached. Qin Si’s voice arrived first before they could even see him. “Master Wang, Deputy Captain Luo just said...”"]},{"number":3330,"title":"Chapter 3330: Why Are the Reclusive Families Like a Plaster That I Can’t Shake Off?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3330: Why Are the Reclusive Families Like a Plaster That I Can’t Shake Off?","Editor: Atlas Studios","He rushed over and saw two figures leaning against each other.","Qin Si immediately braked and bounced up as if he had seen a ghost. “Uh, Sister Qiao is here too. Um, continue. I’ll get lost right now!”","He left immediately, as he said he would. He ran away in the blink of an eye.","Qiao Nian returned to her senses. She had a headache and looked upset. She did not understand why she was led astray by him.","It seemed that every time she faced a certain someone, her self-control would always become poor.","There were times when she wanted to talk to him about serious matters, but then she slowly became like this.","Qiao Nian let go of him and took a step back. “The officialization banquet...”","She was really thinking about this?","Ye Wangchuan couldn’t help but laugh. He didn’t expect to have a girlfriend’s officialization banquet one day. If the old man found out, he would definitely chase him with his walking stick on the streets.","“Let’s buy something for Chen Chen.”","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows at him.","Ye Wangchuan looked extremely beautiful. His eyes darted around as he smiled and said, “Comfort the little kid.”","Especially the kind of kid who hoped he would grow up quickly and secretly wanted to swing a small hoe to pry open the corner of their uncle’s house.","He really wanted to see Ye Qichen’s expression when he received Qiao Nian’s present.","That little devil was the best at pretending to be obedient in front of his ‘sister’. This time, he wanted to see the little guy cry.","Qiao Nian did not think too much about it. She thought he was just taking care of the little guy, so she nodded. “Coincidentally, I bought a few game discs these few days.”","“Alright.” Ye Wangchuan stuffed his hands into his pockets and leaned against the wall.","He had long legs and a tall figure. He stood out no matter where he was.","Qiao Nian couldn’t help but look at him. She felt that the corners of his lips were still... deliberately teasing her.","At this moment, Qin Si returned.","Seeing that they had separated, he panted heavily and said, “Um, Master Wang, let me make it clear first that I didn’t do it on purpose.","“Someone is looking for Sister Qiao outside.”","Qiao Nian’s attention was attracted. She lowered her eyebrows. “Who is it?”","“Tsk.” Qin Si smacked his lips and said mockingly, “Who else could it be?”","Qiao Nian was still looking at him, and he did not leave her hanging. “Someone from the reclusive families. He’s an old man and doesn’t look like someone from Continent M.”","Qiao Nian had already guessed who it was from his description. The corners of her mouth twitched as she said impatiently, “Looks like they’ve already received the news that I’m leaving.”","It had not been long, and these people could not sit still anymore.","Ye Wangchuan grabbed her hand. “You’re going?”","Qiao Nian seemed used to his intimate actions and didn’t feel any repulsion or discomfort. She narrowed her eyes and suppressed her impatience. “We’re leaving soon. If I don’t see them, they’ll only keep looking for me.","“Troublesome!”","One could tell how she felt about these people from the reclusive families just by that word!","Qin Si was touched.","Not to mention Sister Qiao, even he felt that these people from the reclusive families were like plaster that he could not shake off.","They stuck to them every other day.","Those people were all the same. They already came knocking on their door, but they still acted so high and mighty. It was annoying to watch.","* * *","At the hospital’s entrance.","Elder Xue stood in the lobby waiting for the girl to come down.","Luo Qing had just informed Jiang Tianzhi and the others that they were leaving. At this moment, a few people from the Ninth Branch came out of the elevator, planning to return to the hotel to retrieve their belongings.","They should have returned a few days ago, but Master Cheng’s matter gave them no choice but to postpone their departure. Their already packed luggage was opened and messed up again.","Therefore, they had to go back to organize their things so that they could leave conveniently later."]},{"number":3331,"title":"Chapter 3331: Serves You Right, Being Isolated!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3331: Serves You Right, Being Isolated!","Editor: Atlas Studios","When the group of people came out of the elevator, they immediately saw the old man in green standing in the lobby. Beside the old man were two bodyguards standing upright and shining brightly.","The two bodyguards stood there without any unnecessary movements, making people feel oppressed.","“That person...” Yu Wenhao slowed down.","Jiang Tianzhi also saw the extremely eye-catching old man in the middle of the hall. Much steadier than Yu Wenhao, he said, “Let’s go our own way. Don’t worry about him.”","From the looks of it, this person was not someone they would usually come into contact with. The other party shouldn’t notice them as long as they did not take the initiative to provoke him.","Yu Wenhao could tell what he was implying, and an indescribable feeling arose in his heart.","He followed Jiang Tianzhi and the others out in silence when passing by the old man in the middle of the hall, the other party suddenly asked, “I’m sorry, have you seen Qiao Nian?”","Looking for Qiao Nian... Yu Wenhao had long felt that the other party was here for Qiao Nian. Yet, he was still stunned when the other party asked about her.","At this moment, a few pairs of eyes landed on him. In particular, the old man’s gaze did not look fierce. Instead, it looked calm.","He adjusted his breathing and looked up. “She’s probably still upstairs in the ward.”","Jiang Tianzhi frowned and looked at Yu Wenhao with disapproval.","Yu Wenhao pretended not to see it and said to the old man, “Why are you looking for her? Why don’t I help you call her?”","The green-robed old man looked at him in surprise. “Are you... very familiar with her?”","He knew Qiao Nian well. Other than being close to her friends, she was usually cold to others. She was not difficult to get along with, but she did not like to socialize.","Seeing that Yu Wenhao could go up to call Qiao Nian directly, the old man thought that Yu Wenhao and Qiao Nian had a good relationship.","Yu Wenhao was a little taken aback by the question. He said awkwardly, “I’m not very familiar with her... I just know her.”","Elder Xue thought he was being polite and was about to speak when the elevator doors opened not far ahead.","A girl in a T-shirt and baseball cap walked out of the elevator and walked in their direction.","Elder Xue immediately forgot about Yu Wenhao and walked towards the girl.","The two bodyguards followed.","Yu Wenhao was left standing there alone.","He seemed a little embarrassed. His face was red, and so was his neck. He watched the two of them meet.","Seeing that he was still standing there, Jiang Tianzhi urged him, “Aren’t you coming?”","Yu Wenhao turned around reluctantly. “I...”","Jiang Tianzhi couldn’t stand that he tried to curry favor with the reclusive families just now. He said coldly, “Everyone must return and pack their luggage. If you don’t want to go, stay here alone. We’ll leave first.”","He was quite impolite!","However, no one from the Ninth Branch helped Yu Wenhao out.","Master Cheng had been schemed against by the people from the reclusive families this time. Everyone felt uncomfortable and did not look good when they saw those people.","However, it was obvious that Yu Wenhao wanted to curry favor with the other party just now, which lowered their views of him!","Yu Wenhao could also feel everyone’s ostracization and indifference towards him. He quietly clenched his fists, embarrassed to continue staying here. “I want to leave.”","“Then let’s get out of here.”","Jiang Tianzhi did not look at him as he turned around to lead the way.","The others also filed out. No one spoke to him.","Yu Wenhao felt even more isolated.","He pursed his lips and turned to look at Qiao Nian and Elder Xue in the middle of the hall before reluctantly following everyone out."]},{"number":3332,"title":"Chapter 3332: Sister Nian: You Can Try to Take Him From Me If You Want Him","paragraphs":["Chapter 3332: Sister Nian: You Can Try to Take Him From Me If You Want Him","Editor: Atlas Studios","“I heard that you’re going back to Beijing soon?” Elder Xue did not notice the passerby he had casually stopped just now as he spoke to Qiao Nian.","The girl was playing with something in her hand. Looking up and seeing his anxious expression, she stopped and smiled. Then, she casually said, “You didn’t come to ask me this, right?”","Elder Xue was stunned.","The last time he saw Qiao Nian was when she left the Privy Council. Although Qiao Nian did not speak much, her attitude towards him was still good.","At the very least, she was polite.","Today, he felt the girl’s alienation, as if she was not familiar with him and he was just an ordinary stranger.","Elder Xue was momentarily unused to the disparity. He looked at her with a complicated expression. “Are you still angry about my phone calls and text messages?”","His eyes were dark and unreadable for a moment. Then, he said reluctantly, “I have my stand, but I hope you won’t take the wrong path.”","Qiao Nian looked at his expression. It seemed she wanted him to continue.","Elder Xue took a deep breath and sighed. “You’re still young. There will be endless possibilities in the future. You shouldn’t be so radical, let alone go against the reclusive families.”","Qiao Nian could investigate the cause of Ji Qing’s death, but her stance now actually disregarded the reclusive families’ interests.","He couldn’t accept this no matter what.","In his eyes, the reclusive families’ interests were above everything else. Qiao Nian should share his sentiments.","After all, she was a direct descendant of the Ji family and was inextricably linked to the reclusive families. The independent continent’s Ji family and the reclusive families belonged to the same power. It was fine for everyone to have small fights, but they should advance and retreat together when facing common interests.","Qiao Nian’s actions... had crossed the red line!","Elder Xue looked at her again. Taking her silence for agreement, his gaze softened a little as he softly persuaded her, “Is Zhou Zheng with you? Hand Zhou Zheng to me, and I’ll help you communicate with the Empress.","“Nie Qixing is already dead. You can be considered to have avenged Master Cheng. You’re still young. You might not understand the importance of leaving a way out for everything.”","He meant that Master Cheng had already been sent back to Beijing.","Nie Qixing was gone too.","In that case, she could let Zhou Zheng go. At the very least, everyone would look good and this would not become a big deal.","Qiao Nian came back to her senses and finally looked at him. Her arrogant gaze landed on his face and she sneered. “Are you here to ask for Zhou Zheng?”","Elder Xue paused.","Then, he heard the girl’s casual and cold tone. “Are you looking for me, or is Nie Qingru looking for me?”","Elder Xue frowned. He did not expect her to be so direct. She did not give him any face at all. “Qiao Nian, I’m here for you.”","He very much admired this direct descendant of the Ji family. She was talented, capable, and had a temper.","Just as he had said, he did not want Qiao Nian to go down the wrong path.","At the very least, he felt that he was here to save a genius who was about to reach a fork in the road. He was not doing this for anyone in particular.","Qiao Nian looked at him and said directly, “Is she worried that if Zhou Zheng returns to Beijing with me, she won’t be able to hide what Nie Qixing did?”","Nie Qingru sacrificed Nie Qixing for power.","Now the dust had settled.","She was trying to take care of Zhou Zheng to protect Nie Qixing’s reputation.","They made the choice themselves, and yet they wanted to be good people after the fact.","This... was the style of the reclusive families.","How hypocritical!","“I won’t give you Zhou Zheng. If you want him, you can try to take him from me.”"]},{"number":3333,"title":"Chapter 3333: That’s Not Someone to Be Provoked","paragraphs":["Chapter 3333: That’s Not Someone to Be Provoked","Editor: Atlas Studios","Seeing that she was about to leave, Elder Xue panicked. “Qiao Nian, you can’t leave.”","The girl stopped in her tracks but did not turn around.","“My plane leaves at seven in the evening. If you have the ability, you can shoot it down. That way, I can stay.”","How arrogant!","Elder Xue was stunned. In the blink of an eye, the girl entered the elevator. As the doors were about to close, Elder Xue called out with an ugly expression, “Do you have to go against the reclusive families?”","He did not quite understand what Qiao Nian was thinking.","This matter had blown up so much that he had to mediate between the two parties. Why wouldn’t Qiao Nian agree?","Before the elevator doors closed, Qiao Nian finally looked him in the eye and said slowly, “Didn’t you tell her long ago that you wanted to deal with me together? Why did you come to me to talk about this?”","“How did you...” Elder Xue almost blurted out what was on his mind.","Fortunately, he realized it in time and endured it with a livid expression.","“Tsk.” The corners of the girl’s lips curled up as she looked into his eyes calmly. “I guessed.”","She didn’t know. She just said it casually.","But now, it seemed that she had guessed correctly.","Without hesitation, she took out the things from her pocket and bent down to place them on the ground at the elevator entrance. Then, she stood up again.","“I’ll return this to you.”","Elder Xue watched from afar as she placed something on the ground. Upon a closer look, he realized it was a seal.","The seal was exquisite—the family token he had given Qiao Nian previously.","When Elder Xue saw what Qiao Nian had placed on the ground, his expression changed slightly and became more and more complicated. Then, he said in a low voice, “You want to draw a line with me?”","The girl looked at him and casually said, “We have different paths, so we can’t work together.”","**","The elevator doors closed.","One of Elder Xue’s two bodyguards jogged over to pick up the jade seal and respectfully handed it to the green-robed elder. “Elder Xue.”","Elder Xue grabbed the jade seal with a complicated expression. The jade material felt cold in his hand, and he remained silent.","Instead, it was the bodyguard who looked at the closed elevator door and said, “Elder Xue, are we going to let her go just like that?”","“What else do you want to do?” The old man kept the jade seal and looked at him expressionlessly.","The bodyguard did not dare to meet his gaze and lowered his head. Then, he indignantly said, “I just feel that letting her go like this is too easy on her!”","When had their reclusive families ever suffered such a loss!","This girl was too arrogant.","She was just a girl from Beijing with no powerful background. How dare she speak like this to Elder Xue of the Privy Council?","“Didn’t she ask us to shoot...” The bodyguard was only halfway through his sentence.","Elder Xue’s gaze made him shut his mouth in embarrassment.","Although the bodyguard shut his mouth, his expression was still unconvinced. It was as if he really would do this if Elder Xue did not stop him.","Shooting down a plane seemed like a ridiculous suggestion, but, in fact, similar things had happened many times in the past few years.","It would just be concluded as an accident. No one would pursue the truth of the matter, and they would be buried in the river of time.","The bodyguard followed beside Elder Xue and knew very well about many such occurrences.","That was why he did not understand why Elder Xue would not do so this time.","“Do you think Bright Gate is a saint?”","Ye Wangchuan had always been cautious. The seas around Continent M had not been peaceful recently.","If they dared to make a move... He believed that Ye Wangchuan would definitely have prepared a backup plan and let them taste the bitter consequences.","“He’s not a man to be provoked.”"]},{"number":3334,"title":"Chapter 3334: Qin Si Actually Thinks Sister Nian Will Lose","paragraphs":["Chapter 3334: Qin Si Actually Thinks Sister Nian Will Lose","Editor: Atlas Studios","The bodyguard did not understand.","Elder Xue said calmly, “Right now, the independent continent, the illegal district, and Beijing are all watching us. If we dare to shoot down the plane, they will definitely make a move. At that time, it will shake the reclusive families’ foundations! Therefore, we can’t make a move nor...”","He did not finish the second half of his sentence.","They couldn’t make a move.","Nor did they dare to!","In fact, it was their not daring that was key in this decision.","Back then, Ji Qing’s matter did not cause the reclusive families to ‘not dare to move’, but Qiao Nian... Elder Xue’s breathing was a little tight, and it felt like a huge rock was pressing on his heart. He was indescribably frustrated.","At this point, Qiao Nian had already exceeded everyone’s imagination. Even he could only adopt a gentle policy and not start a conflict with her.","“Let’s go.” Seeing that the elevator had already gone up, Elder Xue saw no need to stay any longer. He turned around and expressionlessly asked the bodyguards to follow.","The two bodyguards looked at each other, not understanding what he meant by “independent continent, illegal district, and Beijing” targeting the reclusive families.","It was still possible for Beijing to target the reclusive families.","After all, these people came from Beijing.","However, the independent continent and the illegal district had always been unregulated. When had there been a conflict with them?","Although they did not know, they did not dare to provoke the green-robed old man. They could only follow him obediently out of the hotel.","**","Qiao Nian and the others took the evening flight.","They took off at seven sharp in the evening.","Because it was Ye Wangchuan’s private plane, it was spacious, low-key, and comfortable in all aspects.","As soon as Qiao Nian got on the plane, she found a relatively quiet spot and asked the flight attendant for a blanket, an eye mask, and earplugs. Then, she immediately fell asleep.","Everyone knew she did not like taking planes, so no one disturbed her. Qin Si tacitly gave up the area where Qiao Nian was sleeping and ran to the side to find someone to play poker with.","During the 10-hour flight from Continent M to Beijing, Qiao Nian slept almost the entire flight. She only woke up when they were almost there. She pulled off her blindfold and watched them play cards.","Luo Qing and the others could not help but sleep for part of the journey. Only Qin Si was a night owl. The more he played, the more energetic he became.","When Qiao Nian approached, the people playing cards had already changed from Luo Qing and Jiang Tianzhi to Ye Wangchuan and Yu Wenhao, plus someone from the Ninth Branch to make up the numbers.","Gu San just watched Ye Wangchuan play.","Qiao Nian walked over. “What are you playing?”","Gu San was shocked to hear her voice. He turned to look at the girl before saying, “Young Master Qin and Master Wang are playing cards.”","“Oh.” Of course, Qiao Nian could tell that they were playing cards. She wanted to know what they were playing.","The others also saw her.","Qin Si greeted her warmly. “Sister Qiao, you’re awake.”","The other person from the Ninth Branch also greeted her with a smile.","Only Yu Wenhao clenched his cards tightly. He was a little uneasy and had a complicated expression on his face. His lips quivered slightly, but he did not make a sound.","Fortunately, the girl did not notice him. She walked behind Ye Wangchuan and reached for a bottle of water. She spoke lazily as if she had just woken up. “You guys play.”","Ye Wangchuan put down his cards and handed her a tissue. “Do you want to play?”","Qiao Nian glanced at him before silently taking the tissue and wiping her hands.","Qin Si’s eyes lit up and he called out to the girl, “That’s right, Sister Qiao. Since you’re awake, let’s play a few rounds together~”","As if afraid that Qiao Nian would refuse, he pointed at the chips piled up in front of Ye Wangchuan and teased, “Don’t be afraid of losing. Master Wang won a lot. Help him lose some to us.”"]},{"number":3335,"title":"Chapter 3335: The Losers Are All Numb","paragraphs":["Chapter 3335: The Losers Are All Numb","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian did not want to play at first, but at his request, she raised her eyebrows and walked over boldly. “How do we play?”","Ye Wangchuan gave up his seat dotingly and explained the game rules to her.","Coincidentally, Qin Si was about to lose this round. He took the opportunity to mix the cards and quickly said, “Since Sister Qiao is playing, this round doesn’t count.","“Do it again. Do it again.”","“...”","The others followed him and threw their cards on the table.","Ye Wangchuan did not argue with them. He was still softly explaining the rules to the girl.","Qin Si was in charge of shuffling the cards. After a while, he parted them and placed them on the table.","He very cunningly made a statement before starting. “Master Wang, since you’re just a spectator, you can’t guide Sister Qiao. Sister Qiao can only play by herself. Otherwise, the three of us will be at a disadvantage!”","The big boss was rich to begin with and he often shoved his public displays of affection in their faces.","Since they were playing cards now, he should at least let them win a few rounds. Otherwise, what was the point of life?!","Ye Wangchuan did not care about winning or losing. His voice was low. “Okay.”","Then, he restrained his smile and said with a charming gaze, “Play however you want with the chips on the table. I’ll buy more for you if you lose.”","Qin Si laughed. “Master Wang, you’re so generous!”","Qiao Nian had just woken up and was not wearing her customary baseball cap. Still sleepy, her expression was relaxed as she hummed and said to Qin Si, “Let’s begin.”","Everyone picked up their cards.","Gu San stood behind Qiao Nian and watched the battle.","After everyone quickly picked up their cards, probably having a good hand, Qin Si smiled smugly. “There’s no brotherhood in games. Sister Qiao, I won’t stand on ceremony!”","Qiao Nian had just learned the rules from Ye Wangchuan. She calmly sorted out her cards and casually said, “Mm.”","Gu San saw her cards and gave Qin Si an ambiguous look. He wanted to say something but hesitated. In the end, he did not say anything.","The rest of the battle was a complete massacre.","However, it was different from what Qin Si had expected.","Qiao Nian’s cards were bizarrely good. Other than being a little rusty at the beginning, she dominated the rest of the game.","She seemed to be able to guess their cards.","Every time Qin Si had a potentially good hand, she would be able to block him. She did not allow Qin Si to play his moves.","After 10 rounds, Qin Si had lost all his chips.","He pounced on the card table. “Sister Qiao, are you sure you don’t know how to play? What kind of newbie are you?”","In the past, he often played with Zhang Yang and the others, and they occasionally played cards. His card skills were not bad. Other than being tortured by Ye Wangchuan every time, he could still play with others.","But now... he was numb from losing.","“I really don’t,” Qiao Nian replied frankly. “But I don’t know how to lose either.”","Qin Si was speechless.","She didn’t know how to lose.","Impressive.","Qiao Nian was about to return the chips to them when a hand stopped her. Then, the man sitting behind her lazily said, “I remember you wanted to bully the newbie?”","Qin Si was speechless.","He did not succeed in bullying her at all. He was bullied instead.","Ye Wangchuan glanced at him. “In that case, shouldn’t the chips double? I remember the Qin family has a technology support fund. Qing University...”","How could Qin Si not understand? He wasn’t a real fool, so he quickly raised his hand and interrupted him. “I understand. Support Qing University’s research team, right? Alright! I’ll tell my family later.”"]},{"number":3336,"title":"Chapter 3336: Aunt Ye: Did I Ask You?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3336: Aunt Ye: Did I Ask You?","Editor: Atlas Studios","The corners of Ye Wangchuan’s eyes raised as he let go of Qiao Nian’s hand. The corners of his lips curled up as he gave Qin Si a look.","Qin Si touched the bridge of his nose and wondered if he would be able to do it.","Actually, he knew very well that Ye Wangchuan could have done this directly. However, Uncle Jiang might be unwilling if support was offered in the Ye family’s name.","Therefore, it was more appropriate for him to handle this matter.","Qin Si could figure it out himself. “Qing University has indeed had many good scientific research projects recently. We were considering Qing University previously, we just hadn’t decided yet.”","The Qin was a big family.","Qin Si’s mother was a strong woman. Besides managing her own business, she was also involved in many charitable causes and foundations.","Qin Si occasionally helped her deal with these things.","Yu Wenhao watched as they negotiated a sum of money in a few sentences. Then, he saw that the girl seemed to be used to it and did not show any gratitude.","His emotions were indescribable, and he felt uncomfortable.","Afraid someone would notice his discomfort, Yu Wenhao stood up and said softly, “I’m going to the washroom.”","“Go on.” Qin Si responded but did not notice him.","Yu Wenhao got up and left in a hurry.","On the other hand, Qiao Nian noticed his strange reactions time and time again. She narrowed her eyes at Yu Wenhao’s back in surprise.","Then, she turned to Qin Si and said, “Cheng Feng Corporation also has a project they are looking for a company to collaborate with. The Qin Corporation...”","She roughly told him about the project.","This was not a small project. The illegal Red Alliance’s shadow was behind it. It could be considered a 10-figure sum cooperation.","There was no need to mention the benefits.","She directly gave this opportunity to the Qin family as a form of repayment for their research support fund...","Qin Si had heard his family mention this project before. Seeing that Qiao Nian wanted to cooperate with their family, he dropped his playful act. He did not immediately agree to anything and only said, “I’ll go back and tell my mother about it. If we can cooperate, we’ll go through the normal procedures. If not, forget it. Anyway, I’ll treat it as you giving our company a chance to bid and cooperate. I’ll give you the confirmation later.”","Qiao Nian understood that he did not want to take advantage of their friendship, so she did not make things difficult for him. “Alright! You can contact Aunt Yuan later.”","Yuan Yongqin was in charge of Cheng Feng Corporation. If Qin Si wanted to cooperate with this project, he had to communicate with Yuan Yongqin.","Qin Si was also straightforward. “Okay.”","...","The plane landed at the terminal of Beijing International Airport an hour later.","Ye Lan had long received the news and was waiting outside the terminal.","When Qiao Nian, Qin Si, and the others came out, she greeted them, “This way!”","When the group saw her, they quickly walked towards her.","Ye Lan was famous in Beijing, and many people knew her.","When the people from the Ninth Branch saw her, they became more reserved and followed Ye Wangchuan and the others silently.","Ye Lan couldn’t hide her smile when she saw Qiao Nian and the others. Although there were traces of age at the corners of her eyes, those did not change her capable temperament. “The car is waiting outside. Are you going to eat with me now or go back and change your clothes first?”","“Let’s go back first.” Ye Wangchuan knew she was mainly asking Qiao Nian.","“Did I ask you?” Ye Lan rolled her eyes at him.","However, when her gaze landed on Qiao Nian, it was much gentler. “Then go back and take a shower, change your clothes, and rest first. We’ll eat later.”"]},{"number":3337,"title":"Chapter 3337: Ji Lingfeng Returned to the Independent Continent","paragraphs":["Chapter 3337: Ji Lingfeng Returned to the Independent Continent","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian immediately went to her room after returning to Rhine. She took a shower to wash away her fatigue before resting in her room. After a while, she went downstairs.","They parted ways at the airport.","Jiang Tianzhi and the others returned to the Ninth Branch. Yu Wenhao said he wanted to see Master Cheng... Qin Si and Luo Qing went home separately. Everyone either had something on or had to go back to shower and change.","Only Gu San and Ye Wangchuan were in the living room.","Gu San seemed to be saying something to Ye Wangchuan.","Qiao Nian vaguely heard the words “independent continent” and “Ji Lin”.","Ye Wangchuan’s black hair was still wet. He was sitting on the sofa cross-legged, with a bottle of water in his hand.","He looked lazy and casual.","“Then call Ji Lin back.” He tilted his head and spoke to Gu San. The light formed a halo on his high nose bridge, making his eyes look deep and his thin lips cold.","Gu San replied, “Okay.”","As he turned around and saw the girl coming downstairs, his eyes lit up and he quickly greeted her. “Miss Qiao, you’re down.”","“Mm,” Qiao Nian replied. She looked at the man leaning lazily on the sofa. “What time are we leaving?”","Ye Wangchuan looked at his watch and then back at her. “It’s up to you. It’s about time. We can leave anytime you want.”","Gu San whispered, “Miss Qiao, I’ve gotta make a call.”","“Go on.”","Qiao Nian remembered they were talking about the independent continent and Ji Lin. She walked over, took a bottle of water from the fridge, unscrewed it, and returned. Then, she asked directly, “You were just talking about the independent continent. What happened there?”","Ye Wangchuan snatched the bottle from her and handed her another. He lowered his eyes and said, “Drink this.","“You just took it out of the fridge. It’s too cold.”","Qiao Nian frowned subconsciously.","Ye Wangchuan met her gaze and said frankly, “Did you forget about your stomachache last month?”","Qiao Nian suddenly paused. She remembered that when she had her period last month, her menstrual cramps had acted up... However, she immediately looked at him speechlessly.","He even remembered this so clearly. Impossible!","Seeing that she was less resistant, Ye Wangchuan answered her previous question. “Ji Lingfeng went home.”","Qiao Nian immediately tightened her grip on the bottle and narrowed her eyes at him. “When?”","“An hour ago.” Ye Wangchuan calmly reminded her to drink water before leaning back against the couch. His Adam’s apple bobbed as he said with a faint smile, “After you left, Ji Nan alone could not control the elders. Seeing that some people were starting to cause trouble for Ji Nan again, if Ji Lingfeng went back now... those people would probably be so scared that they wouldn’t be able to sleep.”","Ji Lingfeng’s return was so sudden that he did not receive the news in advance.","It could be seen how well Lu Zhi hid this news.","“He didn’t tell you?”","“Who?” Qiao Nian glanced at him before belatedly realizing who he was talking about. “No. He’s always been like this. He does whatever he wants to.”","Lu Zhi did things based on his preferences. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have provoked so many enemies.","Many people in the illegal district hated him to the core. They just couldn’t do anything to him. If they could, she did not doubt that Lu Zhi would have long been minced into meat paste.","However, his behavior indeed asked for a beating.","“Jian Jin didn’t tell me either.” Qiao Nian felt frustrated for no reason and rubbed her eyebrows. “I don’t think even she knows.”","So, who knew what Lu Zhi wanted to do again!"]},{"number":3338,"title":"Chapter 3338: Master Wang: I’ll Park the Car First","paragraphs":["Chapter 3338: Master Wang: I’ll Park the Car First","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian had been mentally and physically exhausted because of Master Cheng’s matter. If Lu Zhi caused trouble again... Qiao Nian’s eyebrows twitched, feeling cold and dry.","Ye Wangchuan could see her frustration and immediately said, “Then let’s not worry about this for now. We’ll talk about it when we return to the independent continent.”","“Okay.” That was all she could do for now.","Qiao Nian was thinking about the situation on the independent continent.","Ye Lan called at this moment.","Qiao Nian slowly took out her cell phone and looked at the caller ID before accepting the call.","“Nian Nian, have you set off?” Ye Lan asked briskly.","Qiao Nian could only put aside the matter of the independent continent and Lu Zhi for now. She walked to the sofa with one hand in her pocket before answering, “Setting off right now.”","“Alright. Old Master and I will be arriving soon. Take your time. There’s no hurry.” Ye Lan seemed afraid she would rush, so she added, “We’ll order first. This private restaurant prepares their dishes one at a time. It takes more time.”","“Okay.” Qiao Nian agreed.","Only then did Ye Lan feel relieved. “By the way, is there anything you want to eat? Aunt Ye will order it for you.”","Qiao Nian’s expression had already relaxed a lot. Her shoulders relaxed and she said politely, “I can do with anything.”","“Then I’ll decide,” Ye Lan said immediately.","Qiao Nian replied, “Mm.”","Ye Lan hung up.","Qiao Nian put down her phone and looked at the man on the sofa. “Aunt Ye and the old master are on the way. It’s about time for us to leave.”","“Okay.” Ye Wangchuan got up and walked further into the apartment. “It’s windy at night. I’ll get my coat.”","Qiao Nian was still wearing a simple sweater and baseball cap. Her casual style was very street-like.","In particular, the floral logo on her sweater was unique. It made her look even more unruly.","She sat down and took out her phone to send a message to Feng Yu, asking him about Ji Lingfeng’s return.","Feng Yu did not reply immediately.","Qiao Nian wasn’t in a hurry.","Coincidentally, Ye Wangchuan came out with his coat. She put her cell phone in her pocket and stood up. “Let’s go.”","**","Ye Lan had booked a private restaurant this time. It was obvious this was a place that only the locals could find.","It was similar to the place where Ye Wangchuan took Qiao Nian to eat mutton.","This private restaurant was also in an alley.","Already many luxury cars were parked outside the vermillion courtyard house. The license plates were all consecutive numbers or similar numbers.","It was obvious that these license plates were more expensive than the cars.","Ye Wangchuan drove an ordinary Hummer this time. It was not expensive among the luxury cars and also had an ordinary license plate.","He parked the car outside the courtyard house and turned to the girl. “Go in first. I’ll find a place to park.”","“Okay.”","Qiao Nian unbuckled her seatbelt without hesitation, got out of the car, and walked in.","Ye Wangchuan stuck his head out the window and reminded her, “Call Aunt and ask her to pick you up.”","Actually, even without him saying anything, Qiao Nian was already going to call Ye Lan to ask which private room they were in.","This kind of private restaurant mainly had independent private rooms and was unlikely to have any tables in the hall. Therefore, it was quite troublesome to locate a specific private room.","She had just stepped in when a waitress in a cheongsam blocked her way with a smile. She didn’t say anything, but looking Qiao Nian up and down clearly showed she was not welcome. “I’m sorry, ma’am. You’d need to make an appointment here in advance.”"]},{"number":3339,"title":"Chapter 3339: May I Ask Your Elder’s Name?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3339: May I Ask Your Elder’s Name?","Editor: Atlas Studios","Their private restaurant was located in the bustling alley of a tourist attraction. There were many tourists here, so it was inevitable that a tourist who had walked the wrong way would stumble on this place and take it as an ordinary place.","Qiao Nian looked very young. She was wearing a baseball cap and her face could not be seen as she had her head lowered looking at her cell phone as she entered. She looked like a ‘tourist’ who had taken the wrong path.","It seemed this was not the first time the waitress had dealt with such a situation. Her tone was polite as she said, “If you go out from here, there are many restaurants at the end of the left-hand side. There’s roast duck, supper, all sorts of cuisine. You can take two more steps...”","She spoke politely and did not say anything like ‘you can’t afford it’.","However, her performance from the beginning to the end still caused discomfort.","Qiao Nian did not notice her expression. She had just found Ye Lan on her contact list when she noticed someone was talking to her.","She looked up and said good-naturedly, “My elders have reserved a table.”","Only now did the waitress look her straight in the eye. She did not sound convinced. “Alright. May I know the name of your elder?”","She was still blocking Qiao Nian, not letting her enter.","They were on high alert and did not give anyone a chance to slip in.","“Her surname is Ye.”","The girl’s voice was casual, as if she did not realize the other party was making things difficult for her.","The waitress was a little surprised. “Ye?”","There were many people with the surname Ye in Beijing, but only one guest with the surname Ye had booked a room at their private restaurant today!","She remembered it very clearly.","Due to the arrival of this esteemed guest, the lady boss, who had not cooked for a long time, flew back from overseas. She did not make any travel plans and specially prepared the ingredients early.","Although the waitress didn’t know the other party’s identity, based on the lady boss’s reaction, she could roughly guess the guests’ identities.","Therefore, when Qiao Nian said ‘Ye’, she couldn’t help but size up the girl in front of her.","She was quite pretty.","It was undeniable that she had some capital.","But that customer was not a man. She was a woman in her fifties!","“Forget it, I’ll call her.” Seeing the waitress was unwilling to move aside, Qiao Nian couldn’t be bothered to make a fuss and called Ye Lan.","The call was picked up after two rings.","“Nian Nian?”","“Aunt Ye, I’m here.”","Qiao Nian glanced at the waitress staring at her suspiciously and pursed her lips. “I’m outside. Please come pick me up.”","“Okay.”","Ye Lan did not ask why she did not come in directly.","She hung up and said to the other person in the private room, “Dad, Nian Nian is here. She doesn’t know the place. I’ll go out and pick her up.”","This was the largest room in the private restaurant. Usually, the boss wouldn’t let anyone use it. Only a few esteemed people could use this private room.","Old Master Ye had known the boss here for more than 20 years.","Their families had been acquainted since the older generation. After the boss of the older generation passed on, his son and daughter-in-law took over this private restaurant, and Old Master Ye often came to patronize.","Every time he came, the boss would specially come over to exchange a few pleasantries.","This time was no exception.","The boss of the private restaurant happened to be talking to Old Master Ye at this moment.","He was a smart person. Every time he talked to Old Master Ye, he would talk about interesting things from the past and recall Old Master Ye’s young appearance.","Old Master Ye was also happy to give face to his old friend’s son. He knew the other party was trying to curry favor with him, but he was still willing to humor him and not let the atmosphere turn cold."]},{"number":3340,"title":"Chapter 3340: Old Master Ye Is Angry","paragraphs":["Chapter 3340: Old Master Ye Is Angry","Editor: Atlas Studios","Initially, the atmosphere in the private room was harmonious. The boss also took the opportunity to get to know a few more people around Old Master Ye. They were all people he usually could not come into contact with.","However, as Ye Lan stood up and said this...","He felt that the atmosphere in the private room had turned colder.","Ye Maoshan nodded at Ye Lan. “Go quickly. Don’t let Nian Nian stand outside for too long.”","“Okay.” Ye Lan got up and left in a hurry.","Old Master Ye stared at the boss ambiguously for a second before saying meaningfully, “Looks like it’s getting harder and harder to eat here!”","The boss was sweating profusely. He was numb as he explained, “It’s a misunderstanding. It must be a misunderstanding. Perhaps the new waiter is insensible and doesn’t know the guests.”","Old Master Ye was usually an easy person to get along with. Although his status was clear, he rarely put on airs. He was also easy to talk to and especially took care of old acquaintances.","However, this time, there was no smile on his face. He only said indifferently, “That’s true. My granddaughter-in-law rarely comes out to eat. It’s normal for her to be stopped outside.”","Even a fool could hear tell he was dissatisfied. He wiped the sweat off his face and immediately said, “I’ll go pick her up personally.”","Ye Maoshan only sipped his tea, neither agreeing nor disagreeing.","The boss could only stand there, not daring to move. He felt uneasy. He peeked at the old man’s face a few times but could not decipher anything.","They stayed this way until footsteps and Ye Lan’s voice outside.","Ye Maoshan slowly put down his teacup and looked at the boss. “Since they’re already here, I won’t trouble you.”","“It’s no trouble at all.” The boss said, but with some grievance in his heart.","He could already hear the slight coldness in Old Master Ye’s tone. His attitude was completely different from just now.","It wasn’t easy for him to get close to the people in this circle. The boss thought for a moment before saying, “I’ve recently come up with a new dish, the Eight Treasures Roasted Duck. It tastes pretty good. Old Master, do you want to try it? Take it as an apology to Young Master Ye’s girlfriend.”","You want to apologize with a single serving of roast duck?","If he himself had encountered such a scenario today, Old Master Ye might not have taken it to heart. However, this time, it involved Qiao Nian. He felt uncomfortable.","“No need.” Therefore, he rejected the boss’s apology almost without thinking and did not want to talk to him anymore. “Go greet the other guests. Don’t worry about an old man like me.”","“...”","This time, the boss could only suffer in silence.","However, Old Master Ye had already expressed his unwillingness to reminisce with him. The boss was too embarrassed to stay in the private room and could only say bitterly, “Alright, Elder Ye. Take your time eating. I won’t disturb you anymore.”","This time, Old Master Ye did not even respond.","He was very vengeful.","The boss bumped into the girl and Ye Lan when he came out.","The girl looked young, and she mainly listened to Ye Lan speak.","Young Master Ye was nowhere in sight.","The boss secretly stole a few glances at the girl. She looked nonchalant, and he couldn’t tell what was going on.","However, he could see Ye Lan’s warm and loving attitude towards the girl.","The boss knew that Young Master Ye had a little girlfriend in Rao City, and she was the lost granddaughter of the Jiang Family, but... no one told him that the Ye family valued this rural girl so much!","The boss was extremely regretful now. He was depressed about not mentioning it to the waitress outside so she wouldn’t have offended them."]},{"number":3341,"title":"Chapter 3341: He’s Going to Park, Coming Over Immediately","paragraphs":["Chapter 3341: He’s Going to Park, Coming Over Immediately","Editor: Atlas Studios","“Nian Nian, come and sit beside me.”","Qiao Nian entered the private room after Ye Lan.","The moment Old Master Ye saw her, he restrained his unhappiness and greeted her with a smile. “Come quickly. I’ve reserved a seat for you.”","Several relatives of the Ye family were present today.","Ye Keji, Ye Shan, and some other relatives sat in their respective seats.","They sized up Qiao Nian as soon as the girl entered.","Ye Keji and Qiao Nian somewhat knew each other, so he greeted her with a smile like Old Master Ye. “Miss Qiao, you’re finally here.”","Ye Shan had suffered a lot at the girl’s hands. Her eyes flickered and she pretended to lower her head to drink water without greeting her, but she did not dare to find fault with her.","The one with the biggest reaction was the famous little devil in the family.","Ever since Ye Qichen followed Ye Lan to the private room, he had been playing with his iPad in his seat, ignoring everyone.","As soon as Qiao Nian entered, he immediately put down his iPad. His big black eyes flickered as he looked at the girl and called out obediently, “Sister.”","Qiao Nian walked to Old Master Ye’s side, sat down, and handed Ye Qichen the game disc she had brought back from Continent M. “A gift.”","Ye Qichen hugged the game disc and his eyes curved into crescents, overjoyed. “Thank you, Sister.”","His voice was crisp and clear.","The relatives unfamiliar with Qiao Nian were so shocked that their eyeballs almost fell out.","They knew what kind of person Ye Qichen was.","One of the most difficult people to get along with in the family was Young Master Ye, who had a bright future ahead of him, and the other was Little Young Master, who was born with a congenital deficiency and a little disability...","To them, it was unbelievable that Ye Qichen could be so obedient.","However, Old Master Ye and Ye Lan were used to it. Ye Lan even stroked the little fellow’s hair and said to Qiao Nian, “Ever since you found him a teacher, Chen Chen’s grades have been improving rapidly. Only you can manage him.”","Qiao Nian replied naturally, “I’ve been too busy recently to ask him about it. So all of this is mainly because he’s obedient.”","The corners of Ye Lan’s mouth twitched at the “praise”. She almost revealed the little guy’s true colors.","However, seeing how obediently the little tyrant was sitting next to Qiao Nian, her heart softened. Her words automatically changed to, “Yes, Chen Chen rarely makes me worry.”","Ye Qichen said obediently, “Sister, I’ll listen to Grandma.”","Old Master Ye looked at the youngest and clicked his tongue. He did not say anything and looked up at the girl. “Where’s Wangchuan? Why didn’t he come in with you?”","His mind was still on Qiao Nian being stopped outside. At the mention of Ye Wangchuan, he turned angry. “This young brat can’t even pick up someone!”","Qiao Nian felt the gazes on her and leaned back in her chair. She wanted to relax, but she felt that it was better to restrain herself in front of outsiders.","Sitting up a little straighter, she pulled down her baseball cap in frustration and lowered her dark eyelashes, then said very politely, “He’s parking the car. He’ll be here soon.”","She didn’t know if it was a coincidence, but someone entered the private room as soon as she finished speaking.","Who else could it be but Ye Wangchuan?","He entered the room and greeted everyone before walking towards the only empty seat."]},{"number":3342,"title":"Chapter 3342: Bullying Chen Chen Again","paragraphs":["Chapter 3342: Bullying Chen Chen Again","Editor: Atlas Studios","On Qiao Nian’s left was Old Master Ye, and on her right was Ye Qichen, who had already reserved a seat. The only seat left was beside Ye Lan.","Ye Qichen stared at him vigilantly the moment he entered. He even secretly grabbed the table’s edge, afraid his uncle would shamelessly snatch his seat.","Fortunately, Ye Wangchuan simply glanced at him. He consciously pulled out the chair beside Ye Lan and sat down. His lips even curled into a beautiful smile as he glanced at Ye Qichen, who had relaxed, and asked lazily, “Did you receive the gift?”","Ye Qichen tightly hugged the game disc that Qiao Nian had given him and pursed his lips.","Ye Wangchuan placed the car keys on the table and raised his eyebrows with a smile when he saw his reaction. “I was with your Sister when she bought it.”","Killing people’s hearts!","Ye Qichen’s expression almost crumbled. After looking at him for a moment, he turned around and said to his grandmother in a muffled voice, “I’m going to get my hair cut.”","He did not want his uncle anymore!","He wanted to murder his uncle.","Ye Lan did not understand what he meant by getting his hair cut on the second day of the first lunar month. She touched his head and coaxed him. “Why do you suddenly want to get your hair cut? Your hair isn’t long.”","“I’m going anyway.” Ye Qichen was depressed.","Qiao Nian could tell he was moody. She glanced in a certain person’s direction and said disapprovingly, “Why are you bullying a child?”","Ye Qichen’s eyes turned red and he almost burst into tears.","However, before he could put on a show for his uncle, he heard his uncle’s cold voice remind him, “We’ll still be in Beijing for a few days. If you want to come to Rhine to play, think about it before crying.”","Devil!","Ye Qichen puffed up his cheeks and glared at him.","Ye Wangchuan returned his gaze casually as if saying, ‘Go on.’","Ye Qichen expressionlessly looked away. His red eyes were about to tear up.","He still wanted to play with his Sister. He definitely could not offend his uncle. Otherwise, with his bad character, it was very likely that he would lock him outside and not let him in.","He thought so in his heart, but he clenched his fists and made up his mind. This year, on the second day of the first lunar month, he must go and get his hair cut.","A buzz cut!","He had to deal with a little bald head!","“Ahem.” At this moment, Old Master Ye coughed and broke the stalemate. He turned to the others and said, “It’s almost time for the dishes to be served.”","“I’ll get them,” Ye Lan said.","She pressed the bell.","After a while, a waiter entered with the tray and filled the table with the dishes.","“Put this there.” Ye Wangchuan saw the spicy chicken that Old Master Ye had ordered and instructed the waiter to place it in front of Qiao Nian.","Old Master Ye glanced at his grandson with a faint smile and said to the waiter, “Yes, put it close to Nian Nian. She likes it.”","Qiao Nian once again felt all the gazes on her. They were probing and sizing her up, wishing they could pierce through her.","She wasn’t used to such family-style gatherings.","However, she still sat there politely. She waited for Old Master Ye to start eating before she picked up her chopsticks and focused on eating.","She did not talk much.","Even if the other Ye family relatives were curious, they couldn’t find a topic to talk with her about. However, their gazes were all on Qiao Nian.","Finally, someone broke the stalemate. “This is... Wangchuan’s girlfriend? She looks quite pretty. Why didn’t you bring her to meet us before?”","Ye Wangchuan played with a cup and his expression became playful."]},{"number":3343,"title":"Chapter 3343: The Ye Family Can Have No Grandchildren and Only Acknowledge This Granddaughter-in-law in the Future","paragraphs":["Chapter 3343: The Ye Family Can Have No Grandchildren and Only Acknowledge This Granddaughter-in-law in the Future","Editor: Atlas Studios","Ye Keji was quite perceptive and responded. “Miss Qiao is very busy and only occasionally stays in Beijing. She has also been to the old residence before. Perhaps you didn’t meet because you weren’t around.”","This time, Old Master Ye called over some of the main relatives and elders in the family.","They weren’t considered to be involved in the family’s business. However, given their seniority or blood relationship, Ye Maoshan felt that since Nian Nian was back, they should at least eat together.","After Ye Keji finished speaking, he took over and said heartily, “Yes, Nian Nian has come to the house several times. It’s just that she’s been busy recently. Since she has time now, I invited her out for a meal.”","The third aunt glanced at the girl eating with her head lowered. She looked restrained, but one could also see the indifference in her bones. She did not look like a socialite in their circle.","She subconsciously frowned. “I see. If she’s not in Beijing, where is she? I heard she came from Rao City? Has she been in Rao City recently?”","Not only did Old Master Ye’s smile fade, but even Ye Wangchuan, who had never bickered with her, put down his chopsticks. He glanced at the middle-aged woman and said calmly, “Are you very concerned about my girlfriend?”","The third aunt’s heart skipped a beat, and she looked embarrassed. “It... it was just a casual question. I don’t mean to make things difficult for you.”","“You can’t make things difficult for me.” Ye Wangchuan was still smiling, but the smile did not reach his eyes.","The atmosphere turned cold.","Ye Shan looked at the middle-aged woman with a red face and thick neck as if she was watching a show. She was very smart this time and did not get involved.","Previously, she had just said a few words before being chased out of Continent F’s business by Ye Wangchuan.","She wouldn’t be that stupid this time.","Seeing that no one was helping her out, the third aunt couldn’t sit still and looked at Old Master Ye for help. “Old Master, you know that I didn’t do it on purpose...”","Before she could finish her sentence, Ye Maoshan interrupted her with the same rudeness. “Oh, I don’t know. I thought you looked down on my granddaughter-in-law!”","The third aunt’s face turned green.","“No, I don’t... a granddaughter-in-law that you’ve already set your mind on. Why would I have any objections?”","“That’s right. Nian Nian is the person I’ve set my mind on.”","Old Master Ye’s eyes were sharp. Following her words, he looked around the table and used this opportunity to intimidate the rest of the family. “My attitude is clear. The Ye family can have no grandchildren, but there will only be this granddaughter-in-law in the future.”","The Ye family could have no grandchildren... but there would only be this granddaughter-in-law in the future!","These words carried a lot of weight!","Ye Wangchuan frowned and rubbed his swollen temples with his slender fingers as he looked at Old Master Ye helplessly. “... Do you want to reconsider?”","He suspected that he had been brought back home from the trash can.","Unexpectedly, Old Master Ye glared at him. “You’re a freeloader, don’t speak!”","“Alright.” Ye Wangchuan chuckled and very naturally admitted it.","The other family members looked at each other and saw the surprise in each other’s eyes.","Although they were not as clear as Old Master Ye about Ye Wangchuan’s identity and how many forces and businesses he had, they could more or less sense it.","Ye Wangchuan was a freeloader?","Then this girl...","They looked at Qiao Nian differently.","The girl had just finished eating her food in her bowl and couldn’t help but sigh. She had not stopped once since she started eating.","Looking up, she ignored the others and said to Old Master Ye, “I’ve already resolved Master Cheng’s matter. I’ve also brought back the person who injured him.”"]},{"number":3344,"title":"Chapter 3344: Finally See That Sister Nian Is Not an Ordinary Person","paragraphs":["Chapter 3344: Finally See That Sister Nian Is Not an Ordinary Person","Editor: Atlas Studios","“You found him?” Ye Maoshan looked surprised.","Qiao Nian put down her chopsticks and lost her appetite. She leaned back and said, “Yes, I wanted to tell you earlier, but I forgot about it after changing my clothes and resting. He’s at the Beijing police station. I handed him over to Deputy Captain Luo.”","“You mean...” Ye Maoshan wasn’t a fool. He immediately realized what Qiao Nian wanted to do.","Qiao Nian pulled down her baseball cap, uninterested. “I’ll go through legal procedures.”","Ye Maoshan appeared to be deep in thought.","Qiao Nian continued, “Master Cheng won first place in the weapons exhibition with his own ability. I don’t want these matters to taint his accomplishment. So... it’s best to go through legal procedures and deal with it according to the law. With what he did, even if he goes through legal procedures, it’s enough to hold him responsible!”","Of course, they could deal with Zhou Zheng in private.","However, some people were trolls. If they dealt with Zhou Zheng in private, it was inevitable that gossip would spread. At that time, some people would question Master Cheng’s accomplishment.","Qiao Nian did not want the older generation’s hard-won results to be stained by any other distractions, so she brought Zhou Zheng back with Ye Wangchuan.","Since he was in Beijing, it was more appropriate for Old Master Ye to deal with him.","Ye Maoshan understood her thoughts and felt that Qiao Nian’s arrangement was very suitable. He nodded. “Alright, I’ll tell the Bo family later.”","He also specifically said, “I’ll also speed up the procedures.”","“Mm.”","Since Qiao Nian mentioned Master Cheng, Ye Maoshan asked, “How’s Master Cheng’s health?”","“I asked Elder Zhong to come over,” Qiao Nian said calmly. “It’s not a big problem with him around.”","At this moment, Ye Keji interrupted, “Miss Qiao, are you talking about Zhong Yiliu from the Pharmacy Association?”","Qiao Nian looked up at him, her clear eyes not hiding anything. “Yes, that’s him.”","Ye Keji shut his mouth.","He gave Qiao Nian a thumbs up in his heart.","Amazing!","After Old Master Ye and Ye Lan, he knew Qiao Nian the best among the family relatives. Yet, every time he met Qiao Nian, he still felt that he knew too little.","Zhong Yiliu... was famous for not giving others face.","This person had a temper similar to Mr. Huang’s.","One of them was Miss Qiao’s teacher, and the other was Miss Qiao’s close friend. In other words... it was quite unbelievable.","The other family members, including the third aunt, were speechless.","All of them shut their mouths.","No matter how stupid they were, they could tell that Qiao Nian was not as simple as she looked. At the very least, she wasn’t an ordinary person from Rao City.","The rest of the meal went smoothly.","Although the Ye family’s relatives couldn’t find any topic to talk about with Qiao Nian, they were smart enough not to mention Rao City and did not dare to find fault with her.","Two hours later.","The meal was finally over.","It was almost 10 PM.","It was currently autumn, and the night was a little cold, especially when the wind blew.","Qiao Nian had just walked out when a warm coat was draped over her shoulders. She turned around and saw a certain someone’s handsome face.","“I brought it especially for you.”","She looked down at the jacket. She remembered him going back to his room to get something before they left. So it was for her...","Qiao Nian’s heart warmed, and the frustration that had accompanied her the entire night dissipated."]},{"number":3345,"title":"Chapter 3345: Zhou Zheng Was Sentenced to 20 Years In Prison","paragraphs":["Chapter 3345: Zhou Zheng Was Sentenced to 20 Years In Prison","Editor: Atlas Studios","With Old Master Ye watching, Zhou Zheng’s sentence was passed extremely fast.","After a trial, Zhou Zheng was sentenced to 20 years and three months in prison for assault and attempted murder.","The Zhou family flew over from Country M to attend the trial. They hired a famous lawyer from overseas for him and spent a lot of money to win the lawsuit.","Therefore, when the results of the trial came out, not only did Mother Zhou faint on the spot, but Zhou Zheng also expressed his dissatisfaction and wanted to appeal.","...","The weather in Beijing was pleasant in September.","Qiao Nian received Nie Mi’s message early in the morning and met him at a drinking joint outside Qing University.","Nie Mi wanted to ask her about the new song.","Wen Ruxia looked for Nie Mi to ask Qiao Nian for a new song for the show.","Nie Mi was entrusted by someone this time.","Coincidentally, Qiao Nian had to stay in Beijing for some time. She would return to the independent continent after the dust settled. Hence, she agreed.","Nie Mi’s cell phone rang as he was discussing how much time it would take. The school asked him to go back and discuss the school celebration.","This time, the traditional music department would also participate in the school anniversary event. Nie Mi had always been carefree. In order to get more young people to accept traditional music, he, an internationally renowned master, did not put on any airs and personally guided the students in this performance.","Therefore, Nie Mi bade farewell to Qiao Nian and rushed back to the school.","They weren’t far from Qing University, on the opposite road. Many students came here to grab a snack and chat on the weekends.","Qiao Nian watched as Nie Mi left and got up to pay the bill.","Unexpectedly, a flashy sports car stopped by the roadside at this moment. Right on the heels of that, a flamboyant and handsome man got out of the car and headed straight for her.","“Sister Qiao, I was thinking it looked like you!”","The color of his sports car was flashy!","His loud voice also attracted everyone’s attention.","They looked at them in unison.","Qiao Nian frowned and pulled down the brim of her cap to cover her face, trying to pretend not to know him.","Unfortunately, Qin Si did not realize how ostentatious he was. Seeing that the girl did not seem to recognize him, he quickly walked over and did not forget to wave his hand. “Sister Qiao, what are you doing? Why are you covering your face? I already saw you.”","Qin Si dragged out the chair opposite Qiao Nian and sat down. He raised his peach blossom eyes and glanced at the shop assistant at the side, as if he did not notice the gossipy gazes on him.","He smiled and said, “Please give me a latte without sugar.”","The sales girl’s face instantly turned red. She hugged her tray and ran away. “Okay, okay.”","Qiao Nian’s head hurt. Since she couldn’t avoid it, she might as well face him. “Are you usually like this in front of Guan Yan?”","“Ahem.” Qin Si almost choked on his own saliva. His shoulders stiffened and he looked at her in disbelief. “Sister Qiao, are you going to complain?”","His accusing eyes said, “How could you be so heartless?”","Qiao Nian’s head hurt even more. She rubbed her temples and leaned against the back of the chair, speechless. “Since you don’t want Guan Yan to know, can’t you restrain yourself?”","“What a joke.” Qin Si looked bitter. “Sister Qiao, you actually think she cares?”","He smiled bitterly and said, “She hasn’t contacted me for half a month. I didn’t reply to her messages either. Do you think she cares who I wink at?”"]},{"number":3346,"title":"Chapter 3346: News About Guan Yan","paragraphs":["Chapter 3346: News About Guan Yan","Editor: Atlas Studios","He wanted to wink at that woman, but every time, it was like winking at a blind person.","That woman was even more of a flirt than him!","All these years, Qin Si had thought about what kind of woman he would like in the future. Before he met Guan Yan in the illegal district, he felt that he might find an obedient and sensible socialite and spend the rest of his life with her, just like most people in Beijing...","Until he met the person he was destined to meet.","He realized that he had fallen into the hands of the Cupid!","The shop assistant happened to bring his coffee and placed it in front of Qin Si with a red face, stealing a glance at the handsome man.","Qin Si only said politely, “Thank you.”","The shop assistant was disappointed but was too embarrassed to stay. She took the tray and left.","Qin Si picked up the cup and took a sip of the coffee. It was so-so. It was definitely incomparable to what he had back home, but it could still be drunk.","He took a small sip and suppressed the sourness in his chest. After adjusting his emotions, he returned to his usual self and looked at the girl. “By the way, Sister Qiao, after Zhou Zheng’s sentence was passed, the Zhou family has been jumping around a lot these few days. I heard they even went to the Ninth Branch to cause trouble and said they wanted to see the person in charge to discuss the Ninth Branch’s funding...”","Wasn’t the person in charge of the Ninth Branch Master Wang?","Towards the end, Qin Si’s tone was mixed with mockery. It could be seen how much of a joke the Zhou family was being.","He took another sip of the coffee and slowly put down the cup with a smile. “Do they think Master Wang lacks money?”","Fund the Ninth Branch?","To think they thought of such a thing!","Qin Si imagined that Ye Wangchuan would ignore those people.","Unexpectedly, Qiao Nian glanced at him in surprise. “He asked for a billion yuan.”","Qin Si was suddenly slapped in the face. The coffee was no longer fragrant, and his expression turned complicated. “Master Wang met them? He couldn’t have...”","Would Master Wang let Zhou Zheng off for a billion yuan?","Qiao Nian understood Ye Wangchuan’s thoughts better than him. She pursed her lips and took a slow sip of her drink. “Zhou Zheng has yet to settle his civil compensation.”","What Ye Wangchuan wanted was the civil compensation portion. However, the Zhou family mistakenly thought this money was for a private settlement and was busy gathering it.","This was Beijing.","Once the money was in their hands, it would be difficult for the Zhou family to get it back.","What Ye Wangchuan wanted was for them to compensate both civilly and criminally.","Otherwise, when Zhou Zheng’s sentence was finalized, the Zhou family would definitely not be willing to spend another cent when they realized they were powerless.","Wouldn’t that be letting them off easy?","“Civil compensation...” Qin Si repeated silently. His mind turned and he realized what Ye Wangchuan wanted to do.","His expression instantly became complicated. He smacked his lips and expressed deep sympathy for the Zhou family. “Master Wang is still the dog!”","This was what it meant to kill someone!","He could imagine that when the second verdict was out, the Zhou family would probably want to die when they realized that they had been played.","Qin Si regained his senses and looked at Qiao Nian with admiration. “Sister Qiao, you know Master Wang the best.”","He hadn’t thought of this.","Qiao Nian said, “Not really.”","Her cell phone on the table lit up.","Qiao Nian picked it up and swiped the screen with her fair fingers to see a new message from Guan Yan.","[Guan Yan: Sun, Ji Lingfeng has indeed returned to the Ji family. However, after returning, he used the excuse of recuperating and refused to see anyone. Many people in the family have been thinking of ways to gather information while he’s not doing anything yet. For the time being, they haven’t found out how he wants to deal with the family’s mess.]"]},{"number":3347,"title":"Chapter 3347: They All Came to Qing University Today?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3347: They All Came to Qing University Today?","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian had just finished reading the message.","Qin Si leaned forward. “Who is it?”","Seeing the familiar profile picture from the corner of his eye, he immediately shrank back. His heart spasmed as he recalled his unread messages and looked at the girl unhurriedly replying. He instantly felt upset.","“She’s been talking to you these days?”","Qiao Nian had just finished replying to the message. Hearing this, she looked up and paused for half a second before understanding who he was talking about. She smiled frankly. “No. There’s a problem with a batch of goods in Continent F. She’s been chasing after it recently. She just went to the independent continent yesterday to help me keep an eye on some people.”","Qin Si’s tightened heart relaxed. At least he did not feel so uncomfortable anymore.","However, he caught the main point of Qiao Nian’s words. “Is the batch of goods she’s chasing very dangerous?”","“I guess so.”","Continent F’s business was all about blood. There was nothing that was not dangerous.","Qiao Nian’s concept of danger was different from ordinary people.","If she said she “guessed” it was dangerous, then it was very dangerous.","Qin Si frowned. He wasn’t in the mood to reply to messages. He pursed his thin lips and his expression turned ugly.","He gripped his cell phone tightly as if wondering if he should send a message to a certain someone.","At this moment, his cell phone vibrated.","It was a new message from Guan Yan.","Since he was with Qiao Nian, he knew she had just finished her work and immediately replied to him. He clicked on it impatiently.","[Guan Yan: Are you using my WeChat as a notebook?]","Qin Si looked at the few words and felt like he was looking at her beautiful eyes. She was always cynical.","He didn’t notice the corners of his lips curl up as he typed a reply: [Are you done with your work?]","Guan Yan was still typing.","After two minutes, she replied with a simple ‘yes’.","Qin Si was in a good mood, and the air became fresh and comfortable.","Qiao Nian looked at him playing with his cell phone and rubbed her eyebrows. She looked at the time on her phone and called the waiter to pay the bill.","She was about to tell Qin Si that she was leaving when a call came in.","Qiao Nian picked it up.","Before she could speak, Ye Wangchuan’s noble and lazy voice came from the other end of the call. “Are you with Qin Si?”","How did he know?","Qiao Nian immediately looked around and saw a familiar black Phaeton on the other side of the road.","“Why are you here?”","“I was nearby doing something. I happened to pass by and saw you.”","The corners of Qiao Nian’s mouth twitched. She said ambiguously, “... It’s indeed a coincidence.”","She had been at Qing University for less than two hours. First, Qin Si passed by and saw her, and then he passed by...","“Come over, I’ll take you to lunch.”","Qiao Nian saw the Phaeton window open, revealing the man’s outstanding face. Just by looking at his face, she felt it was a very expensive experience.","She picked up her bag and said to Qin Si, “I’m leaving.”","Qin Si was still texting Guan Yan. He didn’t even look up as he said absentmindedly, “Ah, why are you leaving so soon? Sit for a while more.”","“Take your time.”","Qiao Nian did not say much and turned to leave.","At this moment, a fair-skinned boy blocked her way.","The boy’s face was a little red and his eyes were darting around. He looked quite nervous and didn’t dare to look at her as he stammered, “A-Are you Senior Qiao?”","Qiao Nian did not like being blocked, but seeing that the other party did not have any ill intentions, she patiently said, “Yes?”"]},{"number":3348,"title":"Chapter 3348: Master Wu: Why Don’t You Add Me to WeChat?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3348: Master Wu: Why Don’t You Add Me to WeChat?","Editor: Atlas Studios","The boy seemed a little excited. “Sure enough, you are Sister Qiao Nian! I just heard you talking and thought it was you.”","Qiao Nian did not know what he meant by blocking her. She pursed her lower lip and asked seriously, “Is something wrong?”","“N-No.” The boy’s face was faintly red again. He scratched his head embarrassedly and said, “I’m also a student of the Medical Faculty. I have read many posts about you in the school forum, and I have always admired you. It’s just that you’ve been off school since last year, and this is the first time I’ve run into you around school. So... can I add you on WeChat?”","Afraid of Qiao Nian’s refusal, he said: “I don’t mean anything else, it’s just that I was wondering if I could consult you on WeChat if I encounter some problems I’m unsure about.”","This reason was reasonable and favorable.","Although the boy was embarrassed, he was still quite confident about getting her WeChat contact.","He was a freshman and had long heard about the school legend—Qiao Nian from the Chinese Medicine Faculty.","Not only was she the school belle, but she had also won all kinds of awards.","Any boy would have some thoughts about the dazzling girls in school. He was the bold and thick-skinned type.","This time, he definitely wanted to add Qiao Nian on WeChat.","As long as he did, he would have plenty of ways to close the distance.","“Senior, this is my QR code. You can scan it.” He took the opportunity to take out his WeChat business card and handed it to the girl.","Qiao Nian glanced at it and looked back at him. “I’m afraid...”","She was about to say “I’m afraid I don’t have the time to respond to you” when a hand materialized on her shoulder from behind. Then, a familiar cold fragrance assaulted her and Ye Wangchuan’s lazy voice sounded from behind. “She has a boyfriend.”","Qiao Nian didn’t need to turn around to know who it was.","Qin Si finally finished replying. Just as he was about to say that he heard a familiar voice, he looked up and saw Master Wang ruthlessly crushing the young man’s heart.","“If you have any questions, you can ask me. Do you want to add me on WeChat?” Ye Wangchuan’s voice was hoarse with a hint of coldness and warning.","As expected, the fair-skinned boy shrank his neck, and his slightly red face stiffened. He immediately shook his head. “No, there’s no need.”","A little suffocated by the pressure, he retreated, not even daring to look at Qiao Nian again.","He hurriedly said, “Since Senior Qiao doesn’t have time, I won’t disturb you. My classmates are over there. I’ll go back to them.”","He slipped away quickly after saying that, afraid that Ye Wangchuan would really add him on WeChat.","Qin Si witnessed the entire process and watched as the boy was sent away by Master Wang in two sentences. He ran back to his classmates’ table dejectedly.","Seeing that he had instantly killed his love rival, Master Wang lowered his head and gently asked the girl, “Are you cold?”","Qiao Nian shook her head. “It’s alright.”","He took off his jacket and carefully placed it over her shoulders, then said, “Let’s go back to the car first.”","Qiao Nian had no objections and left with him.","Qin Si turned around and looked at the expression of the boy who wanted to strike up a conversation with Sister Qiao.","As expected, the boy’s face turned green. His expression was as if he had lost his parents. It was obvious that he had been dealt a heavy blow. He wouldn’t be able to recover for at least half a year.","Tsk, how tragic.","Qin Si chuckled and wanted to give a thumbs up to a certain someone who had walked far away—Master Wang was really a heartbreaker!"]},{"number":3349,"title":"Chapter 3349: Sorry, You Found the Wrong Person","paragraphs":["Chapter 3349: Sorry, You Found the Wrong Person","Editor: Atlas Studios","On the other side.","Qiao Nian opened the passenger door and got into the car calmly. After fastening her seatbelt, she returned the jacket to him. “The car has a heater, there’s no need for this.”","“Just leave it there.” Ye Wangchuan also got into the car from the other side and pointed at a spot.","Qiao Nian placed the jacket down where he pointed and leaned lazily against the seat with her eyes closed. There were faint bruise marks under her eyelids.","Her eyelashes were long. Usually, when she lowered her eyelashes, it was difficult for others to notice the fatigue under her eyelids. Only when she relaxed and was as unguarded as now could the faint marks be seen.","Ye Wangchuan subconsciously adjusted the heater to a comfortable temperature. Then, he closed the car window to block out the outside noise and asked her in a low voice, “You haven’t rested well these past few days?”","“Yes.” Qiao Nian’s eyes were still closed. She pursed her red lips and said hoarsely, “The Zhou Zheng’s matter hasn’t been closed yet. I can’t sleep well.”","Ye Wangchuan’s eyes were filled with heartache. Not in the mood to mention the boy who had hit on her just now, his jaw tensed as he put his jacket over her again and comforted her softly. “What are you worried about? Nothing will happen with the Old Master around.”","With Old Master Ye’s status, no one would dare to offend him even if the Zhou family spent money to pull strings.","Furthermore, this case involved Master Cheng and the Ninth Branch. Anyone who knew a little about the situation knew how deep the waters were.","Only a brainless person would get involved in this mess.","Therefore, Zhou Zheng’s verdict was unlikely to be reversed.","Qiao Nian nodded. It was unknown if she had heard him.","Ye Wangchuan noticed she looked tired and sleepy. Not wanting her to get more tired, he did not continue on the topic. Instead, he started the car and asked her, “Where are you going later? Are you going back?”","Qiao Nian opened her eyes. “Rhine.”","Then, she pressed her forehead upon remembering the promise she just made. She turned to him and said, “I still have to go back and write a song.”","It had been a long time since she touched music.","Although she had promised Nie Mi that she would help write a new song, if she really wanted to do it, she would have to find inspiration first. Otherwise, there was really no way to write it.","“Yes.” Ye Wangchuan turned the steering wheel and drove home. His thin lips curled up slightly and he said, “I’ll make you hotpot tonight.”","The corners of Qiao Nian’s eyes went up. She was finally a little interested. Then, she pressed down on her baseball cap, relaxed, and slumped in the front passenger seat.","**","After Zhou Zheng’s verdict, not only did the Zhou family look for Ye Wangchuan to discuss the terms of a private settlement, but they also found out an important piece of information from others.","They rushed to Rao City overnight.","Then, early the next morning, they knocked on the door of an ordinary residential building in Rao City.","“Who is it?” someone responded.","Mr. Zhou tried to look amiable and hypocritically squeezed out a smile.","The rusty iron door opened, and a middle-aged woman’s face peeked out.","The middle-aged woman looked very simple wearing a knitted sweater. Seeing so many people standing at her door, she frowned, a little surprised and vigilant. “Who are you looking for?”","“Are you Aunt Chen?” Mr. Zhou’s expression became even warmer. He did not mind the middle-aged woman’s poor appearance and reached out for a handshake.","Aunt Chen immediately shook her head and tried to close the door. “I’m sorry, you’ve found the wrong person.”"]},{"number":3350,"title":"Chapter 3350: What Do You Have to Say?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3350: What Do You Have to Say?","Editor: Atlas Studios","‘Aunt Chen’ was Nian Nian’s favorite form of address. These people were dressed in expensive suits and leather shoes. The moment they arrived, they asked if she was Aunt Chen. It was obvious they were here for Nian Nian.","Although she hadn’t seen much of the world, Aunt Chen knew not to cause trouble for Nian Nian.","However, before she could close the door, Mr. Zhou anxiously tore off his hypocritical mask and stuck a hand in the gap between the door and the doorframe. “Wait! I have something to tell you.”","This way, if Aunt Chen wanted to close the door, she would have to hurt his hand. This was not something someone like Aunt Chen could do.","She frowned and looked at Mr. Zhou, who was unwilling to give up. She could only say good-naturedly, “I’m just an ordinary vendor selling noodles. I can’t help you with anything.”","“You can, you can help.” Father Zhou had finally found this place after much difficulty. How could he let her escape? He turned around and gave the people behind him a look.","Madam Zhou immediately walked forward, wiped her tears, and said, “Auntie, we had no choice but to disturb you. Please help us!”","Seeing they wouldn’t leave without achieving their goal, Aunt Chen stepped aside and let them in. “Come in.”","This was an old-fashioned neighborhood. There was no elevator.","From time to time, someone would pass by the only staircase.","A neighbor passing by saw this scene and teased Aunt Chen. “Another neighbor from the city? I’m so envious.”","After Aunt Chen let them in, she went to get a cup to make tea. As she did that, she said to the uneasy Mr. and Madam Zhou, “The house is small. You can sit wherever.”","When she said that it was small, it was really small.","In the eyes of Mr. Zhou and the others, the two-bedroom house was similar to their servants’ room. They even saw half a string of spicy hot pot skewers neatly placed on the living room table.","There was nowhere to sit in the small living room.","Aunt Chen came out of the kitchen and realized they were still standing. She pointed at the small stools by the wall and said, “You can sit on that.”","Mr. Zhou looked at the ankle-high wooden stool, and a trace of disgust flashed across his eyes, but since he was here to ask for a favor, he forced himself to take a stool and sit down.","Madam Zhou was dressed in branded clothes and was even more unwilling to sit on the small stool. After hesitating for a moment, it was Mr. Zhou who urged her, “Sit down quickly.”","Madam Zhou frowned and sat down reluctantly.","She sat in the corner, afraid she would dirty her clothes if she touched too much. Her arrogant gaze could not be concealed.","Aunt Chen saw everything but pretended not to. She placed the tea in front of them. “There’s only this kind of tea leaves at home. You guys can make do with it.”","Mr. Zhou took it politely. “Thank you.”","Madam Zhou, on the other hand, could not accept drinking the tea no matter what. She placed the cup beside her as if there was a virus in it. She wouldn’t touch it even if she was beaten to death.","Mr. Zhou ignored her.","When Aunt Chen sat down and continued to pick vegetables, he could not wait to say, “Ahem, Auntie, I’m really sorry to disturb you this time. We brought you some gifts. They’re all nutritional supplements. They’re not expensive, but we hope they’re to your liking. Please accept them.”","Aunt Chen’s hands paused. Not looking at the piled-up gifts, she looked straight at him, sighed, and said, “If you have something to say, just say it.”","“Auntie is a straightforward person.”","Mr. Zhou did not beat around the bush and said in a low voice, “My son is naughty and provoked Miss Qiao. He’s going to be sentenced to jail. I tried looking for Miss Qiao a few times but didn’t see her. I heard you’re very close to her. I wonder if I can trouble you to plead with her on our behalf.”"]},{"number":3351,"title":"Chapter 3351: Threat","paragraphs":["Chapter 3351: Threat","Editor: Atlas Studios","Without letting Aunt Chen refuse, Mr. Zhou dropped his act and said domineeringly, “Don’t worry, I definitely won’t let you help for nothing! We’ll remember this favor for the rest of our lives.”","Madam Zhou was even more direct. “I heard that Auntie’s son is in his second year of university? We can help him a lot when he looks for a job in the future. As long as you help us speak to Qiao Nian, this matter will be easy to handle.”","“I understand.” Aunt Chen put the vegetables back into the basket. “I can’t help you. Take your things back!”","Madam Zhou panicked. “Why can’t you help us?! Just speak to her. It’s not a big deal.”","Aunt Chen shook her head. “I won’t speak to her.”","Madam Zhou was angered. She thought Aunt Chen was deliberately making things difficult for her.","Not waiting for them to speak, Aunt Chen said bluntly, “As for my son’s future job... After he graduates, if he has the ability, he can find a job himself. If he doesn’t, he can set up a stall with me.”","She had never seen the world but had a scale in her heart and could differentiate between good and bad.","In the beginning, it was indeed her who pitied Nian Nian and took care of her when she was young. However, she believed anyone else in her place would have helped the little girl.","She did not want anything in return.","After that, Nian Nian helped her a lot.","Not only did she call the rebellious Chen Yuan back to study, but he also got into a major university.","She even helped treat her husband’s illness.","Their family had received too much favor from Nian Nian.","How could she trouble her for a job opportunity?","“I’m not gonna sell my conscience for his job.”","Aunt Chen said calmly, “I’m not the only one who won’t do this. My son’s not allowed to do this either. Otherwise, I don’t mind disinheriting him.”","“Take your things back.”","This was not the first time she faced someone who wanted to look for Qiao Nian. “If you don’t take it back, I won’t keep it either. At most, I’ll leave it with the guard. If you don’t take it, they’ll treat it as trash in half a month.”","Mr. Zhou did not expect this seemingly inexperienced rural woman to have such magnanimity and bearing. He sized her up, and his smile disappeared. “Then Auntie, you’re saying you won’t help us?”","Aunt Chen wasn’t afraid of him. She shook her head. “I can’t help.”","Mr. Zhou grabbed Madam Zhou, who was about to argue with Aunt Chen, and stood up. He looked down at her and said coldly, “We will come again tomorrow. I hope you will have changed your mind.”","There seemed to be a deeper meaning in his words.","Aunt Chen only said, “You don’t have to come. No matter how many times you come, this will always be my answer. I can’t help you.”","Mr. Zhou couldn’t even maintain his basic expression anymore. He said to the others expressionlessly, “Let’s go.”","“Take your things with you.” Aunt Chen wasn’t angry and called them.","Mr. Zhou walked to the door and gave his assistant a look. The assistant went back and took the gifts.","The group went out in a grandiose manner.","Perhaps because they were angry, they did not control their strength when closing the door and deliberately made a loud noise.","Aunt Chen waited for them to leave before returning to the bedroom.","Leaning against the head of the bed, Uncle Chen asked when she entered, “Have those people left?”","Aunt Chen nodded and tucked him in. “Mm, they’ve just left.”","“I wonder why they’re looking for Nian Nian.” Uncle Chen looked worried. “I don’t think these people are easy to deal with. She must be tired out alone outside.”"]},{"number":3352,"title":"Chapter 3352: Indeed Creating Trouble Behind the Scenes","paragraphs":["Chapter 3352: Indeed Creating Trouble Behind the Scenes","Editor: Atlas Studios","Aunt Chen was also worried. After a moment of silence, she patted his chest and told him to stop talking.","Uncle Chen sighed. Then, he said, “From the way they put it, those people won’t let it go just like that.”","Ever since Qiao Nian went to Beijing, she had become the future granddaughter-in-law of the Ye family.","People often came to Aunt Chen’s place.","She knew what those people were thinking, so she just patted the back of his hand. “Let them be. They’re just making things difficult for us. We’re a small family and don’t have much money. If they want to make things difficult for us, so be it. I won’t let them have their way, let alone trouble Nian Nian for them.”","Uncle Chen thought the same and stopped talking.","**","It was just as Uncle Chen had thought.","In the afternoon, Aunt Chen went to set up her stall and encountered a hooligan causing trouble. First, he scared away all her customers. Later on, a self-proclaimed inspector came over and told her she couldn’t set up a stall here in the future. It was against the rules.","This was not the end.","After Aunt Chen packed her things and went home, she received a call saying that someone had eaten something at her stall in the afternoon and was being treated in the hospital for food poisoning. They asked her to hurry over.","After settling Uncle Chen down, she could only rush to the hospital.","Upon getting there, the patient’s family members pounced on her, crying and beating her. Then, they asked her to pay for the medical fees, insisting that the patient had eaten her spicy and sour noodles and got food poisoning.","The doctor also urged him to pump his stomach.","Aunt Chen had no choice but to pay 20,000 yuan for the medical fees. They even asked her to wait for the gastric lavage operation to end before she was allowed to leave.","Aunt Chen was in a hurry and didn’t have time to cook for Uncle Chen.","She anxiously sat on the cold bench in the hospital corridor. However, no matter how she told the patient’s family that she would not run, those people refused to let her go.","Helpless, she could only send a message to Chen Yuan, who was studying in Beijing. She asked him to get his high school classmates to send food over.","***","Beijing.","Chen Yuan turned on his cell phone after class and saw a message from his Mom.","He quickly walked out of the classroom and called her.","The call rang for more than 10 seconds before it was answered.","Chen Yuan immediately asked, “Mom, what’s wrong? Why aren’t you at home?”","“... I can’t explain it to you right now. Yuan Yuan, call a high school classmate and ask them to deliver food to your father. I’ll go back tonight.”","Aunt Chen did not want him to know about the family matters, mainly because she did not want him to tell Qiao Nian.","“By the way, I’m worried about delivering the key through someone else. Tell him to find a lock-picking company. I’ll pay for it. If the locksmith refuses to open the door for him, get him to call me. I’ll explain to him.”","Aunt Chen was quite thoughtful. She even thought of the lockpicking company.","She carefully reminded Chen Yuan without mentioning where she was.","Chen Yuan could tell this matter was not small. He did not insist on asking for the reason and obediently agreed. He said he would contact his classmate to deliver food and then hang up.","Aunt Chen hung up with relief.","After some thought, Chen Yuan found Qiao Nian’s phone number. His fingertips rubbed against it a few times, but he did not call her.","He bought a plane ticket to Rao City and applied for leave with the professor before rushing to the airport.","During this period, he even thought of a way to contact a high school classmate and get him to help deliver food to his father. At the same time, he also explained what Aunt Chen had said about the lock-picker.","**","Next morning.","Aunt Chen finally got rid of the patient’s family in the morning and returned home exhausted after having been pestered by them for the entire night."]},{"number":3353,"title":"Chapter 3353: Chen Yuan Is Back","paragraphs":["Chapter 3353: Chen Yuan Is Back","Editor: Atlas Studios","Aunt Chen walked to the door and mechanically took out her keys from her bag, preparing to open the door. Then, she remembered asking Chen Yuan’s classmate to deliver food to her husband last night. The lock had long been broken.","Silently, she stuffed the keys back into her bag and pushed open the old steel door of the house.","Squeak—","The door opened with a push.","Aunt Chen dragged her tired body into the house and tried her best to sound normal. “I’m back. Last night, you...”","Before she could finish her sentence, she saw someone in the living room whom she had not seen for almost three months. She stood rooted to the ground and rubbed her eyes to confirm she was not hallucinating.","Aunt Chen then mumbled, “Y-Yuan Yuan?”","Chen Yuan helped Uncle Chen to the living room for breakfast.","The fragrance of porridge wafted out of the kitchen. Chen Yuan even specially peeled an egg for Uncle Chen and placed it in a bowl. Only then did he get up and wipe his hands with a piece of paper. Then, he looked at his mother.","“I’ll scoop some rice for you. Do you want eggs?” He looked as natural as when he came back during the school vacation. He wiped his hands and said, “Go wash your hands first. You can eat when you come out.”","Aunt Chen’s feet seemed to weigh a thousand pounds, and she could not move from her spot. She watched as Chen Yuan entered the kitchen and brought her a bowl of rice.","Finally returning to her senses, she thought of something and anxiously grabbed Chen Yuan’s arm. “You didn’t tell Nian Nian, right?”","Chen Yuan wasn’t angry at her. He slowly placed the food on the table and patted the back of her hand comfortingly. “Don’t worry, I didn’t say anything.”","“That’s good.” Aunt Chen heaved a sigh of relief.","Chen Yuan looked at her loosened hand and suppressed his anger. He lowered his voice and asked her, “Mom, you can tell me what happened now, right?”","“Well...”","Aunt Chen’s heart, which had just relaxed, rose to her throat again. Her eyes flickered as she subconsciously looked at Chen Yuan. His eyes were dark as he waited for her explanation.","Aunt Chen knew her son was stubborn. She sighed and told him that someone had come to look for them yesterday and threatened them.","She then told Chen Yuan about everything that happened at the stall in the afternoon.","Someone claimed to have eaten something wrong at her stall. Aunt Chen kneaded the corner of her shirt and insisted, “The issue with the customer from last night should be a coincidence. I’ve already explained it to them. The police have also come. We just have to wait for the final investigation results.”","Chen Yuan was so angry that he sneered. He looked at her deeply and suppressed the depression in his chest. “Mom, do you really think what happened with the customer last night was a coincidence?”","“If it’s not a coincidence, what else could it be...” Aunt Chen immediately looked away.","Then, not wanting Chen Yuan to continue pursuing the matter, she pushed him inside and said, “Don’t worry about it. Buy a plane ticket and go back to school in the afternoon. Your father and I will settle it. Don’t worry!”","“That’s right, Chen Yuan. Listen to your mother! Go back to school in the afternoon. How can a student run home anytime he wants! The teacher will be angry if he finds out.” Uncle Chen knew what his wife was thinking.","If she told Chen Yuan that the customer with food poisoning was very likely to have been planted to frame her, the matter would become huge. The other party would definitely not let it go easily.","However, they had made up their minds not to trouble Nian Nian even if they lost all their money. Therefore, the most important thing was to get Chen Yuan to go back to school so that he wouldn’t get involved.","Aunt Chen hadn’t slept and her eyes were a little red. She forced herself to be energetic, patted his shoulder, and then earnestly said, “Yuan Yuan, listen to your father. Buy a plane ticket in the afternoon.”"]},{"number":3354,"title":"Chapter 3354: That Family Still Won’t Give In","paragraphs":["Chapter 3354: That Family Still Won’t Give In","Editor: Atlas Studios","Chen Yuan could tell they did not want him to be involved in this. He didn’t know what they were thinking, but he seemed to have compromised and lowered his voice. “I understand.”","Uncle Chen and Aunt Chen heaved a sigh of relief. They relaxed and put aside their worries.","Aunt Chen pulled Chen Yuan to the chair and they asked him about the school as they ate breakfast.","**","At this moment, in the only five-star hotel in Rao City.","Mr. Zhou had been waiting for news. The assistant who went outside to ask about the situation finally knocked on his door.","Mr. Zhou stood up. “Come in.”","The assistant came in and greeted, “President Zhou.”","Mr. Zhou nodded reluctantly and then immediately asked, “How was it? Did that family give in?”","“No.”","The assistant shook his head with a serious expression. “After she arrived at the hospital yesterday, she paid the money demanded of her. Besides explaining to the family that there was nothing wrong with her hygiene, she didn’t say anything else. The family hinted to her according to your instructions, but she didn’t seem to understand.”","“That shouldn’t be the case!” Mr. Zhou paced the room frustratedly. Then, he returned to the assistant and stared at him. “Do you think she really doesn’t understand or is she pretending not to understand?”","The assistant’s hair stood on end under his gaze. He quickly lowered his head and stammered, “This... I’m not sure either.”","Mr. Zhou wasn’t satisfied with his answer.","The assistant was smart and said, “But most people upon encountering these matters one after another would think of what you said to them.”","Mr. Zhou glanced at him and said slowly, “So you also think she’s pretending to be confused.”","This time, the assistant was smart enough to remain silent.","Silence was the best answer.","Mr. Zhou’s mood became even heavier. He gritted his teeth and waved his hand. “I originally thought we could start from Rao City. Zhou Zheng can still be saved. It looks like this family is also a tough nut to crack! Fortunately, they don’t have any family background. It’s easy to control such people. They won’t be like those in Beijing whom we can’t find a way to deal with!”","He had tried to get close to those in Beijing, but it was a pity that everyone who could establish themselves in Beijing had some background. Their connections were complicated.","As an outsider, he couldn’t touch anyone.","However, the Chen family in Rao City was different.","They were just ordinary people.","Besides having a university student, their jobs were ordinary and they didn’t know any big shots. It was too easy to handle such an ordinary person.","He could make them beg with just a raise of his hand!","At this thought, Mr. Zhou’s gaze became sinister. He instructed his assistant, “Go and find a few people to scare them.”","He carefully explained to his assistant how to “scare” the Chen family.","The assistant went to do it as soon as he received the order.","**","Noon.","Aunt Chen watched Chen Yuan get into the taxi.","Before the taxi set off, she especially stuffed money into the driver’s hands and instructed him to send him to the airport ‘safely’.","Although the driver was confused, he still accepted the money and agreed to her request.","The taxi left the Chen family home and went onto the viaduct.","In the car.","Chen Yuan said to the driver through the rearview mirror, “Sir, wait for me outside when we reach the airport later. I’ll go in and come back out after a while. I want you to send me somewhere.”","“Uh.” The driver had never seen such a strange request in his more than 10 years of working as a taxi driver. As he drove steadily, he stole a glance at him and said, “Aren’t you going to catch a plane? Didn’t your mother tell you to go back to school early?”"]},{"number":3355,"title":"Chapter 3355: I Want to Call the Police","paragraphs":["Chapter 3355: I Want to Call the Police","Editor: Atlas Studios","Chen Yuan saw the car behind them through the rearview mirror, smiled, and calmly said, “I still have something on.”","The driver scratched his head. Since he could earn more money, he was happy to do it. “Alright, I’ll wait for you outside for 10 minutes at most. I’ll be fined otherwise.”","“Okay, 10 minutes is enough.”","Chen Yuan looked at the car following them all the way. His mother would probably leave when she saw him enter the terminal.","10 minutes was more than enough!","**","As it turned out, he was right.","After Aunt Chen sent him off, she hailed a taxi and followed him to the airport.","Only after she watched him enter the terminal was she relieved. She said to the phone, “Don’t worry, Yuan Yuan has gone in.”","“That’s good.”","The man on the other end of the call was seriously ill and spoke weakly. Who else could it be but Uncle Chen?","Impatient, the driver turned around and asked, “How long do we have to wait? We’re not allowed to park here.”","Aunt Chen saw Chen Yuan enter the terminal with her own eyes. In addition, the driver kept urging her, so she did not want to trouble him. “It’s alright. Thank you. Let’s go back now.”","Her attitude was so good that the taxi driver was too embarrassed to lose his temper again. He turned the car around in silence.","“I’ll be back soon. You can...” Aunt Chen was about to hang up the call with Uncle Chen.","At this moment.","A commotion ensued on the other end.","Then, she heard a series of clanging sounds, followed by Uncle Chen’s furious voice. “Who are you? What do you want?”","“What’s wrong?” Aunt Chen immediately became nervous.","Uncle Chen did not have a chance to answer her.","Someone else’s voice came through the phone. “We’re from the Food Bureau. We received a report that there’s something wrong with the food you’re selling. You’re the owner of this house, right? Please come back with us!”","How did that happen?","Aunt Chen was so anxious that she sweated profusely. She held her cell phone tightly and shouted—","“Hello?","“Hello? I’m the one selling the soup. Don’t find trouble with him. Look for me.","“Hello? Can you hear me?”","The other party seemed to have hung up.","Aunt Chen was so anxious that she was about to cry. She grabbed her cell phone tightly and pounced forward. “Sir, can you drive faster? I’m in a hurry.”","The driver also heard it. It seemed like something had happened at home.","He immediately stepped on the accelerator and said, “I’ll try my best.”","**","Three hours later.","Chen Yuan barged into the Rao City police station and asked for a police officer.","The police officer saw that he looked like a university student and signaled for him to take a seat. Then, he took a notebook and asked him what the matter was.","Chen Yuan told him about what had happened at home. Then, he said anxiously, “I want you to save my father.”","At first, the police officer took notes seriously. Later on, he looked at him dumbfoundedly. After a long time, he replied, “You mean... you want us to save your father? But your food caused someone food poisoning. It’s normal for them to be taken away. Why do you make it sound like your father was kidnapped?”","Chen Yuan pursed his lips. His face was a little pale, and the veins on the back of his hand bulged. He looked shocked and angry but tried to remain calm. “Because they didn’t take my father away for food poisoning at all! They framed our family!”","“This...” The officer was confused, wondering if this guy could be trusted."]},{"number":3356,"title":"Chapter 3356: Master Wang Knows, Countdown to Face Slapping","paragraphs":["Chapter 3356: Master Wang Knows, Countdown to Face Slapping","Editor: Atlas Studios","However, he saw that Chen Yuan was young and spoke clearly. He had just asked if he was still a university student from Beijing. It seemed like he wouldn’t want to make up nonsense.","With good intentions, he said, “Then wait for me. I’ll tell the team leader about your situation.”","“Okay.”","Chen Yuan cupped the hot tea the others had poured for him with both hands and tried to calm down. He pursed his lips and looked at that person. His voice was hoarse as he said, “Thank you.”","The person who received him was stunned momentarily before comforting him. “Sit here and wait for me. I’ll be right back.”","**","Cai Gang was about to leave after finishing his tea when a man hurried into the staff office, where he reported a dispute.","Originally, Cai Gang was not interested in this trivial matter. After all, he had endless work to do every day. How could he care about these trivial matters?","Cai Gang was already half a step out when he heard a familiar name.","“The student who came to report is called Chen Yuan. He’s also a student at Beijing A University. His results are quite good. I don’t think he’s lying.”","Chen Yuan?","Cai Gang frowned. The name sounded familiar.","He retracted his foot and heard the people inside getting angry. They were saying that it was against the rules for them to save people like that.","Cai Gang returned.","The angry person was a little flustered. Thinking that Cai Gang felt his subordinate was not doing his job well, he glared at his subordinates and smiled apologetically at Cai Gang. “... Look, I’ve made a fool of myself! He’s insensible. I’ve already educated him. In the future, he won’t accept police reports anyhow.”","Cai Gang ignored him and walked up to the officer with a serious expression. “Can you tell me what’s the matter with that Chen Yuan you mentioned just now?”","The officer who had received Chen Yuan was so nervous that he sweated as he repeated what Chen Yuan had just told him in detail.","When Cai Gang heard about the soup stall and his disabled and seriously ill father, he knew that he had not made a mistake.","This Chen Yuan was the same one from the Chen family who had a good relationship with Qiao Nian.","Expression solemn, he hurriedly instructed his subordinates as he went out to make a call, “Take good care of him. Then, do as he says and investigate to see if there’s such a thing.”","Cai Gang had good reason to have come so far.","Besides recognizing Ye Wangchuan in Rao City back then, he was also capable at work.","After all, Ye Wangchuan did not use trash.","He said, “Especially the family members of the patient who supposedly suffered from food poisoning. Go to the hospital and ask the doctor what the residue from the gastric lavage is...”","If the hospital proved that the residue from the patient’s gastric lavage was not from the soup, it would be obvious extortion and they would go to jail.","Cai Gang didn’t look at his subordinates’ reactions as he hurriedly said, “I’ll make a call. Hurry up and investigate according to my orders.”","He had to tell Master Wang quickly.","**","Beijing.","Ye Wangchuan received a call from Cai Gang.","His smile faded and his eyelashes lowered, hiding the coldness in his eyes. His fingertips brushed against the corners of his cell phone, and he couldn’t hide his sharp gaze. “I understand.”","Back then, Cai Gang was smart enough to choose the right person to side with, which was why he soared.","Of course, he had to clarify this person’s stance now. “Young Master Ye, do you think I should tell the Chen family not to be anxious?”","“Since they don’t want Nian Nian to know, don’t say anything for now.”","Ye Wangchuan turned around and returned to the living room. He placed his hand on the bar table and gently tapped his fingertip with a mocking expression. “Don’t they like to suppress others with their power? Later, you...”"]},{"number":3357,"title":"Chapter 3357: Who’s the Ant That’s About to Be Knocked to Death?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3357: Who’s the Ant That’s About to Be Knocked to Death?","Editor: Atlas Studios","Ye Wangchuan instructed Cai Gang on what to do.","After a while, Cai Gang hung up silently. He took a deep breath of fresh air and lit a candle for the Zhou family in his heart.","Playing this game with this person, they would only be tortured to death.","**","In the hotel.","After hearing the assistant’s report, Mr. Zhou’s nerves, which had been tense for the past few days, relaxed. A smile appeared on his lips, making him look gentlemanly and refined. “Keep him locked up for half a day. I’ll look for her tonight! Let’s see if she’ll relent this time.”","Seeing that the situation had taken a turn for the better, Madam Zhou’s dispiritedness from the past few days disappeared. Today, she had dressed up and looked especially radiant.","After tidying her hair, she said in a light tone, “Half a day? Isn’t that too easy on them? If you ask me, we must keep him locked up for at least a day.”","She remembered the middle-aged woman didn’t know what was good for her and chased them out the other day.","This was such a good opportunity for revenge. She couldn’t wait to make the other party suffer.","Mr. Zhou turned to look at her and frowned in disapproval. “What do you know?”","Madam Zhou choked.","Before she could retort, he continued in a deep voice, “We can’t drag it out for too long. I asked Captain Yang and he said that that person’s health isn’t good. It’s already his limit to keep him locked for half a day without his medicine. If we drag it out for too long, it’s easy to have complications.”","Madam Zhou’s eyebrows twitched, and she pursed her lips disapprovingly.","In her eyes, Aunt Chen and Uncle Chen were just ants in the sand. Even if they died in front of her, she might not be moved.","She only cared about herself and her son Zou Zheng!","What did their lives have to do with her?","Mr. Zhou seemed to see through her thoughts and reminded her calmly, “Don’t forget. Our goal isn’t to force them to death but to get them to help us. If both sides suffer, it won’t be good for either of us.”","Ye Wangchuan was still in Beijing.","He could crush the Chen family like crushing an ant, but weren’t they also ants to others?","“Got it. I’ll listen to you as long as I can save my son.” Although Madam Zhou was unwilling, she reluctantly agreed.","Mr. Zhou ignored her and turned to his assistant with a serious expression. “Convey my wish to Captain Yang and the rest to treat them to lunch to thank them for their help this time.”","“Alright, President Zhou.”","It wasn’t the first time the assistant had done this. He was very good at dealing with matters like this. Thus, he immediately went to do it.","After the assistant left, Madam Zhou returned to her senses and worriedly said, “There won’t be any accidents this time, right?”","“They’re just ordinary people. Don’t worry.” Mr. Zhou squeezed her shoulders and walked to the cafeteria to make himself a cup of coffee.","He was a scheming person. He planned to negotiate with Aunt Chen after lunch with Captain Yang and the rest.","Because things were going so smoothly, he made coffee much more briskly.","***","At the same time.","Without Mr. Zhou’s knowledge, the family who caused trouble in the hospital had already been brought to the police station.","In the beginning, when faced with the police’s questioning, they still acted like they were innocent. They insisted that their family member had eaten Aunt Chen’s spicy soup, which caused food poisoning. That’s why they rushed to the hospital.","No matter how much the police officer reminded them not to lie, they refused to relent.","When the police officers who went to the doctor to collect evidence returned, they brought the residue and surgical records from the gastric lavage and placed them in front of them.","“Speak.”"]},{"number":3358,"title":"Chapter 3358: I Thought Everything Was Under My Control","paragraphs":["Chapter 3358: I Thought Everything Was Under My Control","Editor: Atlas Studios","The family was dumbfounded by the ironclad evidence.","They were no longer the victims but the accused. All trembling in fear, they started to cry and beg for mercy.","“We were just trying to scare her.”","“We didn’t cause much of an impact. At most, we’ll just refund her the medical fees.”","“That’s right, Mr. Policeman. We’re willing to return the money.”","“...”","The police officer in charge of recording was the young man who received Chen Yuan. Hearing this, he stopped writing and looked up at them with a sneer. “So you were just playing a prank?”","The woman who pulled Aunt Chen’s hair and hit her last night was now as timid as a quail. She shrunk her neck and nodded crazily. “Yes, I was just joking. We already know our mistake, so don’t hold it against us... We’re not cultured and don’t know anything.”","The young policeman had seen many people and was used to them pretending to be pitiful. He knocked on the table, and when they piped down, he said in a serious tone, “Then do you know what extortion is?! Do you know that extortion and blackmail can result in jail time? According to the criminal law, you can be sentenced from one to three years in prison.”","“What? Jail!”","This time, the entire family was stunned.","The crocodile tears were out as they cried, “We’re not going to jail! We don’t know anything. We were just joking with her.”","“Quiet.” The interrogator patted the table, then looked at all of them and asked, “Tell me, who asked you to do it?”","The whole family looked scared. They hesitated but still did not want to say anything.","The young policeman wasn’t in a hurry. He put down his fountain pen and leaned back in his chair, looking like he would slowly take his time with them.","“It’s fine if you don’t want to tell me. I have plenty of time. But let me remind you that if you confess, you’ll be granted leniency. If you keep quiet, you’ll be severely punished.","“You still have a chance to redeem yourselves. But if you insist on not cooperating, we can only put the blame on you and take it that you’re maliciously extorting them.","“Malicious extortion will get you three years in jail!”","This family had gone to find trouble with Aunt Chen for money.","No matter how much money the Zhou family gave, how could it be as serious as going to jail?","The family cried for a while. Seeing that there was no other way, someone raised his trembling hand. “I-I’ll tell you.”","**","Mr. Zhou had lunch with Captain Yang and the others at a high-class private restaurant.","He even ordered a few bottles of vintage wine.","The meal cost a six-figure sum.","However, Mr. Zhou was very generous and did not even bat an eyelid.","Before leaving, he even gave everyone a big red packet. He knew how to behave.","He and his assistant sent them to the door and walked them to the car one by one. They bent down beside Captain Yang’s car and knocked on the window.","After the window rolled down, he raised his eyebrows and said to the person in the car, “As long as you can do my job this time, I’ll ‘thank’ you properly later.”","He emphasized the word ‘thank’.","Everyone was an adult. They smiled happily at each other. Soon, they finished exchanging pleasantries.","The man in the car looked at his watch. His cell phone, which he had thrown on the passenger seat, lit up. Not daring to delay any longer, he said to Mr. Zhou, “President Zhou, I’ll leave first.”","Mr. Zhou stepped aside. “Take care.”","He watched as the black car slowly drove away. Heaving a sigh of relief, he felt even more relaxed. He turned to his assistant and said, “Let’s go. We’ll look for that person tonight.”","He was naturally talking about Aunt Chen.","He still had not realized the storm was brewing."]},{"number":3359,"title":"Chapter 3359: Don’t Worry, Miss Qiao Doesn’t Know","paragraphs":["Chapter 3359: Don’t Worry, Miss Qiao Doesn’t Know","Editor: Atlas Studios","Beijing.","Ye Wangchuan received Cai Gang’s call. “Master Wang, I’ve already collected the evidence. I’m just waiting for your order to start.”","Ye Wangchuan looked at the time.","Cai Gang took about three hours. He was quite efficient.","He lowered his eyes, allowing his extremely long eyelashes to cover his pupils, making it impossible for anyone to see his emotions.","“There’s no hurry.”","The clay pot in front of him was steaming. The water inside had already boiled, and he could make tea at any time.","However, he wasn’t in a hurry. His slender fingers fiddled with the tassel on the teapot’s side, as if he was waiting for the tea to boil hotter.","“Go fetch Uncle Chen first and send him to the hospital.”","“Okay.”","“Also, inform Chen Yuan to bring his mother along. Pick her up and bring them to the ward to see Uncle Chen.”","“Will do.”","Ye Wangchuan slowly picked up the teapot and brewed the tea leaves in the cup. The roasted tea leaves quickly unfolded in the boiling water.","He narrowed his eyes and smiled, but the smile did not reach his eyes. “You can get to it first. Be careful to ensure the Chen family’s safety!”","Cai Gang was going to prioritize this even without his reminder. “Don’t worry, Master Wang.”","Ye Wangchuan put his phone aside after hanging up and focused on making tea. He glanced at the time on the wall and estimated how long it would take Cai Gang to finish these matters.","Qiao Nian’s room on the second floor was still quiet.","As expected, she was still sleeping or writing songs. In short, she didn’t care about what was happening outside.","Moreover, whether it was Aunt Chen or Chen Yuan, they had probably not told her what was happening.","Ye Wangchuan tapped the table with his fair finger. Originally, he did not need to interfere in such a small matter, but Aunt Chen was Qiao Nian’s benefactor.","The Zhou family had stepped on his bottom line by targeting Aunt Chen!","He thought for a moment before calling Ye Maoshan. “Hello, Old Master...”","**","Cai Gang had always been good at handling matters. This time, he got Uncle Chen out and sent him to the hospital in less than an hour.","He even waited for the doctor’s examination.","After confirming that Uncle Chen was fine and only needed rest, he contacted Chen Yuan according to Ye Wangchuan’s instructions.","Chen Yuan knew he did not manage to keep the matter under wraps upon receiving the call. He was originally in a low mood, but Cai Gang told him that Qiao Nian still did not know what had happened in Rao City... He asked him to go home and get Aunt Chen to visit Uncle Chen in the hospital. It was very safe there.","Half an hour later.","Cai Gang the car outside the Chen family’s house.","Chen Yuan had just helped Aunt Chen, whose eyes were red from crying, out. Seeing him, she pursed her lips and said, “Thank you.”","Cai Gang was a smart person. After opening the door, he immediately smiled and said, “I’m just following Young Master Ye’s orders.”","Chen Yuan fell silent.","Still uneasy, Aunt Chen immediately did not get into the car and uneasily asked, “Nian Nian...”","Cai Gang didn’t know why they cared so much about whether Qiao Nian knew or not, but he still explained dutifully, “Auntie, don’t worry. Miss Qiao doesn’t know about this.”","“That’s good.” Aunt Chen was finally relieved and willingly got into the car.","In the few hours that Uncle Chen was taken away, she had thought of many ways, but she had never thought of looking for Qiao Nian, afraid she would cause trouble for her again.","Fortunately, Nian Nian did not know.","Chen Yuan supported her. “Mom, slow down.”","Although Aunt Chen was angry that he lied to her about getting on the plane, she knew the child’s original intention was to care for them, so she did not blame him. Hence, she nodded and slowly got into the car."]},{"number":3360,"title":"Chapter 3360: You Only Know Pain When You Experience It!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3360: You Only Know Pain When You Experience It!","Editor: Atlas Studios","Chen Yuan also entered the car.","Only then did Cai Gang get into the front seat and bring them to the hospital.","On the way, Aunt Chen grabbed her clothes and fidgeted. She only relaxed when she saw her husband safe and sound in the hospital ward.","The family finally reunited, and no one mentioned their previous troubles.","**","Compared to their family reunion, Mr. Zhou, who thought he had everything under control at noon, wasn’t so happy.","He first received a call and found out that Uncle Chen had been taken away. He had yet to figure out where he had been taken to.","Then, he received another call from the person who had lunch with him in the afternoon, angrily asking him who he had provoked. Why was he suspended for investigation when he had only agreed to teach the stall owner a lesson?","Back then, when Mr. Zhou asked for help, he did not dare to tell him everything. He only said that Aunt Chen had offended him and he wanted to teach her a lesson.","Now that things had turned out like this, he didn’t know how to explain it to the other party.","It was better not to explain this matter at all.","He couldn’t possibly tell them that Beijing and Qiao Nian were involved, right?","Mr. Zhou hung up, overwrought. Madam Zhou was still anticipating going to Aunt Chen tonight and forcing her to relent.","At this moment, she happened to ask him, “What time are we going to look for that woman?”","Mr. Zhou looked at her and did not speak.","Madam Zhou asked curiously, “Why are you looking at me? What’s wrong?”","Mr. Zhou shook his head. He couldn’t be bothered to tell her, fearing she would keep nagging him without helping.","He walked to the floor-to-ceiling window and tried to call Aunt Chen’s number.","It rang a dozen times.","The call got through, but no one picked up.","He reluctantly tried a few more times, but it was still the same.","He could get through, but no one picked up!","Unable to determine the current situation, a knock on their suite’s door distracted him out of his thoughts.","“Who is it?”","Madam Zhou looked at the entrance and asked impatiently.","A waiter’s voice politely said, “Hello, guest. We’re the cleaners. Please open the door. We’ll clean your room.”","Madam Zhou looked at the unfinished coffee cups on the table and went over to open the door.","“Wait...” Mr. Zhou returned to his senses and tried to stop her, but the door was already open.","Apart from the hotel staff, there were also police officers outside.","The police officers didn’t exchange pleasantries and immediately showed their identification documents. Then, they looked at Mr. Zhou and asked directly, “Are you Mr. Zhou?”","Mr. Zhou understood what was happening but just couldn’t believe it. “... It’s me.”","“You’re suspected of a cross-border fraud case. Please come with us to the police station.” The officer walked in to take him away.","Madam Zhou was dumbfounded by what was happening.","“Are you guys mistaken? We don’t lack money. How can we be involved in fraud?”","She didn’t understand. It was Aunt Chen and Uncle Chen who were supposed to be taken away, but now, it was her husband who was being taken away.","But no one would pay attention to her.","After the officer handcuffed Mr. Zhou, he calmly answered her, “We wouldn’t have come for President Zhou without evidence. Let’s go.”","Although Mr. Zhou wanted to resist, the officer had already put it this way. He had to cooperate.","“You can’t do this. He’s not in good health...” Madam Zhou was dumbfounded.","She wasn’t as calm as her husband as she watched him being taken away.","She cried and followed them, completely forgetting how she treated the “ants” before. There was only endless pain and confusion now..."]},{"number":3361,"title":"Chapter 3361: Sister Nian Knows","paragraphs":["Chapter 3361: Sister Nian Knows","Editor: Atlas Studios","Beijing.","Qiao Nian’s room was brightly lit. Draft papers were scattered on the table, all filled with handwriting.","In addition to those, many crumpled draft papers could also be seen in the trash can beside Qiao Nian’s feet. It was obvious that her new song was not progressing smoothly.","The computer screen emitted a white glow, showing the backend of a music simulator.","Qiao Nian chose the konghou.","There was a short melody on the simulator.","The girl gently tapped the Enter button, and the simulator automatically started the tune of an instrument. It was magnificent.","Logically speaking, she should be satisfied.","However, Qiao Nian only frowned. Then, her fair hand used the mouse to delete the short music score.","She had to start all over again.","Qiao Nian rubbed her swollen temples and reached for the drink beside her. However, she only met empty air. Turning her head, she saw that the bottle had been thrown into the trash can.","She had long finished it.","She pushed the chair away with the tip of her foot and stood up. With one hand in her pocket, she opened the door with the other and prepared to go downstairs to get a bottle of Coke.","She had just left the room when she heard someone on the phone below.","“When does Chen Yuan plan to go back?”","“He’s only a second-year student, right?”","“Tell him that you’ll take care of Uncle, he should go back to school for class.”","“...”","Qiao Nian slowed down and narrowed her sleepy eyes. She acutely caught the main point—Chen Yuan.","Where did Chen Yuan go when he wasn’t in school?","Qiao Nian seemed to think of something. Her eyes darkened, but she did not turn back. Instead, she resumed walking downstairs and then went straight to the fridge.","“Miss Qiao.” Upon seeing her, Gu San quickly winked at Ye Wangchuan and asked loudly, “Why did you come down?”","“There’s no more water in the room. I came down to get some.” Qiao Nian’s tone was light as she walked to the fridge, opened the door, and took out a Coke.","Then, as Gu San heaved a sigh of relief, she suddenly looked at him and asked, “By the way, are you hiding something from me?”","How brief!","How direct!","Gu San choked.","“...”","“Are you alright?” Qiao Nian looked very good-tempered. She casually asked after taking a sip of Coke.","Gu San’s throat was dry. For a moment, he did not know if he should say it. “Miss Qiao, I...”","He pursed his lips with difficulty and he kept glancing at the tall figure. The word ‘help’ was written all over his face.","Fortunately, Ye Wangchuan wasn’t that stupid.","He said to Cai Gang, “I’ll hang up first.” Then, he put away his cell phone and turned to walk towards them. His extremely long eyelashes drooped down, outlining a helpless and doting expression. “You heard me.”","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows noncommittally and looked at him without saying anything as she casually swirled the Coke bottle.","“It’s about Rao City.” Ye Wangchuan had never been a stubborn person. He looked at her deeply. “Aunt Chen didn’t want you to know, so I didn’t tell you.”","Aunt Chen, Chen Yuan...","It was just as she had thought.","Someone had found Aunt Chen in Rao City.","Qiao Nian’s voice was hoarse as she looked at him and asked, “Zhou Zheng?”","She had always been smart, so it wasn’t difficult for her to guess what was going on. However, she didn’t expect the Zhou family to target the Chen family in Rao City.","They really knew how to court death!"]},{"number":3362,"title":"Chapter 3362: Sister Nian’s Going to Rao City, Immediately","paragraphs":["Chapter 3362: Sister Nian’s Going to Rao City, Immediately","Editor: Atlas Studios","Ye Wangchuan gave her a meaningful look.","Qiao Nian met his eyes and knew the answer without him saying anything.","She placed the half-empty Coke bottle on the bar counter and went to the stairs. “I’m going to Rao City.”","Gu San looked at her back view as she went upstairs and then looked at Ye Wangchuan anxiously. “Master Wang, aren’t you going to stop Miss Qiao?”","“I won’t.”","Qiao Nian was worried about Aunt Chen and the rest. It was normal for her to want to go over and confirm Uncle Chen and Aunt Chen’s safety. He had no reason to stop her.","Moreover, the matter in Rao City had basically been settled.","The Zhou family wouldn’t be able to do anything.","If Qiao Nian wanted to go, he would go with her.","Ye Wangchuan retracted his gaze. Still as noble and lazy as usual, as if he could not even be bothered looking up, he instructed Gu San, “Book two tickets for the earliest flight to Rao City.”","**","At the Fu residence in Rao City.","Fu Ge had just returned home when he saw his mother beckoning him.","After a day of hard work, he was not in the mood to hear about blind dates. However, he endured it and walked over.","Before Mother Fu could speak, he beat her to it. “Mom, I had a meeting today and I’m exhausted. If it’s not important, I’ll go to my room and shower first.”","“Stop right there!”","How could Mother Fu not know what he was thinking? She looked at her son’s back view as he turned to go upstairs and explained, “I’m not going to ask you to go on a blind date.”","Fu Ge stopped and looked back at her, but he had no intention of walking back. He just stood there and waited for her to speak.","Mother Fu looked at his distant demeanor, and her heart tightened. “You’re still thinking about why you couldn’t stay in Beijing...”","Fu Ge graduated from a prestigious school and was favored by the heavens. He was the heir of the family and the one she valued the most.","Who knew that her youngest son, who she was most proud of, would end up like this? She had to admit it even if she didn’t want to.","Fu Ge’s current state had something to do with her.","If she had not despised Qiao Nian and insisted on tying the Fu family to Qiao Chen, the family wouldn’t have declined to this point.","In a small place like Rao City, they were almost reduced to an ordinary family.","“Sigh, you’re still blaming me.” Mother Fu’s eyes reddened and she rubbed them, her tone indescribably defeated and self-reproachful.","Fu Ge was already very tired. Seeing her expression, he felt even more tired and did not have the strength to comfort her. “I don’t blame you.”","He did not want Mother Fu to cry in front of him, so he changed the topic. “By the way, Mom. What did you want to say to me just now?”","Sure enough.","Mother Fu stopped crying as she recalled what she wanted to share with him and became excited. “It’s not a big deal.”","What?","“Today, Cai Gang personally went to the Food Administration to pick up someone and send him to the hospital.”","Mother Fu couldn’t hide her envy upon mentioning Cai Gang.","The Fu family had declined.","In the past two years, Cai Gang had become more and more stable in his post. He had become the number one person in Rao City.","“I thought it was odd. Just wanted to ask if you’d heard anything out there.”","“Me? What makes you think I know?”","Fu Ge’s eyes were lonely. He smiled and said directly, “That circle has always been tight-lipped. Even if there is news, it will only spread within the circle and not reach the ears of outsiders.”","He was talking about the circles of the big families in Rao City."]},{"number":3363,"title":"Chapter 3363: It’s Too Late to Regret Now","paragraphs":["Chapter 3363: It’s Too Late to Regret Now","Editor: Atlas Studios","In the past, the Fu family was one of them.","Now, only the Tang family and Cai Gang were left.","He had long been excluded from the industry and no one brought him along to play.","Mother Fu’s life hadn’t been smooth sailing for the past two years. She fell silent.","Her aggressive aura was gone, and only the wrinkles and fatigue of a normal middle-aged woman were on her face. “I suspect that this matter has something to do with Qiao Nian.”","It had been a long time since she mentioned this name. Mother Fu was in a daze for a moment. Then, she remembered. “You and her...” Can’t you be friends?","Before she could finish her probing question, Fu Ge interrupted her coldly. “Mom, since we’ve come this far, there’s no medicine for regret. Don’t think about your unrealistic fantasies anymore!”","It was rare for Mother Fu to be lectured by him. She opened her mouth but did not say anything to refute him.","Even more tired now, Fu Ge dragged himself upstairs. “I’ll go to my room.”","Mother Fu looked at his back view, bent by the pressure at such a young age, and felt her heart ache with regret.","But just as Fu Ge had said, they were the ones who chose the path back then. It was too late to regret it now!","**","Qiao Nian arrived at the Rao City airport in the afternoon.","She went straight to the hospital where Uncle Chen was staying.","Just as Ye Wangchuan thought she would enter the ward, Qiao Nian glanced at Uncle Chen and Auntie Chen from afar before turning to ask him, “Where is his doctor’s office?”","“That way.” Ye Wangchuan pointed in a direction and paused. “I’ll take you there.”","Qiao Nian followed him to the attending doctor and explained her intentions. She asked about Uncle Chen’s health.","The attending doctor didn’t know her identity. But, upon seeing their bearing was extraordinary and they did not look like the families of ordinary patients, he showed them Uncle Chen’s medical report genially.","Qiao Nian seriously flipped through the report.","Sitting on the swivel chair, the female doctor pushed up her glasses and said in a friendly tone, “We’ve done a comprehensive checkup on the patient. Other than his old illness, it’s just that he hasn’t rested well these past few days. High mental stress has caused his blood pressure to rise.","“We’re only keeping him in the hospital to lower his blood pressure and blood sugar. He can go home when the indicator goes down.”","There was no need for her to explain. Qiao Nian could understand the complicated data in the medical report.","The female doctor spoke very professionally.","After Uncle Chen’s various checkups, other than the increase in blood sugar, the rest of the indicators were all within the normal range.","Qiao Nian’s nerves, tense for a few hours, relaxed. She thanked the doctor and left the office.","Returning to the corridor, Cai Gang had already rushed over upon receiving the news.","It had been a long time since he last saw Qiao Nian. He recognized the girl in the crowd at a glance. Wearing a cap and exuding an aura not to be trifled with, she was the person he was looking for.","Cai Gang quickly jogged over. “Miss Qiao.”","He was quite smart. He called her name first.","Then, he respectfully greeted the man standing beside Qiao Nian. “Master Wang, you’re here too.”","Ye Wangchuan was used to this kind of treatment. After all, Gu San and Qin Si were both like this. Sometimes, even Bo Jingxing would be led astray.","He only lowered his eyelashes and asked Cai Gang with a faint smile, “Where’s Chen Yuan?”","“I just sent him to the airport. That’s why I was delayed for a few minutes...” Cai Gang never needed anyone to worry about the way he handled things."]},{"number":3364,"title":"Chapter 3364: No Need, Go See The Zhou Family First","paragraphs":["Chapter 3364: No Need, Go See The Zhou Family First","Editor: Atlas Studios","Cai Gang was very good at reading people’s minds, and such people were usually very persuasive.","At first, Chen Yuan did not intend to return to school. However, after persuasion, he quickly agreed to return to school and wait for news.","Cai Gang followed Ye Wangchuan’s instructions and sent him to the airport. He watched him get on the plane before leaving.","Unexpectedly, he received news that Master Wang and Qiao Nian were also coming to Rao City. He had to go back and forth, which delayed him some. Otherwise, he would have definitely received them at the hospital.","Ye Wangchuan was very satisfied with his efficiency. He nodded and relaxed his brows.","Cai Gang relaxed and took the initiative to mention it to the girl. “The Zhou family is at the police station now. Miss Qiao, do you want to see them?”","He wasn’t sure if Young Master Ye had explained the ins and outs of this matter to Miss Qiao. After thinking for a moment, he briefly explained it to her.","“The Chen family suffered this time because the Zhou family wanted to see you, but they couldn’t find a way, so they targeted Aunt Chen.","“Aunt Chen... is a tough one. She even reminded me not to tell you, so...”","He secretly glanced in the noble and lazy man’s direction before quickly retracting his gaze. He didn’t explicitly say he was doing it for Ye Wangchuan as he subconsciously explained it to Qiao Nian in his own words.","“Do you want to see Uncle Chen first or...?” Cai Gang carefully asked for her opinion.","Qiao Nian lowered her baseball cap. Other than her cold eyes, no other emotion could be captured from her. “Let’s go to the police station first.”","She had no intention of meeting Uncle Chen. She just wanted to confirm their safety, afraid that something similar to Master Cheng’s case would happen again.","Fortunately, Uncle Chen was fine.","Aunt Chen was fine too.","Qiao Nian understood why Aunt Chen would rather die than tell her—she must be afraid of troubling her.","Since Ye Wangchuan had already resolved the matter, what reason did she have to go to the ward to reveal herself? She would only waste Uncle Chen and Aunt Chen’s care.","...","Mr. Zhou had been silent ever since he was brought to the police station.","No matter what the police asked, he always said, “Sorry, I have to wait for a lawyer.”","He looked gentle and polite, but, in fact, he was uncooperative, stubborn, and difficult to communicate with.","Even though the police had presented him with the testimony of Aunt Chen’s family and the evidence provided by the hospital, Mr. Zhou only leaned back and nonchalantly said, “Wait for my lawyer to come and communicate with you.”","He seemed certain his lawyer could help him out of his current predicament. Not that he was arrogant, but he refused to cooperate.","When Qiao Nian and the others arrived, the police officer interrogating him had already spent nearly five hours trying to persuade him to talk.","Mr. Zhou kept his eyes closed as if he was asleep. Only when the police slammed the table to remind him to straighten his back would he open his eyes and answer briefly. Most of the time, the only response was silence.","The long silence could wear down someone’s patience.","The officer was about to go crazy. In the end, he gave up, made a cup of tea, and sat opposite him, looking like he was going to waste time with him.","Mr. Zhou didn’t care about the angry police officer sitting opposite him. He just thought about what went wrong and how he was going to resolve the current predicament.","Of course, he would let the top foreign lawyer in his family’s paycheck come to bail him out.","However, he didn’t know when the lawyer would arrive..."]},{"number":3365,"title":"Chapter 3365: Can I Talk to Him Alone?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3365: Can I Talk to Him Alone?","Editor: Atlas Studios","As he absent-mindedly thought about these questions, the door to the interrogation room suddenly opened and someone outside spoke.","“Come out for a moment.”","“Will do.”","Mr. Zhou saw the police officer sitting opposite him quickly get up and leave. He did not forget to close the door behind him on his way out.","The interrogation room was soundproofed. As long as the door was closed, no one could hear what was happening outside.","Mr. Zhou looked around the room and frowned. He fidgeted on the chair and felt a little worried.","Outside.","Cai Gang asked, “How is it? Has he confessed?”","“He didn’t say anything.” The young policeman shook his head, feeling troubled. “He only emphasized that he had to wait for his lawyer to come and communicate with us.”","Rich people liked to do this.","Every time the police brought someone in for questioning, these people remained silent and refused to cooperate. They asked to wait for their lawyer.","It was as if lawyers were the police!","It was very displeasing.","Cai Gang had seen many people like Mr. Zhou and was not angry like the young policeman. He sneered. “We have a complete chain of evidence on him. Even if a lawyer comes, the result will be the same. He can’t bail out!”","Domestic and international provisions on bail differed.","Domestic bail was only available if evidence was insufficient.","Overseas, however, as long as one had enough money, they could bail out no matter their crime.","After all, Mr. Zhou was from Country M. He thought the domestic bail mechanism was the same as overseas. As long as he paid, he could be brought out by a lawyer.","The young officer went silent before noticing the man and woman beside him. He asked in surprise, “These two are...”","Qiao Nian asked Cai Gang, “Can I talk to him alone?”","Cai Gang replied without thinking, “Of course.”","Wearing a dark turtleneck sweater that accentuated his figure, Ye Wangchuan lowered his eyes and asked the girl, “Do you want me to accompany you?”","“No need.” Qiao Nian pursed her lips and stuffed one hand into her pocket. Her eyes were dark, and it was impossible to tell her thoughts. “I want to talk to him alone.”","Cai Gang pulled the young officer aside and said something to him.","When they returned, the young officer entered the interrogation room and took out his teacup. Then, he looked at the girl and said, “Don’t take too long.”","“Okay.”","Qiao Nian brushed past him.","The door was closed at the same time. He probably did as she asked and did not disturb her.","...","In a daze, Mr. Zhou’s were closed as he waited for the police officer to return. Then, he heard footsteps and a young girl’s voice.","Mr. Zhou’s heart skipped a beat and he slowly opened his eyes.","The incandescent light above his head hurt his eyes. Mr. Zhou had been in there for four hours and was already exhausted.","However, he was instantly energized upon seeing the girl.","“You...”","“Aren’t you looking for me?”","Qiao Nian casually walked over, pulled out the chair opposite him, and sat down. Placing her hand on the table and tapping it with her finger, she raised her head slightly, revealing her overly eye-catching face under the baseball cap. Very beautiful.","“What? You don’t know me?”","Arrogant and casual.","Mr. Zhou suddenly returned to his senses. “Qiao Nian, you...”"]},{"number":3366,"title":"Chapter 3366: My Money Is Enough for the People Around Me to Spend","paragraphs":["Chapter 3366: My Money Is Enough for the People Around Me to Spend","Editor: Atlas Studios","He was about to ask why she was here, but, on second thought, he understood everything.","She must have rushed over after hearing about what happened. Wouldn’t it be ridiculous if he asked her why she was here?","Mr. Zhou didn’t think of himself as a stupid person. He composed himself and sized up the girl opposite him. Then, he said cautiously, “The past three generations of my family had few children. Zhou Zheng is the only child in his generation. I heard this child did something wrong and provoked you. I’m willing to do anything to remedy it. As long as you ask, we’ll try our best to satisfy your conditions.”","The Zhou family was rich and had businesses all over the world.","This was also the reason for Mr. Zhou’s confidence in negotiating with Qiao Nian.","He felt that as long as Qiao Nian was willing to negotiate, he would be able to satisfy her no matter what she asked for. He just needed to meet her.","“Miss Qiao, I’m serious. I hope you’ll consider it.” Mr. Zhou was very calm. He could talk to her even here. He took the initiative to mention Aunt Chen. “I know my actions were a little rash, finding Aunt Chen and her family and troubling them. Don’t worry, I didn’t really want to hurt them.","“You can ask the people I got help from. I told them I just wanted to scare them. I’d release them in half a day at most.","“As for the medical fees Aunt Chen paid for, as long as I can see you, I’ll pay them back double.”","He felt that he had done the right thing. Everything was just a temporary measure.","He only made it difficult for Uncle Chen and Aunt Chen to meet Qiao Nian. He did not really want to do anything to them. When he achieved his goal, he was naturally willing to compensate them.","In the eyes of businessmen, this was just business.","As long as no one was at a disadvantage in the end, the process did not matter.","Mr. Zhou didn’t notice his arrogant superiority when talking about ordinary people like Uncle Chen and Aunt Chen. It was as if he was born nobler than others because he was rich and powerful.","Qiao Nian’s chest burned with anger. She smiled, but it did not reach her eyes. “Oh? Do you know why Zhou Zheng ended up this way?”","“I heard he injured someone.” Mr. Zhou didn’t mind and immediately said, “I can pay the medical fees, nutrition fees, and work compensation fees. As long as you name it, Miss Qiao, I’ll satisfy all your conditions.”","He only had one goal—he wanted her to let Zhou Zheng go.","However, Qiao Nian gave him a completely different answer. “It’s not about money.”","“Then?” Mr. Zhou did not understand.","What else was there that could not be resolved by money!","Qiao Nian looked at him expressionlessly. “I have some money. It’s enough to spend on the people around me.”","Mr. Zhou was stunned and couldn’t help but frown. “Who would complain about having too much money...”","Qiao Nian sneered but did not refute him. She asked leisurely, “Have you thought that perhaps, I think your Zhou family is not rich enough.”","Mr. Zhou’s expression changed. He looked a little angry, and the way he looked at the girl was a little disgusted now.","After all, he was asking for a favor. He forced himself to maintain his dignity and said with a fake smile, “Miss Qiao, don’t joke around.”","Of course, the Zhou family was rich.","Otherwise, they wouldn’t have connections with the reclusive families.","He felt that Qiao Nian was too young, that she thought she knew everything when the truth was far from it."]},{"number":3367,"title":"Chapter 3367: You Made the Same Choice as Zhou Zheng","paragraphs":["Chapter 3367: You Made the Same Choice as Zhou Zheng","Editor: Atlas Studios","“Just name your price.”","He tried to steer the negotiations back on track, straight to the numbers.","Unexpectedly, Qiao Nian only leaned back in her chair and looked at him with a faint smile, as if he was a joke.","“You can’t afford my price! What if I want 100 billion, one trillion yuan? Are you willing to pay?”","100 billion?","One trillion?","Mr. Zhou became exceptionally angry. He gritted his teeth and reminded her in a low voice, “I’m being sincere!”","It meant that Qiao Nian’s number was too much of a joke.","The total market value of the Zhou family might be as much as Qiao Nian said, but everyone knew that market value was not equivalent to liquid funds.","No one could fork out so much money.","The girl wasn’t well-behaved. She looked like an unreasonable person and didn’t fall for his tricks. Instead, her gaze was penetrating.","Mr. Zhou felt an inexplicable chill. He pursed his lips and softened his expression. “Miss Qiao, you can consider for a moment.”","“Do you think you can still get out?” Qiao Nian asked casually.","Mr. Zhou was stunned by her question and frowned. “My lawyer is on his way here.”","In other words, he could be bailed out when his lawyer arrived.","Unexpectedly, meeting Qiao Nian’s cold eyes, Mr. Zhou suddenly paused and his expression became uneasy.","“What do you mean?”","Qiao Nian couldn’t be bothered to beat around the bush. She stood up and looked down at him. “In your eyes, Aunt Chen and her family might be worse than ants, but here, you’ve broken the law. Your actions have already constituted a crime and incited others to commit a crime. Zhou Zheng will be sentenced to 20 years. Your actions will easily get you two years. I’ll explain this to you in detail when your lawyer comes...”","Mr. Zhou’s expression finally changed drastically. His shoulders trembled and he could not maintain his so-called dignity. His lips were ashen as he looked up at the girl. “Are you trying to push our family into a dead end?!”","“I never pushed you.”","Qiao Nian’s eyes were calm. Only endless darkness and a tyrannical aura burned in them.","“Every injustice has its perpetrator, and every debt has its debtor. The only person I went after was Zhou Zheng. You’ve been in Beijing for a week or two. Have I looked for trouble with you?”","“...”","Qiao Nian had indeed not caused trouble for them. She simply had not met them.","Mr. Zhou tried to speak, but the girl had already lost her patience. “I’ll help you answer your previous question.","“I brought Zhou Zheng back to the country not because he offended me, but because he targeted the people around me. I might have let him off if he went after me. However, he stepped on my bottom line. Don’t blame me for not leaving him a way out, because he didn’t even leave himself a way out. Just like... President Zhou, you made the same choice today!”","Back then, Zhou Zheng had attacked Master Cheng and almost killed him.","Today, Mr. Zhou went after Uncle Chen.","Although he said he didn’t want to do anything to Uncle Chen and Aunt Chen, he had already made his move. How could he have so many plans?","“You think you’re different, all high and mighty. In my eyes, you’re the same as Zhou Zheng. You’re both courting death.”","With that, Qiao Nian ignored his changing expression and walked out of the interrogation room without looking back.","Upon reaching the door, she suddenly stopped."]},{"number":3368,"title":"Chapter 3368: Master Wang: Feel Free to Hire a Lawyer","paragraphs":["Chapter 3368: Master Wang: Feel Free to Hire a Lawyer","Editor: Atlas Studios","Turning around and looking at the middle-aged man who had yet to recover, she casually put her hands in her pockets and asked, “By the way, Zhou Zheng’s second verdict will be out next week. With your current situation, you shouldn’t be able to attend the court hearing. After he goes in, your case will be going through the judicial process.”","Second verdict...","Mr. Zhou’s defense was finally broken.","He grabbed his hair. Although he didn’t want to believe it when Qiao Nian said he couldn’t be bailed out, his sixth sense told him she was telling the truth!","He had crossed the line this time.","His original intention was to force Qiao Nian to meet him and save Zhou Zheng. Who knew that things would develop to this point? Not only did he not rescue his son, he even implicated himself.","He was going to jail for two years...","Mr. Zhou didn’t dare to imagine the consequences.","The girl left the interrogation room calmly, not giving him time to react.","By the time he realized it, he was alone in the room again.","Other than the flickering incandescent lamp above his head, there was nothing else!","However, at this moment, his state of mind changed. This boundless silence was even more tortuous than a direct trial. Mr. Zhou could no longer maintain his rationality. He slammed the table and shouted, “I want to see my lawyer! I want to see my lawyer immediately!”","...","One could see what was going on inside through the transparent glass window, but those inside couldn’t see the other way.","Cai Gang, Ye Wangchuan, and the others watched as Qiao Nian came out. Mr. Zhou’s calm demeanor changed and he started to scream.","Cai Gang asked the person in charge, “What’s going on inside? What’s he doing?”","The young officer was also surprised. He put on his earphones and turned to Cai Gang. “He... he’s making a fuss about wanting to see his lawyer.”","“Oh.” Cai Gang rubbed his eyebrows and looked at Ye Wangchuan worriedly. “I heard the Zhou family’s lawyer has never lost internationally. He’s very skilled. They spent a lot of money to hire him to win domestic lawsuits. This lawyer is also proficient in various national laws. He’s very difficult to deal with...”","Ye Wangchuan stood with them, like a crane among chickens. He didn’t even look up as he asked someone to pour him a glass of water.","Then, he looked at him, calm and relaxed, but also with a hint of nobility. “Let him do whatever he wants. If he wins, I’ll have lived in vain.”","Seeing his nonchalant attitude, Cai Gang knew that no matter how impressive and awesome the Zhou family’s lawyer was, this master had probably prepared an even more impressive and awesome lawyer to fight them.","Moreover, they had a complete chain of evidence that Mr. Zhou had instigated others to commit a crime. This evidence was not something that Mr. Zhou could explain with ‘just giving them a scare’.","This time, the Zhou family had gone for wool and came home shorn. They had implicated themselves.","Cai Gang guessed the other party had misjudged, thinking that Qiao Nian was the kind of person who could be bribed. It seemed he believed that if he gave her enough benefits, they could negotiate.","Hence, he targeted Aunt Chen and her family. He was really being a smart aleck.","Cai Gang was an extremely smart person. He knew what to ask and what not to, so he immediately shut up.","Qiao Nian came out of the interrogation room.","Cai Gang saw Ye Wangchuan pick up the warm water he had just received and hand it to the girl skillfully. No longer lazy and domineering, he frowned at the girl’s tired face. His voice was gentle as he said, “Drink some warm water.”"]},{"number":3369,"title":"Chapter 3369: Not from Rao City or Beijing","paragraphs":["Chapter 3369: Not from Rao City or Beijing","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian took the water and realized that it was still warm. She held the cup to warm her hands and lowered her head to take a small sip. A warm feeling flowed through her stomach, dispelling her frustration with Mr. Zhou.","Then, she slowly said in a hoarse voice, “I don’t think it’s that simple.”","“Huh?” Ye Wangchuan closed the window at the side of the corridor to block the wind and looked at the girl with deep eyes, waiting for her to continue.","Qiao Nian rubbed her fingers against the paper cup and looked up to meet his eyes after a while. “The Zhou family followed us when we came back...”","She asked the key question, “Who told them?”","Ye Wangchuan’s eyes flashed. He had already guessed it but did not want to say it directly. “Don’t you know them?”","Nie Qingru.","Just thinking about this name frustrated Qiao Nian. It was as if a haystack was piled up in her chest. It could be ignited at any time and explode into pieces.","Even Cai Gang could sense that something was wrong between the two of them. He interrupted, “Young Master Ye, Miss Qiao. Do you mean there’s someone behind this?”","However, when he investigated Mr. Zhou, he did not find anyone else behind this.","Cai Gang pondered before saying with a responsible attitude, “Why don’t I check further?”","“There’s no need.”","Qiao Nian finished drinking the water and her eyes calmed as she rejected his kindness.","“It’s not someone we can find in Rao City.”","“Someone from Beijing?” Cai Gang wanted to say that if the person was from Beijing, he also had friends there. However, he looked at Ye Wangchuan and silently raised his hand to shut his mouth.","In terms of connections in Beijing, who could compare to this person?","If Miss Qiao wanted to investigate, Master Wang had no reason not to help.","Unless that person was not from Beijing.","That was what he was thinking.","Sure enough.","Qiao Nian paused for two seconds before saying, “Not from Beijing.”","“Then...” Cai Gang was a little confused.","The person wasn’t from Rao City or Beijing. They couldn’t possibly be from Country M like the Zhou family, right?","It would be difficult to investigate if it involved overseas.","At this moment, Qiao Nian stood up and threw the disposable cup into the trash can beside her. Walking elegantly as if she was not bothered by this matter, she said to Cai Gang, “...Officer Cai, I’ll leave the person inside to you.”","“Don’t worry, Miss Qiao.” Cai Gang immediately stood up straight. “When his lawyer comes, I’ll deal with him as I should.”","“Mm.” Qiao Nian knew he had evidence. She fluttered her eyelashes and looked at Cai Gang with her dark eyes. “I have another matter to trouble you with.”","Trouble him...","Cai Gang felt a huge burden on his shoulders. He stole a quick but not obvious glance at the young man, then immediately said, “Miss Qiao, you’re too polite. Just tell me if there’s anything I can help with.”","“The hospital...”","“Ah!”","Cai Gang was wondering what she wanted help with. Seeing it was about the hospital, he immediately interrupted her and said with a smile, “Don’t worry about Uncle Chen and Aunt Chen. I’ll definitely take good care of them. Also, I’ve sent someone to guard at the hospital. They’ll immediately inform me if anything happens.”","After all, Mr. Zhou’s case was still open. Protecting the victim was also in line with the procedure.","Qiao Nian nodded. “Thank you.”","Cai Gang didn’t dare to accept her thanks in front of Ye Wangchuan. He quickly waved his hand and politely said, “Miss Qiao, we’ve known each other for so long. This is only right of me. You don’t have to take it to heart.”"]},{"number":3370,"title":"Chapter 3370: The Lawyer Is Here","paragraphs":["Chapter 3370: The Lawyer Is Here","Editor: Atlas Studios","“I’ll immediately tell you if anything happens in Rao City in the future.”","He even said, “Don’t worry, I won’t tell Uncle Chen and Aunt Chen that you came back.”","He said everything before Qiao Nian could remind him. She didn’t know what to say now.","At this moment, Ye Wangchuan hooked his arm around her shoulder and said to Cai Gang on her behalf, “Thank you. I’ll remember this favor.”","Although Cai Gang said he was ‘too polite’ and that it was no big deal, he smiled so widely that his eyes couldn’t be seen. It was obvious that he was overjoyed.","Ye Wangchuan had been born into the Ye family and was accustomed to such social occasions. He knew what to say and do on such an occasion.","Cai Gang had indeed helped a lot this time.","It was a favor owed to him indeed.","Cai Gang was perceptive. It was fine as long as he knew the extent of his politeness. If he continued, it would become annoying.","After being polite for a while, he stopped appropriately. He sized them up and carefully suggested, “It’s almost time for lunch. Master Wang, Miss Qiao. Can you do me the honor and let me treat you?”","Qiao Nian looked at the time on her phone and rejected his good intentions. “I think not, I have a plane to catch.”","Cai Gang wanted to politely ask them to stay.","Qiao Nian was different from Ye Wangchuan. She didn’t know how to socialize. She was more direct but also sincere. “Next time. I’ll treat you when you come to Beijing next time.”","Cai Gang swallowed what he was about to say and nodded. He smiled and said, “Alright, I’ll have to trouble Miss Qiao to be my guide next time.”","It wasn’t like he hadn’t been to Beijing before. He had to go there for meetings every year.","Qiao Nian wasn’t a Beijing local.","Cai Gang just made an excuse like a smart person. He just wanted to use this agreement to build a relationship with Qiao Nian.","Ye Wangchuan glanced at him but did not say anything.","Cai Gang’s back was covered in cold sweat from his gaze. Afraid he had said something wrong, he did not dare to say anything else. He regretted his rashness.","Fortunately, Ye Wangchuan quickly looked away and did not seem angry. He said to Qiao Nian, “Let’s go.”","“Mm.”","Qiao Nian put her cell phone in her pocket and adjusted her cap. Half her face was hidden, making her look exceptionally cool.","She gave Cai Gang her number and added him on WeChat before leaving with Ye Wangchuan.","Cai Gang watched them walk away.","He lowered his head and looked at his new friend’s profile picture on WeChat. The corners of his lips curled up uncontrollably. He knew that he had stood on the right side again.","Coincidentally, the assistant walked over at this moment and said, “Officer Cai, the lawyer is here.”","Cai Gang slowly put away his cell phone, straightened his clothes, and called the young police officer in charge of this case. “Let’s go. Follow me to meet the international lawyer!”","**","Madam Zhou waited uneasily in the hall for a long time.","Every second felt like a year to her.","Therefore, even though Cai Gang and the rest did not make her wait long, she shot to her feet upon seeing them.","“Where’s my husband? I want to bail him out.”","Behind her was a blond, blue-eyed, and refined-looking lawyer.","The lawyer held a thick stack of documents as he walked forward to shake Cai Gang’s hand. Then, he forcefully said, “Hello, my client is a citizen of Country M. According to Country M’s laws, we have the right to bail my client out first, and then I’ll contact you.”"]},{"number":3371,"title":"Chapter 3371: Master Wang’s Foresight","paragraphs":["Chapter 3371: Master Wang’s Foresight","Editor: Atlas Studios","Cai Gang’s smile suddenly disappeared.","He was about to bring up the evidence when a calm, smiling voice sounded at the door. “According to Country M’s laws, you can bail out, but this is Country Z.”","A man wearing glasses came in from outside.","It was Su Mo, Yuan Yongqin’s right-hand man.","The man met their surprised gazes and smiled as he shook Cai Gang’s hand. “Young Master Ye called me over.”","Cai Gang shook his hand with a shocked expression. “Uh... that fast?”","The lawyer arranged by Ye Wangchuan had arrived so quickly.","However, the man seemed used to it. He smiled and said, “Young Master Ye contacted Chairman Yuan before he left. Chairman Yuan asked me to come over. I usually handle the Cheng Feng Corporation’s legal matters, but I’ll be representing Young Master Ye this time.”","He had followed Yuan Yongqin as an assistant all these years, he did not seem to be an eye-catching character.","In fact, he was a top student who had graduated from Qing University’s Law Faculty. He once had the chance to go overseas to further his studies, but because his family background was not good, he had no choice but to give up the opportunity.","Later on, when he entered Cheng Feng Corporation, Yuan Yongqin valued him and promoted him to assistant. Yuan Yongqin suggested sending him out to further his studies several times.","Although Su Mo did not go, with his talent and diligence in the law, his research on international law wasn’t inferior to any renowned lawyers.","In recent years, he resolved almost all of Cheng Feng Corporation’s legal disputes with the outside world.","However, he hid behind the scenes and rarely revealed himself, so he wasn’t famous. It could even be said that he did not have a reputation.","Su Mo didn’t know how Young Master Ye knew about him and even contacted Yuan Yongqin.","However, this concerned Qiao Nian, and Yuan Yongqin wanted his help. Of course, he would not disappoint her.","The smile never left Su Mo’s lips as he explained to Cai Gang, then turned to face the international lawyer that the Zhou family had hired, not flustered at all.","He said calmly, “Let’s continue from before. According to international law, the territory of Country Z has to respect Country Z’s laws! On the way here, I’ve already understood the specifics of this case. If you want to talk, we can sit down and talk. If not, we support our international friends to sue at any time!”","He smiled elegantly and adjusted his glasses.","His attitude was as warm as the spring breeze.","But in reality, he was so domineering that even Madam Zhou and the internationally renowned lawyer felt pressured.","Madam Zhou frowned and turned to the lawyer to say they had to bail her husband now, but her lawyer pulled her back and shook his head, indicating that she should not argue.","The blond lawyer knew the law better than Madam Zhou. He knew that the best solution now was to negotiate first and see how much evidence the other party had. In addition, he wanted to see if he could resolve it privately...","In the eyes of all lawyers, making a fuss was the most useless thing to do.","“Let’s talk,” he said.","Su Mo seemed to have expected this. He pointed to a bench in the lounge and gestured for them to sit down.","Up until now, the blond lawyer still had some expectations for Mr. Zhou’s case. He felt that the other party might not have grasped the complete chain of evidence and he could even use Mr. Zhou’s identity and status as leverage.","Half an hour later.","Su Mo was still as calm and rational as when he arrived.","Meanwhile, Madam Zhou’s lawyer was drenched in cold sweat. His lips were pale, and he looked like a defeated rooster."]},{"number":3372,"title":"Chapter 3372: The Zhou Family Is Dead","paragraphs":["Chapter 3372: The Zhou Family Is Dead","Editor: Atlas Studios","In front of him was a large stack of transcripts, photos, recordings, and other evidence.","Each was a complete chain of evidence he had thought the other party would not have!","Su Mo took the warm water from Cai Gang and thanked him. He held it but was not in a hurry to drink it. Instead, he looked coldly at the defeated blond-haired and blue-eyed lawyer. “Being from Country M is not a political or legal amulet. Everyone has to be responsible for their deeds. President Zhou is no exception!”","The blond lawyer looked at him indignantly, but even as he met Su Mo’s calm gaze, he knew he had failed this time.","“We can privately—”","Before he could finish speaking, Su Mo smiled politely and pleasantly interrupted, “My client doesn’t accept any form of settlement.”","That didn’t sound good to Madam Zhou and the internationally renowned lawyer.","The other party did not accept any form of settlement.","—Mr. Zhou must go to jail!","Madam Zhou looked anxiously at her lawyer. However, she saw that the lawyer they had found with great hope was frowning and looking worried. It was obvious he had no solution.","Her eyes finally rolled back and she collapsed in disbelief.","**","“All taken care of?”","They were at the Rao City airport.","Qiao Nian and the rest had just arrived and were about to board the plane.","Ye Wangchuan received the call in front of her. As he walked towards the plane, he said, “We’re preparing to return to Beijing. We’ll have to trouble you over there.”","“It’s not troublesome.”","The caller was Su Mo.","Su Mo called an ambulance for Madam Zhou. After dealing with the chaos at the police station, he finally found an opportunity to call Ye Wangchuan and tell him about the situation.","In the end.","Before Ye Wangchuan hung up, he couldn’t help but ask, “Young Master Ye, if you don’t mind me asking, how did you know that... I’m proficient in international law?”","Ye Wangchuan had already boarded the plane.","Qiao Nian was sitting by the window. He sat beside her and asked the flight attendant to bring a blanket, an eye mask, and earplugs.","Soon, the flight attendant delivered the items to him.","He patiently took out a blanket from the plastic bag and placed it beside the girl’s leg. Then, he handed over the earplug and blindfold. “Sleep once it takes off.”","Qiao Nian looked at the items he had prepared for her. The corners of her lips curled up, and her eyes warmed. Her anxiety dropped.","She took the items and hummed.","Only now did Ye Wangchuan answer Su Mo. “A few years ago when I was doing a background check on Cheng Feng Corporation, I checked on the chairman and those around her as well.”","It was then that he realized that Su Mo was a top student in the law faculty of a famous school. He was an influential figure in school, but his family background wasn’t that good. After entering society, he seemed to have disappeared.","However, he also noticed something.","That was, ever since Yuan Yongqin placed Su Mo in the important position as her assistant, Cheng Feng Corporation had never lost any international disputes.","Coincidentally, Su Mo had studied international law!","He was just good at connecting the information, so he guessed.","Su Mo couldn’t say anything for a long time. “It’s indeed Young Master Ye.”","Ye Wangchuan didn’t say anything. He only asked, “Since you have the ability, why do you keep being an assistant?”","Su Mo was probably unhappy with the investigation or simply wanted to joke with him. He asked in a half-serious tone, “Isn’t Young Master Ye also willing to stay by Miss Qiao’s side forever?”","Ye Wangchuan thought about how Yuan Yongqin had never gotten married and immediately understood.","His eyes flashed and he said lazily, “I’m hanging up.”"]},{"number":3373,"title":"Chapter 3373: Sister Nian: What? Who’s Attracting Anyone?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3373: Sister Nian: What? Who’s Attracting Anyone?","Editor: Atlas Studios","After hanging up, he put down his cell phone and turned his head to see the girl’s bright eyes looking at him.","Qiao Nian met his gaze and asked, “Who were you talking to? I heard Aunt Yuan’s name.”","“Su Mo.” Ye Wangchuan had no intention of hiding it from her. He leaned over and carefully tidied the blanket over her legs, then asked, “Why aren’t you asleep?”","Qiao Nian pressed her hand between her eyebrows. She was a little frustrated. “I was about to sleep when I heard you on the phone...”","Ye Wangchuan couldn’t help but laugh.","In the end, he was the one who kept her up.","Coincidentally, the flight attendant was passing by. He stopped the flight attendant and said in a low and charming voice, “Please help me with that bottle of mineral water.”","“Okay.”","The first-class cabin had an exclusive flight attendant. She immediately went into the cabin and returned with a bottle of water in less than a minute.","She stood at the side and asked considerately, “Is there anything else I can help you with?”","Her gaze lingered on the male and female passengers. At first, she was attracted by Ye Wangchuan’s outstanding appearance and couldn’t take her eyes off him.","Upon seeing Qiao Nian curled up lazily in her seat and preparing to sleep, she felt like she had seen that face somewhere before.","She took a few more glances, trying to remember where she had seen her before.","The girl’s facial features were exquisite and eye-catching. Even though she had a baseball cap, it could not hide her beauty at close range. Her beauty was sharp.","With a kind of unruly arrogance.","The flight attendant’s eyes widened. She wondered which female celebrity in the entertainment industry could match this appearance, but she couldn’t think of anyone.","Could it be a lower-tier celebrity?","Or a talent show idol?","In any case, ordinary people rarely looked like this.","As she stared at Qiao Nian in a daze, the sound of fingers knocking on the table woke her up.","Only then did she notice a pair of sharp eyes looking at her. The eyes were deep, like a deep sea vortex that could suck people in.","“Anything else?”","Ye Wangchuan had already said twice that there was nothing he needed help with. Only then did he realize that the flight attendant had not left and had been staring beside him.","Only then did he knock his knuckles, making a sound to remind her.","As expected, the flight attendant’s face paled. Afraid she would be complained about, she quickly shook her head. A little flustered, she did not care about her image as she hurriedly apologized. “No, nothing. I’m sorry, I’ll leave immediately. I won’t disturb your rest.”","She bowed deeply and walked quickly, afraid she would be stopped. There was a rare trace of panic in her footsteps, and she quickly disappeared from the cabin.","Even Qiao Nian, who was thinking about something, noticed the flight attendant’s abnormal behavior. She raised the corners of her eyes, and her half-closed eyelids were a little sleepy. Clearly, she did not realize that she had been peeped at. “What’s wrong?”","“Tsk.”","Ye Wangchuan placed the mineral water by her side. Then, he leaned back and stretched his long legs. He pressed her baseball cap down a little more to cover her fair and eye-catching oval face before saying, “Goddess Qiao, it’s better to avoid attracting attention outside.”","Qiao Nian could feel his breath. Her heart beat faster, and her body subconsciously heated up. “Huh?”","Attracting attention? Who?","When did she attract anyone?","Ye Wangchuan was amused to see that she was completely unaware. He also felt that it was childish of him to be jealous for no reason."]},{"number":3374,"title":"Chapter 3374: I’m Going to University A to Look for Chen Yuan","paragraphs":["Chapter 3374: I’m Going to University A to Look for Chen Yuan","Editor: Atlas Studios","He touched the top of the girl’s head and changed the topic. “Hurry up and sleep. The air conditioner on the plane is dry. Drink some water when you wake up to moisten your throat.”","Qiao Nian wasn’t easily affected by the outside world. She hadn’t noticed the flight attendant peeking at her previously.","Since Ye Wangchuan said it was nothing, she didn’t overthink and thought it was an issue with him. She put on her eye mask, stuffed earplugs into her ears, and said in a sleepy tone, “I’ll sleep first.”","Ye Wangchuan watched as the girl quickly relaxed. Her breathing was long, and she fell asleep beside him unguarded.","His eyes grew unfocused as he tucked the girl in before sitting up straight and gesturing for the flight attendant to lower her voice.","The flight attendant noticed Qiao Nian sleeping by the window. She didn’t know why she obediently listened to the man’s instructions as she subconsciously softened her footsteps.","The plane pierced through the clouds from a height of 90,000 feet and arrived at the capital’s international airport four hours later.","Qiao Nian left for Rao City in a hurry and thus did not bring any luggage, so she naturally left after getting off the plane. There was no need to wait for her luggage.","They left the airport together.","After hailing a taxi by the roadside, Qiao Nian turned to Ye Wangchuan and said, “I’m going to look for Chen Yuan. You can go back first.”","“You don’t want me to go with you?” Ye Wangchuan asked as he stood by the roadside and watched as she opened the taxi’s back door.","Qiao Nian threw her bag in first before turning to him. “No need. I’ll tell him about the Zhou family. Otherwise, he’ll always be thinking about home and refuse to study.”","She knew that Aunt Chen’s lifelong wish was for Chen Yuan to study hard, have a degree, and not have to set up a street stall like her.","They had to pack up and leave once the enforcement officers arrived.","It was too tiring a living.","Due to the crisis in Rao City, Chen Yuan had also returned. With his personality, even if he returned to Beijing obediently, he probably would not be able to focus on his studies.","In order to reassure Uncle Chen and Aunt Chen, she did not go to the hospital to visit.","However, that did not mean she wouldn’t care about Chen Yuan.","“I’ll be back soon.” Qiao Nian had already gotten into the taxi, but she did not close the door. She asked, “How are you going back? Where’s Gu San?”","Seeing that she had finally remembered him, Ye Wangchuan smiled and deliberately said, “I thought you were coming with me, so I didn’t ask Gu San to pick us up.”","Qiao Nian was stunned. She didn’t expect that. She reached for her cell phone with a frown. “Why don’t I call him for you?”","Then, she felt she was a little too heartless and moved farther inside before saying, “You’re going to Rhine? Why don’t I drop you off first? I’m not in a hurry, anyway.”","University A and Rhine Apartment were in two directions.","If she sent Ye Wangchuan back and turned around to go to University A, it would take at least two hours due to the traffic jam in Beijing.","Ye Wangchuan was just joking with her. He didn’t really want her to go back and forth. “Qin Si is free. I’ll get him to pick me up.”","He placed his hand on the car door and closed it for Qiao Nian. “Go do what you need to do. Find me when you’re done.”","Qiao Nian watched as he made a ‘call me’ gesture from outside. Then, he knocked on the driver’s window and said, “To University A.”","The taxi driver waited for a long time before his passenger was ready to set off. Naturally, he responded by stepping on the accelerator without saying a word.","Only the exhaust of the car was left behind."]},{"number":3375,"title":"Chapter 3375: Young Master Qi Has Always Wanted Your Approval","paragraphs":["Chapter 3375: Young Master Qi Has Always Wanted Your Approval","Editor: Atlas Studios","Ye Wangchuan watched as the taxi disappeared around the corner of the road. Then, he called Qin Si and said proudly, “Where are you? Come pick me up.”","**","In a simple European-style manor villa.","“The Zhou family is gone?”","A woman was wearing a wide top hat. The brim seemed to fly out, and jewelry and exquisite gauze hung on the edge.","The retro-styled lady was no longer young. Although she had taken good care of herself, the densely packed fine lines around the corners of her eyes betrayed her age.","However, her skin was extremely fair, and her temperament was noble and graceful. Her eyes were deep and shrewd, causing people to ignore the sense of age brought about by her appearance and pay more attention to her aura.","In front of her was the afternoon tea the servant had just brought over.","The tea set was exquisite porcelain with platinum patterns, the teacup filled with Earl Black Tea, a Westerner’s favorite, and a few exquisite snacks at the side.","There were not many, but they were obviously expensive and exquisite.","Nie Qingru picked up a biscuit and looked at the man in black kneeling in front of her. Her eyes became even more sinister and cold. “I’m asking you a question. Can’t you hear me?”","The atmosphere suddenly turned cold.","The servant carefully lowered his presence.","The man kneeling in front of her was Shadow.","“I’m asking you, is the Zhou family gone?”","“Yes.”","He had lost weight, and his face grew haggard. There was a circle of green under his eyes, and it was obvious that he had not rested well recently.","Ever since Nie Qixing ‘accidentally’ died, he couldn’t sleep well. Every time he closed his eyes, he would remember Nie Qixing asking him with despair in the dark and dilapidated old hotel about who wanted his life.","Then, he said it was Qiao Nian.","And yet...","Nie Qingru could tell he was distracted. She crushed the biscuit between her fingers, causing the crumbs to fall.","The atmosphere in the villa became even more solemn.","She picked up the towel on the table and wiped the biscuit crumbs accidentally stuck to her fingertips with narrowed eyes. Then, she asked the man kneeling before her teasingly, “Do you still hate me?”","Shadow shook and looked up.","Meeting Nie Qingru’s emotionless eyes, he lowered his head in embarrassment. “I wouldn’t dare.”","“You don’t dare, it’s not that you don’t hate.” Nie Qingru was clear about this. She smiled and threw away the towel, muttering, “I won’t regret it. You should know well what I’ve experienced to get to where I am today. As long as I give him a chance, I’ll bury the fruit of my life’s hard work. I’ve even sacrificed my only daughter. What else can’t I sacrifice?”","Shadow fell silent.","Nie Qingru needed him to work for her wholeheartedly, so she patiently said, “You’ve been by my side for so long. You know that I wouldn’t give up on him unless I had no choice. But he was really too disappointing! No matter how I tried to lead him, he still disappointed me time after time.","“How many times have I told him that Qiao Nian is just a rotten stone? He’s going to inherit my position in the future and be the Nie family’s successor. His future is limitless... I told him not to go head-on with Qiao Nian.","“But he never took my words to heart. He always tried to be smart behind my back.”","Nie Qingru’s tone was uncontrollably filled with hostility.","Shadow pursed his lips with his head lowered. “Young Master Qi has always wanted your approval.”"]},{"number":3376,"title":"Chapter 3376: Hurry Up and Investigate What’s Going On in the Independent Continent","paragraphs":["Chapter 3376: Hurry Up and Investigate What’s Going On in the Independent Continent","Editor: Atlas Studios","Nie Qixing had been by Nie Qingru’s side since he was young, and Nie Qingru had always been very strict with him.","As time passed, he loved, respected, and feared Nie Qingru. He even developed an obsession with her, craving her acknowledgment.","Wasn’t Nie Qingru’s resistance to Qiao Nian also a form of recognition?","It wasn’t without reason that Nie Qixing was jealous and twisted.","The last trace of gentleness in Nie Qingru’s eyes disappeared. She looked at him coldly for a few seconds before questioning him emotionlessly, “So you still think I’m wrong?”","Shadow didn’t say “I don’t dare” this time. He felt conflicted and painful. He raised his head and looked at the woman sitting at the head of the table.","Originally, he had thousands of words he wanted to say to her.","However, when he looked at the other party’s old face and emotionless eyes, he swallowed them all back and only said, “I understand the Empress’s choice.”","He knew her better than anyone.","Understood the suffering she had gone through more than anyone.","So even now, he couldn’t blame her for making the wrong choice.","However, Nie Qixing still called him Uncle Ning, after all. He was really upset that he had died at such a young age.","Nie Qingru never looked back at her decision. Hearing him say that he understood, her expression softened. She picked up the black tea and took a sip before suddenly asking, “Have you found that woman?”","“Not yet.”","Shadow immediately replied, “That person seems to have disappeared. I can’t find her no matter what. Besides, Zhou Zheng is in Qiao Nian’s hands, so I can’t ask him...”","“Hmph.” Nie Qingru put down the teacup, almost spilling its contents. The corners of her mouth curled up mysteriously as she sneered. “She’s quite capable. She can still escape after causing such a disaster. Continue investigating!”","Even though she had personally chosen to give up on Nie Qixing, she had not forgotten the reason why she was forced to make this decision!","She couldn’t let those old men from the Privy Council have the upper hand. At the very least, she had to find someone to bear the responsibility this time.","The woman who caused the trouble was the best vent.","Although she knew that Nie Qixing had forcefully kept that woman by his side and that she had not voluntarily caused trouble... So what?","Nie Qingru’s long nails scraped across the table, making an unpleasant cracking sound.","Shadow understood her thoughts and immediately answered, “Yes, Empress.”","Nie Qingru quickly composed herself and asked him, “Have you investigated the independent continent? What’s going on with Ji Lingfeng?”","Shadow answered quickly, “Not yet. Our people are still investigating.”","“Okay.” Nie Qingru also knew that the situation in the independent continent was complicated, and it was even harder to interfere in the Ji family’s internal affairs. She wasn’t in a hurry and only urged, “Tell them to investigate faster. Don’t let that evil creature beat us to it this time!”","“Yes.”","After a short conversation r, Shadow left in a hurry.","Nie Qingru was left alone in the villa. The light dyed her eyebrows. Under the light, her already sharp and unreasonable eyebrows looked even more cold and gloomy.","Nie Qingru recalled the news she had just received in the afternoon.","The corners of her lips curled up into a cold arc before falling heavily again. She closed her eyes, and her face quickly regained its cold expression.","That evil creature’s way of doing things... was really becoming more and more like Ji Wusun!","According to her plan, the Zhou family could still delay her for a few days, but now it seemed they couldn’t delay her any longer.","“Useless thing!”","Nie Qingru was furious at the thought that Mr. Zhou was the one who provoked the evil spawn’s relatives in Rao City. Her brows furrowed tightly. Seeing Madam Zhou’s call, she was unwilling to answer it. She threw the cell phone aside and went back to her room."]},{"number":3377,"title":"Chapter 3377: Sister Nian: I’m Alright","paragraphs":["Chapter 3377: Sister Nian: I’m Alright","Editor: Atlas Studios","Zhou Zheng’s second verdict was soon out.","It was still 20 years and three months, upholding the original sentence.","On the day the verdict was out, Madam Zhou and the international lawyer that the Zhou family had spent a lot of money on had ugly expressions on their faces.","An application for a final judgment was filed.","Usually, as long as a case passed the final judgment, it was practically settled. If nothing went wrong, the verdict wouldn’t be changed.","The weather in Beijing in mid-September was bad.","It had rained through the night. When they came out of the court in the morning, the sky outside was still so gloomy that it looked like it was going to rain, as cold winds blew.","Qiao Nian left the court with Qin Si and the others after the trial ended. She was walking down the stairs when a voice stopped her.","“Stop right there!”","Qiao Nian slowly stopped and turned around to see Madam Zhou, who had broken free from the lawyer’s hold and was walking towards her with a dark expression.","“F*ck, what does she want?” Qin Si cursed before saying to the girl, “Sister Qiao, leave with Master Wang first. I’ll stop this crazy woman.”","As he spoke, he turned to look at the arrogant man beside him and did not forget to urge him. “Master Wang, take Sister Qiao away first.”","Many reporters gathered outside the court, all waiting for the second verdict to come out.","Although the reporters didn’t dare to block them, they set up their cameras and live streams a few steps away and dutifully captured the news.","Zhou Zheng’s identity was special, and this case involved a master like Master Cheng. It wasn’t strange for people to pay attention to him.","However, the reporters were more obedient than the netizens.","They knew the license plates of the cars parked outside the court today were not ordinary. Only a few people in Beijing could use number plates with repeated or running numbers. They could count them with one hand. No matter which one it was, they weren’t people they could afford to offend.","Moreover, they had vaguely received the news before that the Ye family was behind this case.","Anyone with half a brain wouldn’t bump into them. The reporters knew the Ye family’s habits, so they tactfully took photos from afar.","They knew very well what to report and what not to report.","No one wanted to make trouble for themselves.","Qin Si also knew that with Ye Wangchuan around, the reporters below did not dare to write nonsense. However, Qiao Nian was famous online, after all.","He was still afraid that some stupid reporters would take photos of her being pestered at the court’s entrance. Most importantly, he was afraid that Madam Zhou would go crazy and say something she should not say, such as the reclusive families...","Ye Wangchuan signaled the girl with his eyes.","Qiao Nian didn’t move. She only tugged at her baseball cap with her fair hand, looking lazy. “Let’s see what she wants to do.”","“You want to run? Not so easy!” Madam Zhou walked very quickly in her anger. In a few steps, she was already in front of them, blocking the way of Qiao Nian and the rest.","She seemed to have aged a few years overnight. There was a layer of black aura lingering between her brows. The dark purple under her eyes was heavy, and her lips were dry and cracked.","If not for her bossy expression, it would have been very difficult to associate her with her high-spirited appearance in Rao City.","“Speak.”","Madam Zhou glared at her. “Qiao Nian, are you very smug?”","The girl seemed to know how to anger people to death. She let out a lazy “Ah” and her clear eyes met Madam Zhou’s.","Then, Madam Zhou heard an angry voice.","“... I’m alright!”","—— ‘Are you very smug?’","——’I’m alright.’"]},{"number":3378,"title":"Chapter 3378: I’m Waiting to See Your Downfall One Day","paragraphs":["Chapter 3378: I’m Waiting to See Your Downfall One Day","Editor: Atlas Studios","A string in Madam Zhou’s mind almost snapped. Fortunately, she clenched her fists tightly and relied on the pain to retain a trace of rationality.","Her gaze was like a venomous snake’s as she opened her mouth and stuck out her tongue.","“You won’t be smug for long! The people from the reclusive families have already targeted you. You killed her successor. The Empress won’t let you off!”","These words were like a curse.","Madam Zhou wished she could curse her to death. It was better than seeing Qiao Nian’s sloppy face, as if she did not care about anything.","“She’s not someone to be trifled with. Back then, she could even kill her own daughter. And you caused her to lose all her face. Do you think she’ll let you off?!”","Madam Zhou tried to lift the corners of her lips into a disdainful smile.","She looked at Qiao Nian as if she was looking at a dead person. Her eyes were filled with disdain and sympathy.","“Do you think Zhou Zheng’s imprisonment will destroy the Zhou family?","“Let me tell you, in the future, you will only be a hundred times worse off than Zhou Zheng, a thousand times worse off than us... I’m waiting to see you make a fool of yourself!”","Qin Si’s eyebrows moved slightly, and he was about to retort when he heard the girl’s indifferent question, “Are you done?”","Madam Zhou’s smile froze when she heard her calm voice. However, her eyes were still filled with mockery. “You don’t have to pretend with me.”","“This is also what I want to say to you.” Qiao Nian really did not understand how they could have the cheek to question her time and time again.","Mr. Zhou was like this.","This woman was the same.","They were clearly the ones in the wrong, but when asked to bear the consequences, it was as if they had become the victims.","He came to look for her righteously.","Provocation after provocation, including verbal attacks.","She had never spoiled anyone.","Since Madam Zhou had come knocking on her door to talk about Nie Qingru, she might as well make things clear to her face-to-face.","“She ignored you, didn’t she?”","Qiao Nian’s nonchalant tone revealed that she had long seen through everything. Her words were like a sharp needle stabbing into Madam Zhou’s heart, instantly provoking her.","The eyes of the woman who had been showing off to her just now flickered. She actually did not dare to look Qiao Nian in the eye. Her eyes drifted, and her voice lowered. “What? I don’t know what you’re talking about.”","“Heh.” Qiao Nian couldn’t be bothered to waste time with her and concisely said, “Since the reclusive families and the Empress are so powerful, why did she ask you to come to Beijing to cause trouble without ensuring your safety?”","Madam Zhou’s face paled. Thinking of something, she clenched her fists and glared at the girl. It was as if she had not only exposed her expectations but also her hopes for the future.","“I didn’t contact the Empress at all!”","She could only rely on vicious curses to feel at ease. “I’ll wait to see the day you fall! Qiao Nian, you’ll be even worse off than Zhou Zheng! Not only you but the people around you will also be dragged down. Just like Master Cheng, they’ll also suffer because of you. They’ll all be injured and lose their lives for you. You’re a jinx. Just watch!”","Ye Wangchuan had originally wanted to let Qiao Nian handle Madam Zhou alone. He had even stopped Qin Si from getting involved.","Until this moment.","His gaze suddenly darkened, and it was as if a storm had gathered around him. The air turned a few degrees colder, and he interrupted Madam Zhou, who was about to go crazy. “Madam Zhou, don’t forget that your son still has a final trial... 20 years is just a normal sentence. If the situation is serious, it’s not illegal to give him a life sentence or a death sentence.”"]},{"number":3379,"title":"Chapter 3379: Master Wang: Apologize to My Girlfriend","paragraphs":["Chapter 3379: Master Wang: Apologize to My Girlfriend","Editor: Atlas Studios","“...”","Madam Zhou abruptly stopped. Her pupils shook violently as she suddenly looked at him.","Ye Wangchuan was wearing a light blue shirt today. Blue was a pure and clean color that suited him very well.","He looked arrogant and noble, and there was even a unique gentleness in his eyes.","However, those familiar with him knew.","It would be fine if Ye Wangchuan did not smile. But if he looked gentle and easy to talk to, it would often be the time when he was the least approachable.","At this time, those who bumped into the muzzle would not have a good ending.","Even Qin Si, Bo Jingxing, and the others would hide 80 feet away every time they saw his expression. They tried their best not to burn themselves and become that unlucky person.","“You’re right about something.” Ye Wangchuan’s voice was faint.","Madam Zhou trembled, and her heart inexplicably thumped. “W-What?”","“The Zhou family won’t fall just because Zhou Zheng went to jail.” He actually curled his thin lips. His thin eyelids were slightly raised, and his eyes were dark and deep. There seemed to be a layer of thick fog on them, making it impossible to pry into the emotions inside.","Qin Si was attracted and involuntarily looked over.","What was Master Wang trying to say? Why was he still trying to leave her hanging?","Ye Wangchuan looked at Madam Zhou, who had a much weaker aura, and said slowly and seriously, “But if you appear in front of her again, I guarantee that the Zhou family will go bankrupt tomorrow.”","Madam Zhou’s lips trembled. She opened her mouth, but her fear did not allow her to utter a word. She felt that the man in front of her was not joking. He was serious!","“One more thing.”","Ye Wangchuan looked down at her.","“Apologize to my girlfriend.”","Madam Zhou’s heart skipped a beat and she blurted out, “Why should I?”","Her expression immediately turned regretful, but she refused to admit defeat because of her pride.","Ye Wangchuan was quite polite. Even at this time, he still talked calmly. He only looked at the court’s solemn door. Retracting his gaze, he noticed the Zhou family’s lawyer rushing over from the corner of his eye.","“You were just suspected of provocation and causing trouble in public. If I call the police now, according to the law, you can be detained for 10 days to half a month.”","Madam Zhou’s face turned green.","“10 days to half a month is enough for President Zhou to go to court and Zhou Zheng to start serving his sentence. Why? Don’t you want to be around for President Zhou?”","Killing people’s hearts!","With just a few words, Madam Zhou’s insufferably arrogant face was smashed into pieces.","Madam Zhou’s face turned from red to green to white. In the end, it turned ashen. She was shocked, furious, and angry. Trembling, she pointed at Ye Wangchuan. “You!”","She no longer hated Qiao Nian.","She had completely forgotten about her. Now, she was almost angered to death by Ye Wangchuan.","Fortunately, the Zhou family’s lawyer rushed over in time to hold her shoulders and quickly pulled her aside to calm her down. He also explained the pros and cons to her.","Although Madam Zhou was furious, after the lawyer explained the pros and cons, she knew that her plan to use the reporters to scold Qiao Nian had failed.","Moreover, she could be jailed for a few days if caught red-handed.","Madam Zhou felt a sharp pain in her head. However, to be able to attend her husband’s interrogation in a few days, she gritted her teeth, walked to the girl like a puppet, lowered her arrogant head, and said, “I’m sorry. I was spouting nonsense just now. Don’t take it to heart.”","She said she was sorry, but she looked as if she had suffered a huge grievance and was not sincere at all."]},{"number":3380,"title":"Chapter 3380: Master Wang Is Always One Step Ahead","paragraphs":["Chapter 3380: Master Wang Is Always One Step Ahead","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian couldn’t be bothered about her apology, to begin with, let alone argue about her sincerity.","However, Ye Wangchuan helped her get justice. She felt a trace of comfort and warmth in her heart.","Not even looking at Madam Zhou, she turned to Ye Wangchuan, Qin Si, and the rest and said, “Let’s go back.”","She started walking, and her wilful back view could not care less about the cameras and spotlights.","Her posture was quite arrogant.","Madam Zhou watched as they left, leaving her standing alone. Finally, she straightened her back, gritted her teeth, and said to the lawyer, “Let’s go too!”","**","Ye Wangchuan got into the car and called Wen Ruxia.","“We ran into some trouble at the court’s entrance. The reporters should have taken some photos. Please help me erase them. Don’t let anyone post them.”","“Since when did Young Master Ye care about these things?”","The Wen and Ye families had never been on good terms.","However, now that the relationship between the Wei and Ye families had eased, Wen Ruxia was considered to be on cordial terms with Ye Wangchuan and the rest because of Nie Mi.","Although there was a difference of more than 10 years between them, Wen Ruxia still habitually treated him as her peer.","She didn’t dare to treat Ye Wangchuan as a second-generation heir like her nephew, Wen Ziyu.","After all, he was the most outstanding one among Beijing’s younger generation. Wen Ruxia had a good impression of Ye Wangchuan, so she asked this out of curiosity.","Unexpectedly, Ye Wangchuan gave her face and answered honestly, “Nian Nian is here too.”","“Okay.” Wen Ruxia’s smile instantly disappeared as she understood what he meant. Her expression became resolute and capable. “I’ll keep an eye on today’s news. Don’t worry, I definitely won’t let anything that shouldn’t be leaked be released.”","Qiao Nian was considered a big hit now.","She was extremely popular online.","Although she had rarely appeared in public as Zhui Guang or the gem of Qing University in the past year, her popularity was still very much present online.","Any small news related to her would easily cause discussion.","The discussions in the niche circles could easily become trending topics and then become big news.","Wen Ruxia knew that Qiao Nian was on the independent continent before with important matters. Under such circumstances, the less popular she was, the better.","“The song...” After Wen Ruxia agreed to help, she remembered asking the girl for help through Nie Mi.","Halfway through her sentence, she supported her chin with her hand and smiled again. “Forget it. I’ll tell her myself when the time comes.”","She was asking about the progress of Qiao Nian’s new song.","Ye Wangchuan hung up on her.","Wen Ruxia called her assistant through the office line and instructed him to go to the media group to inform them not to post this morning’s news.","Fortunately, she had reminded him early.","A few small websites wanted to use Qiao Nian to gain traffic. They were about to secretly upload the video they had taken at the court’s entrance this morning.","It wasn’t to sensationalize her.","Rather, they hoped that the people would start to keep tabs on this case through increased views on their websites and social media accounts. It was simply to gain popularity for their other news.","Wen Ruxia had an extraordinary status in the news industry.","Her warning was very effective.","The few small websites that had originally wanted to take the risk to ride on the popularity stopped. They deleted the video of Madam Zhou mentioning the reclusive families and her argument with Qiao Nian. They only reported the second verdict of this case...","**","Ye Wangchuan had the foresight to call Wen Ruxia and ask her to settle the reporters before Gu San drove them back to Rhine."]},{"number":3381,"title":"Chapter 3381: Phone Call from the Independent Continent","paragraphs":["Chapter 3381: Phone Call from the Independent Continent","Editor: Atlas Studios","After Qiao Nian returned, she sat in the corner of the sofa and played with her cell phone as if sending someone a message.","“Sister Qiao, do you think the Zhou family will cause trouble again?” Qin Si did not even hear her speak.","She had been playing with her cell phone with her head lowered all this time. The white light from the phone screen shone on her black eyelashes, making her skin look fairer.","Qin Si rambled on for a long time, but Qiao Nian did not reply.","He looked at her and saw her leaning against the sofa with her legs crossed, surrounded by a cynical aura, as if she had not heard him.","A little sad, he couldn’t help but shout, “Sister Qiao, did you hear what I said?”","Qiao Nian had just replied to Ji Nan’s message and barely found the pocket of time. She glanced at him with clear eyes and casually said, “Oh. What are you talking about?”","“...”","She put down her cell phone and was quite polite. “I didn’t hear you. Why don’t you repeat it?”","“...”","She did not listen at all!","Qin Si didn’t even have the strength to be angry anymore. He waved his hand and weakly said, “I’m fine.”","Qiao Nian looked at him seriously.","Qin Si looked like he had nothing to say. She took it he was really fine. Humming, she looked down at Ji Nan’s message.","[J: I’m not sure either.]","[J: I haven’t seen him since he came back.]","Qiao Nian quickly scanned the message before frowning slightly. Her expression became serious. Then, she stood up and walked towards the staircase.","“You can’t call here? There’s no signal? That’s impossible.” Qin Si looked at her in surprise and did not forget to look at the signal on his cell phone.","Sure enough.","The bar was full.","Qiao Nian pressed her slender fingers between her eyebrows and didn’t explain herself. She only said, “I’ll ask about the independent continent first before letting you know.”","Fiddling with his cell phone, Qin Sin immediately understood after her explanation.","Hence, he tactfully said, “Alright, go ahead.”","Qiao Nian went upstairs to call Ji Nan.","...","In the kitchen.","Gu San had just made a pot of tea. He brought it to the living room to see Qin Si alone.","He bent down to put the tea set on the coffee table before curiously asking, “Master Wang went to the study to report the results of the second hearing to the Old Master. Where’s Miss Qiao? Why isn’t she here?”","Qin Si sighed faintly and pouted towards the second floor. “She’s also on the phone.”","Gu San placed a cup of tea in front of him, his face full of curiosity. However, although curious, he restrained himself from asking.","Qin Si was someone who couldn’t hold it in. In addition, Gu San was one of them, to begin with, so he did not have any scruples when he spoke.","“About the independent continent.”","“Independent continent?”","Gu San was slightly surprised.","Could it be that something had happened in the independent continent again?","Qin Si had been to the independent continent a few times, but he didn’t have any power there. He didn’t know much about the independent continent, only some knowledge.","His handsome face wasn’t as cheeky as usual. Instead, it was serious and dignified as he picked up the teacup that Gu San prepared for him. He looked at the tea leaves floating on the surface before saying, “I’m afraid that old witch can’t sit still anymore.”","Gu San was stunned before realizing the identity of the “old witch”. He immediately lowered his eyes and stopped listening."]},{"number":3382,"title":"Chapter 3382: I Haven’t Seen Him Until Now","paragraphs":["Chapter 3382: I Haven’t Seen Him Until Now","Editor: Atlas Studios","On the second floor.","“What’s going on?”","Qiao Nian had already called Ji Nan and closed the door.","Her voice had a calming power. Even though they were thousands of miles apart, Ji Nan still calmed down upon hearing her voice.","“He came back a week ago. The news of his return quickly spread throughout the entire independent continent. I rushed home upon receiving the news but didn’t see him. I didn’t care at that time. After all, he had just returned. He must have a lot of things to deal with, so I went back first.”","After pulling out a chair and sitting down, Qiao Nian lowered her eyes and asked, “Then?”","“Then the next day, the third day... and every day after that, I went to the old residence to look for him, but without exception, I was stopped by his people. Until now, I haven’t seen him.”","Ji Nan couldn’t describe his complicated feelings.","He was now answering Qiao Nian’s call in the car outside the old residence. “It’s not just me. He hasn’t seen anyone for more than a week. You know that during his absence, some people have caused a lot of trouble because of their seniority... Logically speaking, he’d have dealt with these people already. But he didn’t do anything to them. In short... it’s very strange!”","Qiao Nian’s eyes flickered as she twirled the copper lighter in her hand. She agreed with him. “It’s indeed strange.”","Ji Lingfeng had been back for a week but didn’t show up or see anyone. He didn’t even see Ji Nan. This was very strange...","However, she couldn’t read Ji Lingfeng’s mind. Just like Ji Nan, she didn’t know what Ji Lingfeng was up to.","“By the way, when are you coming back?” Ji Nan already knew Qiao Nian was his cousin. Although they used to be buddies in the past, now that she had become his sister, he wasn’t any more at ease. It actually felt a little unnatural when they talked about life and daily matters.","He was the kind of person who wanted to show some concern but did not know where to start.","He choked on it and wondered if Qiao Nian would misunderstand and think he was too cold.","In short, Ji Nan had yet to figure out how to treat her now.","Qiao Nian turned on the lighter. Blue flames darted out of it, dancing dangerously.","Her exquisite face looked a little tired. Her eyes were half-closed, and there was not much emotion in her voice.","“In a few days.","“...I still have some things to wrap up here. I’ll go back when the results are out.”","She was talking about Zhou Zheng’s final judgment.","Ye Wangchuan had said it before.","The nature of Zhou Zheng’s case was bad. That would shorten the time between trials and speed up the final trial.","Needless to say, this was definitely Old Master Ye’s doing.","It would take about 8 to 10 days.","Ji Nan did not urge her to come back. After a moment of silence, he suddenly asked, “I’ve heard a lot of news about you in the independent continent recently. Did you go against her?”","“Huh? Who?” Qiao Nian did not understand what he meant.","The main thing was that she did not think in that direction.","Ji Nan simply said, “Your grandmother.”","The relationship between the previous generation of the Ji family was very melodramatic and complicated, causing this generation to be a mess.","For example, since Nie Qingru and Ji Wusun were legally married, they only had one daughter, Ji Qing.","As the current Patriarch of the Ji family, Ji Lingfeng was only an illegitimate son of Ji Wusun’s mistress.","If not for the fact that Nie Qingru had fallen ill during childbirth and was unable to bear another child, Ji Lingfeng wouldn’t have been brought back to the family with his status.","Later on, when Ji Wusun brought Ji Lingfeng back to the Ji family and named him under Nie Qingru’s name, he lied, saying he had a child with her before marriage."]},{"number":3383,"title":"Chapter 3383: The Ji Family’s Complicated Relationship","paragraphs":["Chapter 3383: The Ji Family’s Complicated Relationship","Editor: Atlas Studios","As Ji Lingfeng’s only son, Ji Nan should call Nie Qingru ‘Grandma’.","However, according to blood ties, Qiao Nian was the only one in the Ji family who was truly related to her. Only Qiao Nian had her blood flowing through her veins.","Hence, Ji Nan said ‘your grandmother’ and not ‘our grandmother’.","Qiao Nian frowned, looking like she wasn’t in a good mood. “I guess you can say we’re not on good terms.”","“You...” Ji Nan didn’t expect her to admit it so readily. For a moment, he didn’t know how to persuade her. After a while, he said, “You’re related to her by blood. She’s one of the few elders alive. You should communicate with her properly. With your relationship, there’s no need to cause such a scene. I heard you even forced the younger brother she raised to death? Was that for... Auntie?”","At first, Ji Nan couldn’t bring himself to say ‘Auntie’, but he felt it wasn’t that difficult after saying it.","He thought there was only a common misunderstanding between Nie Qingru and Qiao Nian.","For example, Nie Qingru doted on her younger brother too much and did not treat Qiao Nian and Qiao Nian’s mother well. That was why Qiao Nian attacked Nie Qixing.","Ji Nan himself felt that this reason was a little ridiculous. Qiao Nian wasn’t the kind of person to find fault with such a small matter.","However, Ji Nan thought about it and realized Qiao Nian was still young. It was not impossible...","“The outside world doesn’t know about your relationship, but you should know. Why don’t you talk to her properly? There’s no need to make such a fuss.”","On one hand, he advised Qiao Nian because he didn’t know about Ji Qing. On the other hand, he sincerely advised Qiao Nian since Nie Qingru only had Qiao Nian as her descendant.","With Nie Qingru’s status, there were only benefits and no disadvantages for Qiao Nian to build a good relationship with her.","That was why Ji Nan persuaded her.","“Of course, I’m just saying. The decision is still yours. No matter your choice, I’ll be on your side.”","This was what he wanted to say the most.","It was also when he was on the brink of death that Ji Lingfeng forced him to swear that he would take good care of his sister and make up for his regrets!","Qiao Nian felt frustrated upon hearing Nie Qingru’s name. However, upon hearing Ji Nan’s detailed plans for her, her frustration was gently soothed.","She rubbed the lighter and watched the flames burn and extinguish. Finally, she slowly said, “The conflict between us is deeper than you think.”","“You guys...”","“I haven’t investigated thoroughly yet. I’ll tell you when I do.” Qiao Nian interrupted him. Her tone sounded normal.","Ji Nan vaguely sensed that the inside story was very complicated, so he did not continue on this topic and instead asked about her life.","They chatted briefly before Ji Nan stopped talking. It seemed like someone was looking for him.","“I’ll call you later.”","He spoke briefly before hurriedly hung up.","Qiao Nian slowly put down her phone and put the lighter back into her sweater pocket. She frowned, recalling what Ji Nan told her about Ji Lingfeng’s situation. The more she thought about it, the stranger she felt. Hence, she sent Jian Jin a message.","[Q: What’s going on with Ji Lingfeng?]","There was no response from the other party, probably because Jian Jin had not seen the message.","Qiao Nian picked up the things on the table and got up."]},{"number":3384,"title":"Chapter 3384: You Have to Be Patient If You Want to Catch Prey, You Can’t Alert the Enemy","paragraphs":["Chapter 3384: You Have to Be Patient If You Want to Catch Prey, You Can’t Alert the Enemy","Editor: Atlas Studios","Illegal District, Tian Chen’s HQ.","It wasn’t that Jian Jin didn’t see Qiao Nian’s message. Instead, she read the message immediately after Qiao Nian sent it.","However, after reading the message, Jian Jin’s expression became complicated and depressed. She didn’t reply for now.","Only the sound of pens scratching could be heard in the huge office on the top floor.","Jian Jin stared at her cell phone. After a long time, she took a deep breath, put the phone away, and looked at the man behind the desk.","“Qiao has asked me.”","The man sitting behind the black and dull desk looked outstanding. His aura wasn’t inferior to Ye Wangchuan’s, and he had a fragile beauty.","Compared to Ye Wangchuan’s arrogance, he looked more gentle.","Unfortunately, it was just his appearance.","Lu Zhi wasn’t gentle at all. Instead, he was the other extreme of gentleness—extremely cruel.","The pen stopped when he heard the word ‘Qiao’. He only paused for a few seconds before going back to the documents. It was as if he didn’t care about her. “She’s asking you, not me.”","Look at what he was saying!","If not for growing up with him, Jian Jin wouldn’t have been able to tell he was interested in the girl.","Jian Jin tried her best to sound calm as she spoke. “Qiao will definitely be sad if she finds out about Ji Lingfeng’s situation.”","Lu Zhi put down his pen and looked up at her expressionlessly. His smile was gone, and he looked as cold as he could. “Does it have anything to do with me?”","Jian Jin choked on her words and took a deep breath before continuing. “You’re not going to help?”","Sitting in the wheelchair, Lu Zhi placed his hands quietly on his knees. A blanket covered his legs, which were practically dead.","He lowered his eyelashes and gripped the blanket until the veins on the back of his hand bulged, as if he was restraining himself. “She’ll come to me for help if she really can’t hold on.”","“...”","Jian Jin didn’t know how to criticize him. She asked speechlessly, “Do you think with Qiao’s personality, she would ask you for help?”","With Qiao Nian’s personality, even if she caused a ruckus with Nie Qingru... she probably would not ask the Boss for help. But he didn’t even consider that.","The point was—Qiao wasn’t like that!","In this aspect, Boss’s rival understood much more than him. He never did such things.","However, because Boss was physically disabled, his personality became twisted and stubborn in this aspect. He was stubborn to the end.","“Why do you insist on Qiao asking for your help?” Jian Jin really couldn’t understand this.","Lu Zhi did not answer her. He said the same thing, “If she really needs my help, she’ll tell me herself.”","He refused to cooperate, and Jian Jin couldn’t do anything to him. She could only hold her anger inside, with nowhere to vent it.","Lu Zhi brought up something else at this moment. “By the way, the person I got you to keep an eye on... has she made a move?”","Jian Jin was always focused when it came to serious matters. She blinked before remembering who Lu Zhi was talking about, then immediately said, “Not yet.”","“Then continue keeping an eye on her.” Lu Zhi smiled. He looked so refined and gentle, but he was cold and cruel in his bones. His smile did not reach his eyes at all. He crossed his hands on his lap and slowly said, “You have to be patient if you want to catch prey. You can’t alert the enemy.”"]},{"number":3385,"title":"Chapter 3385: He Might Live For a Few More Years If I Treat Him Slowly","paragraphs":["Chapter 3385: He Might Live For a Few More Years If I Treat Him Slowly","Editor: Atlas Studios","Jian Jin looked at him with a complicated expression. In the end, she couldn’t help but say, “Boss, was this what you thought when you were chasing Qiao?”","Lu Zhi looked at her and remained silent.","“Okay!” Jian Jin gave him a thumbs up. “You’re this!”","Making her ‘like’ his Moments on WeChat every day, was this what he meant by not alerting the enemy?","Lu Zhi looked at her thumbs-up with no change in expression. “Hurry up and do it.”","“Then I’ll leave you to it.”","Jian Jin knew he didn’t want to talk to her, so she took the initiative to leave.","The door closed, and the office returned to silence. Only light and shadow shone in, cutting out flickering shadows.","Lu Zhi sat quietly in the wheelchair for a while.","His eyes darkened, and his tense lips relaxed slightly. Then, he picked up the phone in the drawer and called someone.","“Hello, Elder Zhong.”","Alone in the office, Lu Zhi’s voice was amplified infinitely.","“The patient I told you about before...”","**","Pharmacy Association, Zhong Yiliu’s laboratory.","A strange old man with white hair was on the phone. “Ah, the person you’re talking about. Didn’t I ask you to bring him over for me to see? Why haven’t you brought him over yet?”","His laboratory wasn’t big.","It was filled with all kinds of bottles and cans, and colorful reagents bubbled in test tubes on the shelf at the side. Draft papers were also scattered on the ground.","It was too casual to throw the formulas of some medicines that were still being developed on the ground.","In addition to Zhong Yiliu, a few blond-haired and blue-eyed apprentices were also in the laboratory.","One of them was Robert, who was familiar with Qiao Nian.","They were testing a special medicine that was said to be able to suppress cancer. The potion experiment was only halfway through, and everyone was still waiting for the results.","Zhong Yiliu was very passionate about pharmaceutical research and rarely stopped during an experiment, let alone answer the phone.","However, when he saw who was calling this time, he did not immediately turn off his phone while cursing angrily like usual.","Some people in the laboratory who did not know much about the situation were surprised to find that he was not angry and even chatted well with the other party.","However, they soon realized that his good attitude only lasted momentarily. After a short period of harmony, Zhong Yiliu suddenly became angry.","“In his condition, why isn’t he resting in bed? What’s he thinking? Does he want to die? I don’t save people who want to die! It’s a waste of time and medicine.”","The laboratory was as quiet as a cicada in the winter.","No one dared to make a sound.","Everyone was afraid to offend this famous President with a bad temper.","Zhong Yiliu had always done things without any scruples. Even while on the phone, he did not lower his voice. His brows were tightly furrowed, and his nose was moving forcefully. Everyone could tell he was furious!","They didn’t know what the person on the other end told him.","Zhong Yiliu paused, but his expression still did not look good. At the very least, he wasn’t as angry as before. His voice softened as he said unhappily, “I’ll say the same thing. From the examination reports you sent me, his body is in extremely bad condition. As for how to treat him, you have to send him to me. I’ll slowly nurse him back to health. Perhaps he can live for a few more years.”"]},{"number":3386,"title":"Chapter 3386: Teacher, Who Is This Patient?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3386: Teacher, Who Is This Patient?","Editor: Atlas Studios","He was polite enough.","If it wasn’t Lu Zhi, he might have already cursed at the other party!","However, Lu Zhi had been treated by him for so many years. Due to his leg condition and other reasons, even if outsiders were afraid of Lu Zhi, Zhong Yiliu treated him as his junior from the bottom of his heart. He was more patient than others.","In fact, Zhong Yiliu remembered the medical reports Lu Zhi had shown him.","That person’s body was like an arrow at the end of its flight. He was like a candle that had burned to the end and was in danger of extinguishing at any moment.","“If you let him go back now, I don’t know how many days he can stay alive just by relying on my medicine.”","Zhong Yiliu’s tone was still stiff. He didn’t like patients who didn’t take their lives seriously.","As he said, saving a person with no desire to live was undoubtedly a waste of the doctor’s time and energy. It was also a waste of the medicine that he had painstakingly developed.","His face was taut, but he actually did not quite understand. “Why the hell wouldn’t he come over? You didn’t tell him what I said?”","Hearing the answer on the cell phone.","Zhong Yiliu understood that the patient did not have any desire to live. His expression immediately worsened. He paced the laboratory angrily, and his tone worsened.","“Then I have no choice!","“I’m just a doctor, not God. I can’t help him even if he’s unwilling to treat himself properly.”","Lu Zhi thanked him and asked him for the special medicine.","Zhong Yiliu took a deep breath and tried his best to suppress his anger. Frowning, he said with irritation and unwillingness, “I’ll get someone to send it to you later.”","He seemed to be unwilling to care about that disobedient patient anymore. Without even bothering to ask, he said anxiously, “I’m still busy. I’ll hang up first.”","He didn’t care if Lu Zhi had anything else to say. He hung up and threw the phone on the table.","His old brick of a cell phone had the advantage of being sturdy.","He always would toss his cell phone after answering a call, and only look for it when he wanted to use it. It had been more than 10 years, but this cell phone was still intact.","Zhong Yiliu only used his phone to call and read messages. He was a nostalgic person and did not change to a new cell phone. He had always used this old brick.","Still angry after hanging up, he turned around and saw a few pairs of eyes peeking at him from the laboratory. He scolded them with a straight face.","“What are you looking at? Have you finished what you’re supposed to do?”","“...”","Everyone quickly lowered their heads and pretended to be busy.","Zhong Yiliu remembered his promise to Lu Zhi. He turned around and called out to his student, “Robert, wait for a while. Send some of the medicine No. 88634 to the illegal district.”","“Alright.” Robert was used to helping him with these trivial matters. He immediately asked him, “Teacher, how much do I send this time?”","“Send...” Zhong Yiliu pressed his hand to his temple. It was rare for him to be so distraught. “Just send some. He won’t have long to live, anyway.”","Seeing that he was so vexed, Robert asked softly, “Teacher, who is this patient?”","Special medicine No. 88634. This medicine could no longer be classified as a potion. It was more like a drug.","This was a powerful stimulant always used by dying patients. It relied on powerful stimulation to extend the patient’s life.","It couldn’t save the patient’s life. Even if it had the effect of prolonging life, it could also indirectly corrode and accelerate the destruction of the patient’s internal organs. Therefore, this special medicine was prohibited from circulating on the market."]},{"number":3387,"title":"Chapter 3387: What’s Wrong With Everyone Today?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3387: What’s Wrong With Everyone Today?","Editor: Atlas Studios","The Pharmacy Association still had this medicine because Zhong Yiliu felt that the side effects were powerful and had a lot of research value.","He couldn’t understand why someone would use poison to prolong their life but was unwilling to treat themselves properly.","If he simply did not want to live anymore, why would he use this medicine to prolong his life?","It was very contradictory.","“I don’t know, either.” How could Zhong Yiliu not feel that this person was contradictory? He had the same thoughts as Robert. “Other than reading his pathology report, I haven’t seen this person until now. I don’t even have a photo.”","At first, he was furious and unwilling to prescribe medicine. He felt that Lu Zhi was being too disrespectful to him.","However, Lu Zhi explained that the other party was unwilling to show their face. Even if they would die the next day without the medicine, they refused to show their appearance.","The other party’s actions were strange, but Zhong Yiliu was a little interested. So, he gave the medicine and instructed Lu Zhi to convey that the patient could come to the Pharmacy Association and be treated by him. He couldn’t guarantee a cure, but he could at least promise a few more years for the patient...","Any normal person who heard this should be tempted, right?","Tsk!","Zhong Yiliu thought of what Lu Zhi told him and felt his heart itch. “I don’t know what kind of person that patient is. Their brain is like a roller coaster. I wonder if they’re willing to give me their dead body. I’ll dissect their brain and study it to see what’s different from ordinary people.”","He was especially tempted. He even rubbed his chin, wishing to dissect the ‘patient’ today.","Robert was speechless. He quickly said to his teacher, “I’ll see if there’s any more medicine and send it over.”","“Go on.”","Zhong Yiliu was still immersed in his thoughts. He waved his hand and gestured for him to leave.","Robert had already taken two steps when he turned back. He walked over and said as if he had thought of something, “By the way, Teacher, there’s one more thing I forgot to tell you.”","Zhong Yiliu reluctantly returned to this world and looked at his student in confusion.","Robert wasn’t a show-off. He immediately said, “Mrs. Ji from the independent continent contacted you and wants you to see a patient.”","“Why is it another consultation?” Zhong Yiliu frowned and muttered.","Robert found it strange too.","Their Pharmacy Association was focused on medicine. Although people consulted his teacher, most would usually ask for medicine.","Zhong Yiliu at least knew Xie Yun. He asked gently, “Did she say which patient? And where?”","“...She didn’t say the patient’s name. She said that it was not convenient for her to reveal the name. She hopes you can check to see if the condition is serious through the medical report and prescribe medicine for the patient.”","“...”","Zhong Yiliu wondered if he had heard wrongly.","“Say again?”","Robert repeated, embarrassed.","Zhong Yiliu’s face darkened and he waved his hand. “No!”","This wasn’t a fortune-telling stall. Nobody allowed him to see them and only gave him their ‘enneagram numbers’ for him to prescribe medicine. What did they take him for?!","He wasn’t God!","Robert saw that he was so angry that he turned around to look at the test tube for the experiment. He stood there and scratched his head. After thinking for a while, he tiptoed out to find medicine.","He was only in charge of conveying the message. There was nothing he could do if his teacher was unwilling to see the report. He could only call Mrs. Ji and apologize."]},{"number":3388,"title":"Chapter 3388: Ji Nan: Can You Come Back a Few Days Early?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3388: Ji Nan: Can You Come Back a Few Days Early?","Editor: Atlas Studios","On the other side.","Xie Yun had yet to receive Robert’s reply call.","Over the past few days, she was tired of dealing with the elders asking about Li Lingfeng’s condition. Unable to rest well the past few days, her well-maintained face was covered in tired lines.","“Third Uncle and the others have left?”","“Yes, they’ve just left.”","As soon as Xie Yun opened her eyes, she saw a cup of warm water in front of her.","She looked up at Ji Nan, who had returned from the old residence, standing before her, holding the water glass and gesturing for her to drink it.","Xie Yun’s tired expression eased a little. She took the glass from him and lowered her head to take a sip. The warm water flowed down her throat and into her stomach, slightly soothing her exhausted heart.","“Didn’t see your dad again today?”","Ji Nan sat down beside her. “Mm, I didn’t see him.”","Xie Yun didn’t know how to tell him for a while. After a moment of silence, she said, “Don’t worry, you’ll see him one day.”","Ji Nan didn’t answer this question directly and looked at her. “Those people come to our house every day to look for you. Why don’t you disappear for a while? Otherwise, you’ll be tired out eventually.”","“No way.”","Xie Yun was from a prestigious family, after all. She was very clear about the twists and turns. She rubbed her swollen temples and tried to move her numb face.","“Your father suddenly came back and locked himself up at home. If I don’t see these people, I’m afraid they will have evil thoughts.","“The Ji family’s current situation...” Xie Yun glanced at him and said weakly, “If you had entered the First Research Institute and not majored in finance, it might not have been so bad.","“...But if your father doesn’t appear now, you won’t be able to control the situation. I can only stabilize the situation for now, lest they cause trouble again.”","She was telling the truth.","During Ji Lingfeng’s disappearance, many internal conflicts struck the Ji family. Every family member was secretly working hard for their own benefit.","The previous farce almost made Ji Ziyin the next head of the family.","Now that Ji Lingfeng had suddenly returned, these people who had caused trouble in the past must be feeling uneasy. It was fine if they simply asked her about his condition, but if they caused trouble...","Xie Yun felt tired just thinking about it.","She sighed deeply. “I wonder when Nian Nian will be back. If only she were here now.”","Qiao Nian wasn’t a member of the Ji family and had never agreed to return.","However, the older generation was afraid of her.","If Qiao Nian were in the independent continent, these people would at least restrain themselves. They wouldn’t be like now, getting increasingly restless with Ji Lingfeng’s absence.","Ji Nan had just spoken to Qiao Nian on the phone, so he knew when she would return. “She’ll be back soon.”","Xie Yun glanced at him. Before she could ask him how he knew, her cell phone vibrated. She took it out and looked at the caller ID.","Abruptly getting up, she walked towards the bedroom. “I’ll go back to my room to rest. You can stay here for a while.”","Ji Nan thought she was avoiding him.","Although he didn’t know why she was avoiding him, he felt vaguely uneasy.","Ji Nan frowned, took out his phone, found the contact with a blank profile picture, and sent a message.","[J: Can you come back a few days early?]","Seeing the word “read” appear behind his message, Ji Nan’s tense heart relaxed slightly. He turned to his room, planning to shower as he waited for Qiao Nian’s reply."]},{"number":3389,"title":"Chapter 3389: I Suspect Something Happened to Ji Lingfeng","paragraphs":["Chapter 3389: I Suspect Something Happened to Ji Lingfeng","Editor: Atlas Studios","Beijing.","Rhine Apartments.","Ye Wangchuan’s duplex was decorated in a low-key and luxurious fashion. It exuded a certain lifestyle in every corner. It was considered the most suitable place for someone to live in among all the houses this master had lived in since he was young.","After finishing the call with Ji Nan, Qiao Nian sat upstairs for a while. At the same time, she glanced at the half-written score on the table. Thinking of what she had promised Nie Mi, she turned on the computer and tried to write.","The effect was average.","She bit the pen’s cap and scribbled on the paper for more than half an hour. Since she was lacking inspiration, she went to the sink to splash her face with cold water.","Ye Wangchuan had just come to the living room after reporting to Old Master Ye.","Gu San was making tea for him.","Bringing out the hot tea, he saw the girl coming downstairs. He asked her excitedly, “Miss Qiao, do you want hot tea?”","“Yes.” The girl’s body was cold from the early autumn chill. She walked past the two people on the sofa and sat down in her favorite spot. She lazily tilted her head like a cat, noticing the man leaving the study. She casually asked, “What did you say to Grandpa Ye?”","“I told him about the second trial’s outcome and asked him when he would arrange the final trial so I could end this matter as soon as possible.”","Ye Wangchuan saw that the hair on her forehead was still wet. He brushed the water droplet with his fingertips, touching the girl’s forehead. It was only a light touch before he quickly retracted his hand.","There was an unruly wild aura about him, but it was cleverly restrained under the appearance of arrogance and reservedness.","This gentle appearance usually made Ye Wangchuan look lazy, as if he was not interested in anything around him.","Just like now as he leaned against the sofa in a light-colored sweater. The brown leather sofa seemed to blend perfectly with him.","His slanted eyes clearly exuded a unique noble pressure, but when you looked at him, you could only see the casualness and carelessness under his deep eyes.","In Qin Si’s words, it was called acting cool.","Qiao Nian’s forehead was inadvertently touched by his fingertips. The skin was slightly cold, and she was about to get distracted.","At this moment, her cell phone vibrated, stirring her heartstrings at the same time.","“Let me check my cell phone.”","Ye Wangchuan watched as the girl instantly sobered up and retracted her gaze. She turned her attention to her cell phone, paused, and sighed quietly.","Seeing the message, Qiao Nian’s gaze paused, and her dark brows suddenly lowered with a hint of forbearance between them.","“What’s wrong?” Ye Wangchuan asked as he sensed the change in her mood.","Qiao Nian pursed her lips and did not reply to Ji Nan’s message. Instead, she looked up thoughtfully and said absent-mindedly, “Nothing.”","She had just called Ji Nan not long ago and even told him when she was returning.","If there were no special circumstances, Ji Nan wouldn’t have suddenly sent her a message asking her to go back early.","However, Ji Nan probably wasn’t sure about Ji Lingfeng’s condition. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have just asked her if she could go back earlier.","Qiao Nian was thinking about something, but she could feel Ye Wangchuan’s gaze on her. Pressing a hand between her eyebrows, she met his gaze and said frankly, “I suspect that something has happened to Ji Lingfeng.”"]},{"number":3390,"title":"Chapter 3390: At Your Rate, I Won’t Be Able to See You Get Married Before I’m Buried in the Ground","paragraphs":["Chapter 3390: At Your Rate, I Won’t Be Able to See You Get Married Before I’m Buried in the Ground","Editor: Atlas Studios","Her tone sounded normal without much emotional fluctuation.","However, Ye Wangchuan had known her for some time now.","If Qiao Nian didn’t take someone seriously, she could calmly walk over that person even if they died in front of her.","Since she mentioned this, it meant that she had been paying attention to Ji Lingfeng.","At the very least, she was a little concerned.","Since she cared, Ye Wangchuan said, “I also heard that the independent continent hasn’t been very quiet these days. Ji Lingfeng hasn’t shown his face since he returned. From the inside to the outside of the Ji family, many people have begun to guess if he’s really back or if it’s fake news released by the Ji family.”","Ji Lingfeng suddenly returned to the Ji family one night, but only a few people saw him.","The others only received the news the next day. When they went to see Ji Lingfeng with trepidation, they were all blocked by his right-hand man, He Lin.","At first, everyone did not think too much about it and only thought that Ji Lingfeng did not want to see anyone.","After a long time, a new speculation was pushed out.","It was said that Ji Lingfeng did not come back alive at all. The so-called ‘return’ was just fake news created by He Lin and the others.","The goal was to stabilize the Ji family’s chaotic situation.","Qiao Nian said calmly, “It’s not fake news. He should be in the Ji residence. As for why he doesn’t show his face, I suspect it has something to do with his health.”","Gu San happened to bring the hot tea over and placed it on the table in front of her. Seeing her frown, he whispered, “Miss Qiao, have some tea.”","Qiao Nian got up impatiently and thought for a moment before hurriedly saying, “I’ll make a call.”","This time, she didn’t go to the second floor but to the corridor outside.","Only when Qin Si heard the door close did he smack his lips and say gloomily, “Why did Sister Qiao run out to make a call again? She’s too busy every day!”","Ye Wangchuan ignored him and kept his gaze in the direction the girl left. After looking at the entrance for a while, he retracted his gaze and reached for his cell phone. He decided to urge the Old Master to hurry up.","From the looks of it, the independent continent’s situation wouldn’t be able to wait for half a month.","In that case, he could only move Zhou Zheng’s final trial date forward by a few days.","“What? Even earlier?! Didn’t I tell you it’s already the soonest possible? No matter how fast you want it, you have to go through the normal process.”","Ye Wangchuan’s expression did not change in the face of the Old Master’s furious complaints. He only said calmly, “According to the normal process, it will take at least three to six months before the final trial.”","“What do you mean?” Old Master Ye was so angry that he was grinding his teeth. “Young brat, you’re even educating me.”","Ye Wangchuan’s ears hurt from the noise. He composed himself and whispered, “Nian Nian’s uncle is in some trouble. She might have to leave early.”","Therefore, he had to settle Zhou Zheng’s matter quickly.","Old Master Ye wasn’t a fool and instantly understood what he meant. He immediately changed his attitude and became worried. “Is it serious?”","“I’m not sure,” Ye Wangchuan said honestly. “I still have to see.”","Old Master Ye was angered again. Enduring it, he said, “Wait for me. I’ll go find someone and see if I can rush them.”","“Okay.”","Seeing that he wasn’t putting in any effort, Old Master Ye was quite good at arranging things for him. He became even more depressed and said, “When will I see you get married? I’m afraid that at this rate, I might not be able to see it even when the second half of my body is buried in the ground!”"]},{"number":3391,"title":"Chapter 3391: Sister Nian: I Want to Go to the Independent Continent","paragraphs":["Chapter 3391 Sister Nian: I Want to Go to the Independent Continent","He didn't mention this out of nowhere. It was mainly because recently, he often asked Old Master Jiang and Jiang Zongjin out for a meal. Both parties had already discussed the young couple's matters, from the engagement to where the wedding would be held.","He tried his best and wished he could spend 48 hours a day pestering the Jiang Family to discuss the wedding, but there seemed to be no movement from the young brat.","Ever since the two of them confirmed their relationship, they seemed lukewarm and did not make any progress. In any case, they had never heard of a fight.","\"I heard that you youngsters quarrel from time to time, have conflicts, or break up. Tell me honestly, what's your situation now?\"","In Ye Maoshan's era, people were introduced to their spouses.","When they reached a certain age, the people around them would introduce girls of the same age to each other. When the two parties met and felt that they liked each other, they would get married.","After marriage, there weren't so many twists and turns. They just lived their lives.","He wasn't sure how young people chose their spouses nowadays. Anyway, after what happened to his granddaughter, he roughly knew that young people nowadays fell in love as if it was a joke.","They didn't know if they would end up together even after getting married.","In any case, he was certain that Qiao Nian was the only granddaughter-in-law of the Ye family. This was also his agreement with Jiang Weishang back then.","He knew that his grandson was quite good-looking. Many women wished to pounce on him outside, and Nian Nian was still young. What if...","\"What situation?\" Ye Wangchuan didn't know what the old man was thinking and replied casually. Ye Maoshan frowned. The breath he exhaled sparked flames. \"You'd better behave yourself and not cause trouble for me. Otherwise...\"","Ye Wangchuan understood what he meant and was both angry and amused. He lowered his voice and interrupted him. \"Have you ever considered that I'm the one who's freeloading? What if I'm not the one who's... dishonest?\"","Unexpectedly, Old Master Ye snorted and ignored him. \"Then perform well. Don't make Nian Nian change her mind.\"","Ye Wangchuan's thin lips curled up as he smiled and asked with a strange expression, \"You mean for me to cozy up to her?\"","Qin Si pricked up his ears to eavesdrop.","He couldn't hear Old Master Ye's voice, but he could hear Ye Wangchuan's. He could only surmise that their conversation seemed to be getting more and more explosive.","He was even talking about cozying up to someone.","He was probably talking about Sister Qiao.","Ye Wangchuan suddenly looked at him.","Qin Si's burning gossipy soul was immediately frozen. He obediently shrank back to his seat and looked around as if he was not eavesdropping.","Old Master Ye cursed for a long time.","It entered Ye Wangchuan's left ear and exited through his right. Seeing the girl enter from outside, he interrupted Old Master Ye, \"I'll hang up first.\"","Ye Maoshan was still nagging him to treat his girlfriend well, date more, buy more things, and so on. He only realized he had been hung up on when he heard the beeping sound.","It took him a long time to come back to his senses. He stared at the phone with wide eyes, so angry that he blew his beard and glared. \"This young brat!\"","**","Qiao Nian's brows were bunched up after her call with Feng Yu outside.","After returning to the living room, she grabbed the teacup and took a sip before looking over and saying, \"I want to go to the independent continent.\""]},{"number":3392,"title":"Chapter 3392: How About I Return the Ji Family to Her?","paragraphs":["Ye Wangchuan had already guessed this outcome. \"When? Have you decided on a date?\"","Qiao Nian's fingertips warmed from the tea. Feeling a headache incoming, she simply said, \"I want to leave as soon as possible.\"","Old Master Ye had already replied.","He texted Ye Wangchuan saying he had already found someone to treat Zhou Zheng's case as a special case. It would be finalized in five days.","Ye Wangchuan told her Old Master Ye's reply.","\"... Five days.\" Qiao Nian calculated. Five days wasn't considered long. It was half the time she had expected. However, her strong sixth sense alerted her that something would happen.","She couldn't tell what would happen. Thus, she could only agree. \"Then I'll go to the independent continent in five days.\"","There was an uproar outside, but it was as if nothing had happened at the storm's center. He Lin knocked on the European-style bedroom door with dinner.","\"Patriarch, it's me.\"","He heard the sound of paper rustling inside, mixed with faint, intermittent coughs.","He Lin's heart tightened before falling weakly. \"Patriarch, can I go in?\"","He tried his best to sound calm as he spoke.","Finally, a man's hoarse voice came from inside.","\"Come in.\"","He Lin heaved a sigh of relief and pushed the door open.","There was only one light in Ji Lingfeng's bedroom. The dim yellow light shrouded everything in the room. The doors and windows were tightly shut, and even the curtains were tightly drawn. Besides the dull air, only the faint smell of medicine could be smelled.","He Lin seemed used to this scene as he quickly walked towards the man behind the desk.","He put down the porridge and side dishes and said respectfully, \"Patriarch, eat something.\"","Then, he saw from the corner of his eye that Ji Lingfeng had carefully placed an old yellowed photo back into the drawer.","He now knew who the woman in the photo was.","He Lin felt even worse. He looked at the middle-aged man and opened his mouth to say something, but no words came out of his mouth.","\"If you have something to say, just say it.\" Ji Lingfeng did not look up as he took the porridge and slowly ate it with a spoon.","Losing his appetite after two spoonfuls, he pushed the remaining porridge aside, refusing to eat any more.","Seeing that he had eaten so little, He Lin advised softly, \"Patriarch, you should at least eat a little more. If you don't want to eat this, I'll get the kitchen to make some soft food again.\"","\"No need.\" Ji Lingfeng casually rejected. \"I don't have the appetite.\"","\"But...\" He Lin opened his mouth again. His eyes were already burning.","At this moment, Ji Lingfeng suddenly bent over and coughed violently. He Lin was shocked and quickly handed him a tissue.","Ji Lingfeng covered his mouth with a few tissues and tried to control his body's natural reaction. His entire body seemed to be on the verge of breaking.","As a fishy taste gushed out of his throat, the trembling in Ji Lingfeng's chest finally eased. Without a change in expression, he threw the blood-stained tissue into the trash can as if it was not blood that he had spat out. His eyes were undetectably misty as he leaned back in his chair. With his eyes half-closed, he suddenly asked, \"What do you think about me returning the Ji family to her?\""]},{"number":3393,"title":"Chapter 3393: I Think You’d Better Discuss It With Madam","paragraphs":["Chapter 3393 I Think You'd Better Discuss It With Madam","\"Who?\"","He Lin handed him water.","Ji Lingfeng didn't take it at first, only after a while. \"Who do you think?\"","He Lin looked at him with a stunned expression. \"You mean...\"","Ji Lingfeng could tell he had guessed it. He lowered his eyelashes slightly and was enveloped in the darkness, as if he was so exhausted that he could drown in the night at any moment.","\"What do you think?\"","\"...\"","He Lin hesitated and did not dare to answer this fatal question immediately. He lowered his head and thought for a while before looking at Ji Lingfeng's sickly expression and saying softly, \"Patriarch, have you discussed it with Madam?\"","Ji Lingfeng opened his eyes and looked at him.","Even in the darkness, He Lin could feel his sharp gaze.","He gritted his teeth and insisted, \"I think you'd better discuss such a big matter with Madam. Otherwise, Madam will be sad if she finds out from someone else.\"","\"She'll understand.\"","Ji Lingfeng and Xie Yun had been married for decades and raised a son. It would be a lie to say they had no feelings for each other. However, this love was more of an allyship that they cherished. Even Ji Lingfeng himself could not tell how much love was involved.","\"You've seen it for yourself during my absence from the family. Ji Nan is not suitable to be the Patriarch. First of all, he can't control the elders.\"","\"Patriarch...\" Ji Lin tried to deny it but could not refute him.","Exhausted, Ji Lingfeng propped his head on his hand and stared at him with sharp eyes. \"If Ji Nan can sit firmly in this position, as his father, I'm willing to give him a chance. It's just that I don't have the time. How long can he sit in this position if something happens to me? Besides... this position doesn't belong to me, to begin with.\"","This last sentence was the point he wanted to make.","\"This position doesn't belong to me. I've only occupied it for that person. It's time to return it to her descendants.\"","\"Patriarch...\" He Lin felt sad for him. He wanted to comfort him, but because of Ji Lingfeng's seniority, he couldn't bring himself to.","Ji Lingfeng let out a heavy sigh. His complexion was terrible, but his spirit was relaxed. He even had the mood to smile at He Lin, who was about to cry.","\"Don't feel bad. I got what I wanted.\"","He took out the old photo again. The girl in the photo who looked like Qiao Nian seemed frozen in time, like she had never aged.","Ji Lingfeng gently caressed her bright eyes as he said in a low voice, \"All these years, I often regret it. If I had been more careful back then, that tragedy wouldn't have happened... Would she have been alive right now?\"","Ji Qing was taboo in the Ji family.","However, very few people knew that Ji Lingfeng did not let anyone mention Ji Qing not because of the rumors back then, but... because Ji Qing was a taboo in his heart.","He didn't want anyone to even speak of her, for fear of crossing that boundary and offending him.","This was because as long as someone mentioned Ji Qing, Ji Lingfeng would be unable to sleep at night. He would regret not doing well enough back then and not protecting his sister. At the same time, he would treasure her in his heart.","\"Lu Zhi just called. He said that the Pharmaceutical Association's medicine is coming. Go to the docks and get it yourself. Don't let anyone see it.\"","Ji Lingfeng's vulnerability was fleeting.","After purring the photo back into the drawer, he returned to his usual unyielding image."]},{"number":3394,"title":"Chapter 3394: Don’t worry, I Won’t Agree","paragraphs":["He Lin didn't dare to bring up the previous topic. He bowed and respectfully replied, \"Patriarch, don't worry.\"","\"Mhm.\" Ji Lingfeng waved his hand in dismissal.","He Lin was about to leave when he was stopped. \"Wait.\"","He Lin immediately turned around. \"Patriarch, do you have any other instructions?\"","Ji Lingfeng massaged his swollen temples with an ugly expression. After pondering for a moment, he told him, \"Bring Madam to see me.\"","He Lin's eyelids twitched. He understood that Ji Lingfeng was determined to leave the Ji family to Miss Qiao. Before that, he wanted to inform Madam.","Sensing Ji Lingfeng's gaze, he quickly lowered his head.","However, he wasn't confident.","She wondered if Xie Yun would agree to the Patriarch's decision.","**","As it turned out, Xie Yun's reaction was as expected.","\"I don't agree!\"","\"Why?\" Ji Lingfeng asked calmly.","Xie Yun sneered and slammed her handbag on the table as she looked straight at the man who had lived with her for decades. \"I know you're thinking about that person. We're connected by marriage. I've never asked you to be inclined towards me emotionally. I can give in to","anything, including the title of Mrs. Ji. If you can find someone suitable to replace me, I'll give up my position in minutes.","\"But...\" Her tone changed drastically. \"I have a bottom line! That is, no one can snatch what belongs to Ji Nan!\"","It wasn't that she didn't like Qiao Nian.","Xie Yun was actually pretty fond of Qiao Nian.","However, she was unwilling to take a step back when it came to her son's interests.","She looked coldly at this man who she had lived with for decades, not knowing if they were together out of love or responsibility.","This was the first time she had faced him head-on.","\"I didn't hold it against you when you supported Ji Ziyin in the past because I knew she was just a front and wouldn't affect Ji Nan's status. However, it's different now. I know very well what you want to do. Ji Lingfeng, I'm telling you clearly. I disagree!\"","Ji Lingfeng did not expect this reaction. He tried to speak rationally. \"Ji Nan can't take my position.\"","\"So what?!\" Xie Yun didn't give him a chance to finish. She stared at him sharply, her eyes already red. \"He's your son!\"","Ji Lingfeng's Adam's apple bobbed. In the end, he couldn't meet her gaze. His mature and handsome face was sickly red and tired.","\"I don't want to argue with you.\"","|| ||","Ji Lingfeng frowned and looked ashamed, but he didn't change his mind. \"Go back and think about it.\"","Xie Yun grabbed her bag and turned to leave. \"Don't worry, I won't agree no matter what.\"","As she turned, she saw a tablet of pills on the coffee table, with the number \"88634\" on it. There wasn't even a packaging box.","What kind of medicine was this?","Noticing where she was looking, Ji Lingfeng quietly grabbed the medicine and threw it into his drawer.","Then, he asked her to leave. \"I'm going to rest. You can leave.\"","\"Huh.\"","Xie Yun wasn't a woman who relied on men to survive in the traditional sense. Seeing his attitude, she didn't want to stay any longer and walked away without looking back.","The door closed with a click."]},{"number":3395,"title":"Chapter 3395: What’s With That Medicine?","paragraphs":["Only then did Ji Lingfeng bend over and cough violently.","He clutched his chest and the veins near his temples bulged as he suppressed his voice.","He spat out another mouthful of blood.","Already mentally prepared, when the violent coughing subsided, he got up, went to the sink, and turned on the tap to wash away the blood on his hand.","Outside.","Xie Yun did not go far.","After closing the door, she pressed her ear to it.","This was because the moment she was about to close the door, she turned around and saw the man's body suddenly tense up. It was obvious he was seriously ill.","She stood pressed to the door for a few seconds and indeed heard Ji Lingfeng's suppressed cough coming from inside.","Xie Yun tightened her grip on her handbag, her heart sinking to the bottom.","She had lived with Ji Lingfeng for decades and more or less knew how stubborn this person was. If it weren't because he couldn't help it, he definitely wouldn't have made a sound.","She had guessed that Ji Lingfeng must have been injured in that accident and had yet to recover after not seeing him for so long. However, from the looks of it...","Ji Lingfeng seemed to be preparing for his funeral...","Realizing this, Xie Yun's heart sank rapidly. She couldn't describe her feelings, but her hands and feet were already cold, and her entire body felt like it had fallen into an icehouse.","She suddenly remembered the medicine on the coffee table.","The label pasted on it was a string of numbers.","Judging from how Ji Lingfeng immediately put it away, this medicine should be the one he had been taking recently.","Xie Yun tried to calm herself down as she walked out.","She called Nan Tianyi and asked him for help in a low voice. \"Tianyi, help me check a medication. It should be from the Pharmacy Association, No. 88634. Help me ask what kind of medication this is and what it is for. Remember, don't let a third person know I'm checking on this. Don't let the people from the Pharmacy Association reveal that I've asked about this either...\"","Xie Yun hung up and got into the car, still trembling.","Right now, the entire independent continent was looking at the Ji family and Ji Lingfeng. If that medicine was really as she thought...","Then...","She had to hide this news. Otherwise, if others found out that Ji Lingfeng's health was so bad, it would definitely be detrimental to him.","Xie Yun took a deep breath and composed herself before instructing the chauffeur, \"Go to... No, go home.\"","\"Okay, Madam.\" The chauffeur did not notice her abnormality and hurriedly drove towards Xie Yun's residence.","Xie Yun leaned back in her seat, unable to calm down for a long time. She closed her eyes and smiled bitterly. It was unknown if she was laughing at Ji Lingfeng or herself.","She had lived a pathetic and ridiculous life.","Wasn't Ji Lingfeng the same?","**","Two days later.","Qiao Nian finished the new song she had promised Nie Mi and Wen Ruxia and sent it to them via email.","Zhong Yiliu called her just as she was stretching and thinking about taking a cold shower and catching up on her sleep.","\"Hey.\"","Qiao Nian and Zhong Yiliu were old friends. Their relationship had always been good. Instead of heading to the shower, she accepted the call and got up casually, preparing to clean up the draft papers on the table.","Unexpectedly, Zhong Yiliu asked her with a serious expression, \"Qiao, is Patriarch Ji sick?\"","\"Huh?\" Qiao Nian suddenly stopped, with one hand holding the phone and the other a ball of draft paper, about to throw it into the trash can.","Then, the girl asked with a cold and dry voice, \"Why do you suddenly say that?\""]},{"number":3396,"title":"Chapter 3396: Sister Nian Guessed The Patient Is Ji Lingfeng","paragraphs":["\"I know about your relationship with the Ji family, so I called to ask. Otherwise, I wouldn't have cared about this.\"","Zhong Yiliu briefly explained how some people asked him about medicine No. 88634.","\"...At first, I didn't think about the Ji family of the independent continent. I thought that a friend of Lu Zhi's needed this medicine. Who knew Nan Tianyi would beat around the bush and ask me about it? You also know Nan Tianyi's relationship with the Xie family, so I thought of Ji Lingfeng. Recently, everyone in the independent continent has been talking about him. Tell me, is he not the one using this medicine?\"","Qiao Nian stayed silent. After a while, she threw the ball of paper into the trash can and","walked to the balcony. Feeling the cold wind, her mind cleared and she asked, \"What exactly is this medicine's effect?\"","Zhong Yiliu told her about it.","The pressure around Qiao Nian dropped and she immediately said, \"You've seen... that person's case. Do you think there's still hope?\"","Zhong Yiliu didn't detect the heaviness in her words. He thought about it seriously and replied, \"He's terminally ill. I suspect he's been poisoned. It's a slow-acting poison that has been lurking in his body for a few decades. He probably started consuming this slow-acting poison when he was young.","\"Given the quantity of this poison, he should have died upon reaching adulthood, but I don't know what happened midway. The consumption of the poison was cut off, and it didn't reach a critical point. However, even after he stopped ingesting it, the poison remained in his body. His bone marrow and blood are filled with poison. This time, his body was severely injured, and his immunity decreased. Only then did this hidden poison begin to invade his internal organs... If you're talking about saving him, you definitely can't.\"","Zhong Yiliu had always spoken the truth and did not like to make false promises.","\"The poison invaded his bone marrow. Even God can't save him now! Moreover, we're just doctors, not God. We can't build a new body for him.","\"There's no way to save him. But like I said, if he's sent to me in time, I'll nurse him back to health. If he obeys me and lets go of everything to live peacefully, he might be able to live a few more years. Of course, if he's unwilling, there's only one outcome. He'll die quickly.\"","Qiao Nian knew he was just stating the truth. She had studied medicine and knew well how bad the situation was after Zhong Yiliu's explanation.","She was almost certain that this uncooperative patient was Ji Lingfeng.","However, she did not expect Ji Lingfeng to be poisoned. Furthermore, he had been fed poison since he was young. There was probably only one person who could do such a shocking thing. -Nie Qingru.","Qiao Nian wasn't in a good mood. After what Zhong Yiliu told her, it was as if a huge rock was pressing down on her heart. She couldn't let it go.","Zhong Yiliu had only called to ask if she knew who wanted this medicine. Seeing that she did not know, he did not continue asking.","Qiao Nian hung up. Her mood was at a low point as she took a cold shower. When she came out, Wen Ruxia had already replied.","She said she had received the score and was discussing it with her teacher to see if there was anything that needed Qiao Nian's cooperation to modify.","However, Wen Ruxia knew how to behave. She thanked Qiao Nian for her help and even said she had to treat her to a meal.","Qiao Nian replied, saying Wen Ruxia could ask if she had any questions."]},{"number":3397,"title":"Chapter 3397: Master Wang: Are You in a Bad Mood?","paragraphs":["Downstairs.","Wen Ruxia had already called Ye Wangchuan.","Ye Wangchuan was dealing with a business deal in Continent F. He picked up his mug to drink water and asked, \"What's the matter?\"","\"It's nothing.\" Wen Ruxia smiled and said, \"Tomorrow is Wen Ziyu's birthday. Our family organized a birthday party for him to celebrate his first year in society after graduation. We also invited a few friends. I want to invite Young Master Ye and Nian Nian. I wonder if you have time to give him face?\"","Ye Wangchuan filled half the glass with water before walking back and casually sitting on the swivel chair. \"Why didn't you ask her directly?\"","\"I've asked.\" Wen Ruxia did not hide it from him. She paused before continuing, \"Nian Nian doesn't seem to be in a good mood, so I thought I'd just ask you.\"","Ye Wangchuan didn't give her a clear answer. He only agreed to see if he was free tomorrow. If he was free, he would go. If not, he would forget it.","Wen Ruxia knew that the two of them were each harder to meet. Since she had invited them, it would just be an additional surprise if they showed up. She hung up readily.","Ye Wangchuan thought for a moment before pushing away the work piled up on the table. He told Gu San something before going to the second floor to look for Qiao Nian.","**","Upstairs.","After the cold shower, Qiao Nian's hair was covered in water vapor. She wiped it with a towel and walked out in a daze.","She was about to pull out a chair to sit down when she realized the hairdryer seemed broken. Qiao Nian's beautiful face was covered in mist, and her dark eyes were even more prominent. She casually threw the towel on the desk and got up, preparing to go downstairs to get some air.","Unexpectedly, she bumped into the man upon opening the door.","She almost bumped into the other party's shoulder blade. Fortunately, Qiao Nian reacted quickly and stopped in time, preventing a tragedy.","\"You...\"","She wasn't in a good mood, but upon looking up at Ye Wangchuan's beautiful eyes, her anger mysteriously subsided. She touched her nose and made way.","\"What are you doing up here?\"","Ye Wangchuan brushed her hair, lowered his eyes, and asked, \"Are you in a bad mood?\"","\"Huh?\" Qiao Nian felt his warm fingers when they touched her ear. Stunned, she did not react immediately.","Seeing her rare distracted look, Ye Wangchuan smiled and entered the room. \"Let's go. I'll blow dry your hair.\"","Qiao Nian subconsciously followed him in. Then, she remembered and stopped in her tracks. \"No, my hairdryer is broken. I was about to go down to find another.\"","Ye Wangchuan was sitting in her favorite chair as usual. He took out his cell phone and a message to someone before looking up and waving at her. \"I told Gu San to send it up.\"","Qiao Nian didn't know why he came. She stood rooted to the ground for a few seconds before walking over slowly.","\"You... didn't come up here just to blow dry my hair, right?\"","\"You tell me.\"","11 ||","Qiao Nian gave him a look.","Then, she naturally dragged over a chair and sat down. Her hand rested on the back of the chair and let it hang naturally. She stretched her legs and her eyebrows lowered sloppily. It was impossible to tell she was in a bad mood. \"Why are you looking for me?\"","Ye Wangchuan pulled her chair over. When they were infinitely close to each other, his thin lips parted and he asked slowly and gently, \"Are you in a bad mood?\""]},{"number":3398,"title":"Chapter 3398: Goddess Qiao, Do You Want to Come With Me?","paragraphs":["This was the second time he had asked her this question in just a few minutes.","Qiao Nian did not understand how he could tell she was in a bad mood, but she wasn't in a good mood now. She took a lighter from her pocket and lowered her head as if thinking about how to answer his question.","\"The Wen Family is holding a birthday party tomorrow. Wen Ruxia invited us. Are you going?\" Ye Wangchuan suddenly changed the topic.","Still thinking about how to answer his previous question, Qiao Nian frowned and was about to say \"No\" when Ye Wangchuan said, \"Master Nie is going too.\"","Qiao Nian looked at him with her dark eyes, as if asking, \"So?\"","Ye Wangchuan looked at his reflection in her eyes. His lips curled slightly, and it was as if thousands of stars were falling in his eyes. \"I owe the Wen Family a favor from before. She has already invited me, so I have to go. I wonder if Goddess Qiao is interested in coming with me?","\"Otherwise, when the time comes, everyone will bring a female companion... It's not suitable for me to go alone.\" He dragged his tone. He sounded a little pitiful, but, in fact, his cynical expression was obviously teasing her.","Qiao Nian stared at him for a few seconds before narrowing her eyes and casually saying, \"Have you... gone crazy?\"","Damn!","Ye Wangchuan couldn't help but laugh.","This was the first time he had taken the initiative to invite someone as his female companion. He didn't expect to receive such an answer. If word got out, Bo Jingxing and the others would laugh their heads off.","He rubbed his forehead and looked at her with his black eyes. \"Goddess Qiao isn't willing to give me face?\"","\"It's not that I don't want to.\"","Qiao Nian lost her temper and subconsciously played with the lighter in her hand. A dark blue flame shot out and was extinguished by her slender fingers.","\"I just think you're acting a little strange.\"","She looked at him with a frown. \"You don't like to attend such dinners. Even if you owe someone a favor, why do you suddenly...\"","Ye Wangchuan raised his eyebrows and leaned back in his chair, interrupting her. \"It's not sudden.\"","What?","\"I heard... that the brat from the Wen Family has a crush on you.\"","What?","Qiao Nian was not only confused but also completely stunned.","From the Wen Family?","Who was it?","Apart from being face-blind, she was also indifferent to unimportant people and matters. Was there anyone else in the Wen Family other than Wen Ruxia?","Ye Wangchuan saw that her eyes were filled with suspicion and knew she didn't even know who Wen Ziyu was. Feeling a little better, he brushed the girl's hair and said, \"Is Goddess Qiao unwilling to announce our relationship to the public?\"","Qiao Nian pushed his hand away. \"Speak properly.\"","Ye Wangchuan was just joking with her. He leaned back lazily and said seriously, \"Anyway, the court session will only start in three days. You happen to be free until then, so I wanted to take you out for a walk to lighten your mood.\"","Qiao Nian looked at him. She didn't know how he could tell she was in a bad mood. However, she relaxed upon seeing he wasn't joking anymore. \"Tomorrow noon?\"","\"At night.\" Ye Wangchuan smiled. \"The young man suggested it. There's probably another round after dinner.\"","After Wen Ziyu graduated, he was now one of the most popular second-generation heirs in Beijing.","He was very hardworking. After entering the financial industry, he made some small achievements and did not cause any trouble. He was considered a refreshing personality in the second-generation circle."]},{"number":3399,"title":"Chapter 3399: At That Moment, Ten Thousand Stars","paragraphs":["The Wen Family thought highly of Wen Ziyu.","This time, Wen Ruxia took advantage of Wen Ziyu's birthday to treat everyone to a meal. On the surface, it was to celebrate Wen Ziyu's birthday, but in reality, she was indirectly introducing him to the people in the circle.","This sort of introduction and recognition was nothing like the mutual acknowledgment among the younger generation in their own small circles. Instead, the Wen Family officially invited people of all ages.","It was said that Old Master Ye was also invited a few days ago.","However, Wen Ziyu was a junior, after all. There was no need for someone like Old Master Ye to appear for a junior's birthday.","Hence, Old Master Ye was planning not to go. Instead, he asked Ye Lan to represent him for the occasion.","Wen Ruxia's reasoning was the same for inviting Ye Wangchuan. It was an invitation, but it didn't matter if Ye Wangchuan was unwilling to come.","It was fine as long as the Ye family sent a representative.","\"Nian Nian, are you going?\" Ye Wangchuan's eyes completely softened. He was no longer as casual as before and exuded a lazy aura from his bones.","Seating leisurely, the collar of his thin sweater was so loose that his collarbone could be seen. As he leaned back slightly, the collar slid down even lower, allowing Qiao Nian to see his Adam's apple.","He was still looking at her with a smile, his eyes seeming to suck her in.","The veins on Qiao Nian's forehead twitched, feeling the atmosphere was a little off.","He did it on purpose!","From the moment he entered to everything he said, it was all for this moment...","Qiao Nian had always been a person of action. She narrowed her dark eyes before suddenly leaning over and biting his lips. Hearing his painful inhale, she smiled and was about to speak when someone knocked on the door.","\"Miss Qiao, I brought your hair...\"","Gu San saw they were very close to each other. Most importantly, Master Wang did not resist when Miss Qiao forcefully kissed him.","His eyes widened and he realized he seemed to have seen something he shouldn't have. He hurriedly said, \"I'll place it at the door. Go on... Go on...\"","Then, Qiao Nian only heard a flurry of footsteps. The footsteps gradually faded until they completely disappeared...","Her back was stiff and her head was buzzing. For a moment, she actually forgot to breathe. Poison!","Really!","At this moment, a hand grabbed her waist. Qiao Nian met a pair of affectionate eyes. The person she had forced a kiss on was fine despite his thin lips being moist and red. He pulled her into his arms and sighed. \"I already said that kissing should be like this.\"","Two cool lips came into contact.","Qiao Nian could see his long eyelashes and straight nose... infinitely close to her.","\"Nian Nian, close your eyes.\"","His low voice rang in her ears.","Qiao Nian subconsciously lowered her eyes. Before she could react, a hand covered her eyelids, and Ye Wangchuan's voice entered her ears.","\"This is a kiss.\"","At this moment, the galaxy was overturned!","Half an hour later.","Qiao Nian took another cold shower before coming out of the bathroom. With eyes not as cold as usual, she dragged a chair far away from someone.","Her legs rested on the bottom of the table, and she picked up the lighter from the ground. Her cold and white fingertips flipped the lid open and closed it again.","After a few seconds, completely calm now, she glanced at a certain someone and hesitated before telling him, \"I'm not in a bad mood.\""]},{"number":3400,"title":"Chapter 3400: Master Wang Was Almost Jealous","paragraphs":["\"Hm?\"","The redness at the corners of Ye Wangchuan's eyes had yet to fade, making him look even better. He was like a demon, seducing people to commit crimes.","Qiao Nian only took a glance before retracting her gaze. She coughed awkwardly and touched the bridge of her nose before lowering her eyes. \"Alright, actually, I'm in a bad mood.\"","However, she had never thought of molesting him to vent her bad mood.","Ye Wangchuan sat up straight; the dark sweater looked different on him. \"Why are you in a bad mood? What happened?\"","Qiao Nian rubbed her eyebrows. She subconsciously did not want to say anything, but after a pause, when she looked at him, her frustration did not seem that deep anymore.","\"Elder Zhong called me. Ji Lingfeng seems to be very sick. It's even more serious than I imagined. However, it's hard to say now because even the Pharmacy Association isn't sure if the person who wants that medicine is him. I just have a feeling... that it's him.\"","\"What medicine?\"","Qiao Nian told him.","Then, she briefly explained the effect of this special medicine.","Later, she pursed her lips, and a cold and dry aura surrounded her. \"Elder Zhong said he looked at that person's medical report and found they had been poisoned decades ago. It's a rare slow-acting poison. I heard someone mention it once in Continent F.","\"This drug's specialty is that it's hidden deeply. Usually, unless the poison acts up, it's almost impossible to detect it.","\"Once the poison takes effect, it means that the poison has already corroded the host's internal organs and the host is at the end of his life...\"","Ye Wangchuan listened quietly. At this point, he solemnly asked, \"What poison? Does it have a name?\"","\"Wasp.\" Qiao Nian searched her mind and gave him a name.","A wasp's stinger was the most poisonous to the heart!","Ye Wangchuan nodded slightly. He had taken out his cell phone at some point without her realizing. As he typed the message, he told her, \"I'll get Mo Xi to check.\"","Dark Fort was the best place to investigate things in Continent F.","Actually, Daji could investigate too. However, he was in the diamond business. He could investigate the origins of weapons or the diamond mining industry, but he might not have as deep a contact with people of all walks of life nor as many connections and skills as Mo Xi.","\"Mo Xi knows these things better. As long as there's a name, he has channels to investigate,\" Ye Wangchuan added, afraid she would be worried.","Qiao Nian sighed in relief.","Then, she put down the lighter and picked up her phone. \"I'll ask Auntie Xie too.\"","Ji Nan didn't even know about Ji Lingfeng's situation. In fact, the possibility of Xie Tingyun knowing about Ji Lingfeng's situation was very small.","Qiao Nian only asked tentatively, without much hope.","After sending the message, she looked up and seemed to think of something. \"The birthday party you mentioned just now...\"","Mo Xi must have seen Ye Wangchuan's message, because he immediately called, probably wanting to ask about the specifics.","At her question, Ye Wangchuan naturally hung up on Mo Xi and looked up at her. \"Mm? You're going?\"","Qiao Nian didn't plan to go at first, but after some thought, she got up and walked to the computer. She threw the lighter on the table and turned to him. \"I can't leave for three days, anyway. It's fine to go. By the way, what birthday gift should I prepare?\"","Ye Wangchuan's original intention was to divert her attention. However, seeing that she really planned to go and was even preparing a birthday gift, the corners of his mouth twitched and he almost wanted to pull her back.","He said in a low voice, \"No need, we'll give him one.\""]}]);
